// The Chinese of the config schema's descriptions, by their English text, for config.js. A test in app/workbench
// fails when the schema has a description this lacks, or this holds one the schema no longer has.
//
// 配置 schema 描述的中文，以英文原文为键，供 config.js 使用。schema 中有此处缺少的描述、或此处有 schema 已不再包含的描述时，
// app/workbench 中的测试会失败。
window.FitSchemaZh = {
"\"stdout\", \"stderr\", or the path of a file lines are appended to; \"stdout\" when left out.": "\"stdout\"、\"stderr\" 或追加写入行的文件路径；不设置时为 \"stdout\"。",
"\"stdout\", \"stderr\", or the path of a file messages are appended to, of every logger loggers does not set one for. When left out, debug and info messages go to stdout and warn and error ones to stderr. A change takes a restart.": "\"stdout\"、\"stderr\" 或追加写入消息的文件路径，适用于 loggers 中未单独设置的所有日志记录器。不设置时，debug 和 info 消息输出到 stdout，warn 和 error 消息输出到 stderr。修改后需重启生效。",
"\"stdout\", \"stderr\", or the path of a file the logger's messages are appended to. A change takes a restart.": "\"stdout\"、\"stderr\" 或追加写入该日志记录器消息的文件路径。修改后需重启生效。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the directory's is checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of one's own.": "PEM 文件，包含用于校验该目录证书的证书，取代系统根证书，用于自建 CA。",
"A PEM file with cert_file's private key.": "PEM 文件，包含 cert_file 的私钥。",
"A PEM file with the Admin API's certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the API is served over TLS, 1.2 or later. The files are read again when they change, so that a renewed certificate is served without a restart. Not for a Unix socket.": "PEM 文件，包含 Admin API 的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，API 通过 TLS（1.2 或更高版本）提供服务。文件变化时会重新读取，因此续期后的证书无需重启即可生效。不适用于 Unix 套接字。",
"A PEM file with the API's certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the API is served over TLS.": "PEM 文件，包含 API 的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，API 通过 TLS 提供服务。",
"A PEM file with the CAs Consul's certificate is verified with, over https; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 验证 Consul 证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the CAs that clients' certificates must chain to: with it, every client must present a valid certificate, besides the token, before it is heard. Needs cert_file and key_file; read again when it changes, as they are.": "PEM 文件，包含客户端证书必须链接到的 CA：设置后，每个客户端除令牌外还必须出示有效证书，否则不予受理。需要 cert_file 和 key_file；与它们一样，文件变化时会重新读取。",
"A PEM file with the CAs etcd's certificate is verified with, over https; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 验证 etcd 证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the CAs the receiver's certificate is verified with, over https; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 验证接收端证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the CAs the server's certificate is verified with, over TLS; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 TLS 验证服务器证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the certificate's private key.": "PEM 文件，包含该证书的私钥。",
"A PEM file with the certificate, followed by any intermediates.": "PEM 文件，包含该证书及其后的任何中间证书。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over TLS; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 TLS 发送的客户端证书；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over https, as Consul's verify_incoming asks for; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 发送的客户端证书，即 Consul 的 verify_incoming 所要求的；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over https, as etcd's client-cert-auth asks for; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 发送的客户端证书，即 etcd 的 client-cert-auth 所要求的；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over https; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 发送的客户端证书；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the console's certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the console is served over TLS.": "PEM 文件，包含控制台的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，控制台通过 TLS 提供服务。",
"A PEM file with the pages' certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the pages are served over TLS.": "PEM 文件，包含页面的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，页面通过 TLS 提供服务。",
"A TURN server's password.": "TURN 服务器的密码。",
"A TURN server's username.": "TURN 服务器的用户名。",
"A URL fit asks, with the name in the query as domain=<name>, whether a name may have a certificate: an answer of 2xx allows it, and any other refuses it. Refusals are remembered for a minute. At most 8 asks are under way at once, and 5 a second on average, 20 at once, however they are answered; a handshake past them fails without asking.": "fit 询问某个名称能否获得证书的 URL，名称以 domain=<name> 放在查询参数中：返回 2xx 表示允许，其他均为拒绝。拒绝结果会被记住一分钟。同时进行的询问最多 8 个，平均每秒 5 个、一次最多 20 个，无论应答如何；超出时握手直接失败，不再询问。",
"A directory the install scripts of vendors whose drivers are downloaded by hand look for the packages in, under the vendor's name; the working directory when left out.": "供手动下载驱动的厂商的安装脚本查找软件包的目录，位于厂商名称之下；不设置时为工作目录。",
"A disk tier for the zone: every response kept in memory is written to disk too, on a pool of goroutines of its own, and one the memory no longer holds is read back from disk, on that pool, and kept in memory again. None when left out. Caches of one zone take the disk of the last one loaded.": "该区域的磁盘层：内存中保存的每个响应也会写入磁盘，由其专属的 goroutine 池完成；内存中已不再保留的响应由该池从磁盘读回，并重新保存到内存中。不设置时无磁盘层。同一区域的多个缓存使用最后加载的那个磁盘。",
"A file holding a token that every request must carry, as \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\"; no token is asked for when left out.": "包含令牌的文件，每个请求都必须携带该令牌，形式为 \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\"；不设置时不要求令牌。",
"A file holding the ACL token to send, read each time a watch starts; none when left out. The token needs to read the keys under prefix.": "包含要发送的 ACL 令牌的文件，每次开始监听（watch）时读取；不设置时无令牌。该令牌需要有读取 prefix 下各键的权限。",
"A file holding the ACL token to send, read each time a watch starts; none when left out. The token needs to read the services and nodes served.": "包含要发送的 ACL 令牌的文件，每次开始监听（watch）时读取；不设置时无令牌。该令牌需要有读取所提供的服务和节点的权限。",
"A file holding the ACL token to send, read when fit starts; none when left out. The token needs to read and write the keys under prefix and to make sessions.": "包含要发送的 ACL 令牌的文件，在 fit 启动时读取；不设置时无令牌。该令牌需要有读写 prefix 下各键以及创建会话的权限。",
"A file holding the key's secret, read each time the config is applied; the handler media_tokens rotates this file to refuse just the tokens this key signed. At least 16 bytes, its line breaks at the end aside. Or secret, one of the two.": "保存该密钥 secret 的文件，每次应用配置时读取；处理器 media_tokens 轮换该文件，以只拒绝该密钥签发的 token。至少 16 字节，末尾的换行不计。或 secret，二者取其一。",
"A file holding the password to authenticate with, read at each connection; none when left out.": "包含用于认证的密码的文件，每次连接时读取；不设置时无密码。",
"A file holding the password, its surrounding spaces trimmed.": "包含密码的文件，会去除其前后的空白。",
"A file holding the secret tokens are signed with, read each time the config is applied: the handler media_tokens rotates it, and every token signed before is refused. At least 16 bytes, its line breaks at the end aside. Or secret, one of the two, or keys. None when left out: a random key of the process's signs, which a restart forgets.": "保存签发 token 所用 secret 的文件，每次应用配置时读取：处理器 media_tokens 会轮换它，此前签发的每个 token 都会被拒绝。至少 16 字节，末尾的换行不计。或 secret，二者取其一，或 keys。不设置时无：由进程的随机密钥签名，重启后即失效。",
"A file holding username's password, read each time a watch starts.": "包含 username 的密码的文件，每次开始监听（watch）时读取。",
"A file holding username's password, read each time fit authenticates.": "包含 username 的密码的文件，每次 fit 进行认证时读取。",
"A file of header fields sent with each export, one \"Name: value\" a line, as an API key a receiver asks for; read when fit starts. None when left out.": "包含请求头字段的文件，每次导出时随请求发送，每行一个 \"Name: value\"，例如接收端要求的 API 密钥；在 fit 启动时读取。不设置时无此项。",
"A file whose contents are the secret of tokens signed with HS256, HS384 or HS512; at least 32 bytes.": "其内容为用 HS256、HS384 或 HS512 签名的令牌之密钥的文件；至少 32 字节。",
"A keyring of signing keys, each a name and its secret or secret_file, in place of secret or secret_file: a token is signed with one key and checked against every key, so rotating one key, as the handler media_tokens does, refuses only the tokens that key signed and the others stay good. One of the two: keys, or secret/secret_file. None when left out.": "签名密钥的密钥环，每个密钥有一个名称及其 secret 或 secret_file，用来代替 secret 或 secret_file：token 用一个密钥签名，并用每个密钥校验，所以轮换一个密钥（如处理器 media_tokens 所做）只会拒绝该密钥签发的 token，其他 token 保持有效。二者取其一：keys，或 secret/secret_file。不设置时为无。",
"A kubeconfig file to reach the cluster with: its server, CA, client certificate, token or token file. When left out, the pod's service account, inside the cluster, or else $KUBECONFIG or ~/.kube/config. Exec and auth-provider plugins are not supported.": "用于访问集群的 kubeconfig 文件：使用其中的服务器、CA、客户端证书、令牌或令牌文件。不设置时，在集群内使用 Pod 的服务账号，否则使用 $KUBECONFIG 或 ~/.kube/config。不支持 Exec 和 auth-provider 插件。",
"A name unique among the listeners, by which routes refer to this one.": "在各监听器中唯一的名称，路由通过它引用该监听器。",
"A name unique among the routes, for logs and metrics.": "在各路由中唯一的名称，用于日志和指标。",
"A name unique among the services.": "在各服务中唯一的名称。",
"A name unique among the upstreams, by which handlers refer to this one.": "在各上游中唯一的名称，处理器通过它引用该上游。",
"A note about the model its peers show.": "关于其对端所显示的模型的备注。",
"A note about the node its peers show. Its pages, and a hub that settings.allow_hub_manage lets, change it.": "关于其对端所显示的节点的备注。其页面以及 settings.allow_hub_manage 所允许的中心节点可以修改它。",
"A prefix put before the path, as in \"/v2\".": "加在路径之前的前缀，例如 \"/v2\"。",
"A prefix removed from the request path before it is looked up under the root; a request whose path lacks it gets 404.": "在根目录下查找之前，从请求路径中移除的前缀；路径不含该前缀的请求返回 404。",
"A regular expression in Go's syntax that the path, as escaped (\"/a%20b\", \"/a%2Fb\"), must match for the request to be redirected; the rest go on to the handler. Every request is redirected when left out. A URL made from the request that would leave the site, which to does not, is answered 400: one that starts with \"//\" or \"/\\\", and, when to starts with a group ($1), one with a scheme.": "Go 语法的正则表达式，转义形式的路径（\"/a%20b\"、\"/a%2Fb\"）必须匹配它，请求才会被重定向；其余请求继续交给处理器。不设置时所有请求都被重定向。由请求构成、会离开本站的 URL（to 本身并非如此时）答 400：以 \"//\" 或 \"/\\\" 开头的，以及 to 以分组（$1）开头时带 scheme 的。",
"A regular expression in Go's syntax; each match in the path is replaced with replacement.": "Go 语法的正则表达式；路径中的每处匹配都替换为 replacement。",
"A request field to set to the certificate's subject, as in \"CN=alice,O=Example\", for the handler and the upstream a proxy sends the request to; any the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, is removed, with or without a certificate.": "要设置为证书主题（subject）的请求字段，例如 \"CN=alice,O=Example\"，供处理器以及代理转发请求的上游使用；客户端发送的同名字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）一律被移除，无论是否有证书。",
"A request field to set to the user's name for the handler, and the upstream a proxy sends the request to; any the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, is replaced.": "要设置为用户名的请求字段，供处理器以及代理转发请求的上游使用；客户端发送的同名字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）会被替换。",
"A response that takes longer than this to begin counts as slow; none is when left out.": "开始响应所用时间超过该值的响应计为慢响应；不设置时不统计。",
"A string the plugin reads, for settings of its own.": "插件读取的字符串，用于其自身的设置。",
"A ws or wss listener's path. /tunnel when left out.": "ws 或 wss 监听器的路径。不设置时为 /tunnel。",
"Addresses and prefixes peers may not be at, beyond the internal ranges denied by default; an address with a port denies that port alone.": "加密的 WebSocket，用于将中心节点的控制台页面传送给无法以其他方式访问它们的代理的 web_proxies。需要 console。不设置时无此项。",
"An encrypted WebSocket that carries the hub's console pages to the web_proxies of proxies that cannot reach them otherwise. Needs console. None when left out.": "对端不得位于的地址和前缀，在默认拒绝的内部地址段之外另行添加；带端口的地址仅拒绝该端口。",
"An environment variable holding the password.": "包含密码的环境变量。",
"An expression the request must match, combining matchers with &&, ||, ! and parentheses, as in Host(\"a.example\") && (PathPrefix(\"/api/\") || Method(\"POST\")). Its matchers are Host, Path, PathPrefix, PathRegexp, Method, Header(name, value...), Query(key, value...) and RemoteIP, whose arguments are strings quoted as in Go. It counts as one matcher in the order of routes, and its hosts and paths do not make a route more specific: give it a priority.": "请求必须匹配的表达式，可用 &&、||、! 和括号组合匹配器，例如 Host(\"a.example\") && (PathPrefix(\"/api/\") || Method(\"POST\"))。其匹配器有 Host、Path、PathPrefix、PathRegexp、Method、Header(name, value...)、Query(key, value...) 和 RemoteIP，参数为按 Go 语法加引号的字符串。它在路由排序中算作一个匹配器，其中的主机和路径不会使路由更具体：请为它设置 priority。",
"An upstream that takes the requests when none of the chosen upstream's backends is in rotation, for failing or for its health checks, and one of its own is.": "当所选上游的后端都不在轮转中（因故障或其健康检查）、而它自己有后端在轮转时，接收请求的上游。",
"Anything else the node tells the hubs, which their pages show.": "节点告知中心节点的其他内容，由中心节点的页面显示。",
"Anything else the proxy tells the hubs, which their pages show.": "代理告知中心节点的其他内容，由中心节点的页面显示。",
"Ask clients for certificates and verify them (mutual TLS).": "要求客户端提供证书并验证（双向 TLS）。",
"Audiences of which a token's aud must name one; any when left out.": "令牌的 aud 必须包含其中之一的受众；不设置时接受任意受众。",
"Bounds on the calls the node forwards to its models' upstreams; the defaults when left out.": "对节点转发给其模型上游的调用的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Bounds on the hub's links; the defaults when left out.": "对中心节点各链路的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Bounds on the node's links; the defaults when left out.": "对节点各链路的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Bounds on the proxy's links; the defaults when left out.": "对代理各链路的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Certificates from files. A client is given the first whose names match the one it asks for, or the first of all when none does or it asks for none.": "来自文件的证书。客户端获得名称与其请求的名称相匹配的第一个证书；若无一匹配或客户端未请求名称，则获得全部证书中的第一个。",
"Changes to the request's fields, made before the handler, and the upstream a proxy sends the request to, sees them.": "对请求字段的修改，在处理器之前进行，代理转发请求的上游也能看到这些修改。",
"Changes to the response's fields, made just before it is sent, whichever handler wrote it.": "对响应字段的修改，在响应发出前一刻进行，无论由哪个处理器写出。",
"Connect over TLS.": "通过 TLS 连接。",
"Count and time requests by listener and route, for the Admin API's /metrics, which serves the rest of fit's metrics without it; off when left out, since it costs every request a little. Needs admin.": "按监听器和路由统计请求数量与耗时，供 Admin API 的 /metrics 使用；没有它时 /metrics 仍提供 fit 的其余指标；不设置时关闭，因为这会给每个请求增加少许开销。需要 admin。",
"Destinations refused, written as in allow, whatever allow holds.": "被拒绝的目标，写法同 allow，无论 allow 中有什么。",
"Destinations refused, written as in allow, whatever allow holds: a host name that resolves to an address deny holds is refused once it is connected, before anything is sent.": "被拒绝的目标，写法同 allow，无论 allow 中有什么：解析到 deny 所含地址的主机名，在连接建立后、发送任何数据之前即被拒绝。",
"Do not serve the dashboard, the read-only web pages at /dashboard/ that show the routes, services, upstreams and their health, certificates and config versions from the Admin API's GET endpoints; served when left out or false.": "不提供仪表盘，即位于 /dashboard/ 的只读网页，通过 Admin API 的 GET 端点展示路由、服务、上游及其健康状况、证书和配置版本；不设置或为 false 时提供。",
"Each address's weight, in the order of addresses: its share of requests under weighted_round_robin, and how many requests it takes to be as busy as an address of weight 1 under least_conn. 1 each when left out.": "各地址的权重，顺序与 addresses 一致：在 weighted_round_robin 下是其获得请求的份额，在 least_conn 下是它需要承担多少请求才算与权重为 1 的地址同样繁忙。不设置时各为 1。",
"Encodings whose compressed twins, name.br, name.zst and name.gz, are served in place of a file to a client that accepts them: the one it prefers by Accept-Encoding, and among equals the first listed. None when left out.": "编码列表，对于接受这些编码的客户端，其压缩副本 name.br、name.zst 和 name.gz 会取代原文件被提供：按客户端 Accept-Encoding 的偏好选择，偏好相同时取列表中靠前的。不设置时无此项。",
"Encrypt every session with this passphrase, 10 to 79 characters, which callers must have too (pbkeylen 16). Unencrypted when left out.": "用此口令加密每个会话，10 到 79 个字符，调用方也必须持有（pbkeylen 为 16）。不设置时不加密。",
"Export the metrics the Admin API's /metrics serves, requests counted included, every interval. No metrics over OTLP when left out.": "每隔一个 interval 导出 Admin API 的 /metrics 所提供的指标，包括请求计数。不设置时不通过 OTLP 导出指标。",
"Fields copied from a 2xx answer onto the request, for the handler and the upstream a proxy sends it to. Any of these the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, are removed, so that it cannot pass them off as the auth service's.": "从 2xx 应答复制到请求上的字段，供处理器以及代理转发请求的上游使用。客户端发送的这些字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）会被移除，使其无法冒充为认证服务所设。",
"Fields to delete: names, or a prefix ending in \"*\", as in \"X-Debug-*\".": "要删除的字段：名称，或以 \"*\" 结尾的前缀，例如 \"X-Debug-*\"。",
"Fields to set, each replacing any of the same name.": "要设置的字段，每个都会替换同名的任何字段。",
"Files and directories left out, by pattern, as files writes them, as trailers or **/extras/**; a directory left out is not walked. None when left out.": "按模式略去的文件和目录，写法与 files 相同，如 trailers 或 **/extras/**；被略去的目录不会被遍历。不设置时为无。",
"Follow symbolic links that lead out of the library's roots. A link that stays within its root is followed either way; one that leads out is refused, and reported, when left out or false.": "跟随指向媒体库根目录之外的符号链接。留在其根目录之内的链接无论如何都会被跟随；不设置或为 false 时，指向外部的链接会被拒绝并报告。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin given the response's body, how much of it the plugin may hold, pausing it to see more, or make it; past it the response fails, or goes on without the plugin when on_error is skip. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "对于获得响应体的 Proxy-Wasm 插件，插件最多可持有多少响应体，暂停以查看更多内容或自行生成；超出后响应失败，或在 on_error 为 skip 时不经该插件继续。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin that exports response callbacks, which it is given: all, the header, the body and the trailer; headers, the header alone, the body going by untouched; none, none of them, the plugin forgetting each request once it has gone on. all when left out.": "对于导出响应回调的 Proxy-Wasm 插件，它获得哪些内容：all，响应头、响应体和尾部（trailer）；headers，仅响应头，响应体原样通过；none，都不提供，请求继续后插件即忘记该请求。不设置时为 all。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin that follows responses, how many an instance follows at once, each keeping its context; past it a request is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "对于跟踪响应的 Proxy-Wasm 插件，一个实例同时可跟踪多少个，各自保留其上下文；超出后请求返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin, its VM configuration, which it reads as it starts; config is its plugin configuration.": "对于 Proxy-Wasm 插件，其 VM 配置，插件在启动时读取；config 是其插件配置。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin, properties it reads by their path (proxy_get_property), beside the request's own: request.path, request.url_path, request.query, request.host, request.method, request.scheme, request.protocol, source.address and plugin_name.": "对于 Proxy-Wasm 插件，除请求自身的属性外，它按路径读取（proxy_get_property）的属性：request.path、request.url_path、request.query、request.host、request.method、request.scheme、request.protocol、source.address 和 plugin_name。",
"Further URLs the publish and play pages show for a stream, for tools outside the browser, as the streaming role's RTMP, RTSP, SRT and HTTP-FLV ones: {stream} stands for the stream's name, {token} for the page's token, {host} for the host the page was loaded from.": "发布页和播放页为流额外显示的 URL，供浏览器之外的工具使用，如流媒体角色的 RTMP、RTSP、SRT 和 HTTP-FLV 地址：{stream} 代表流的名称，{token} 代表页面的 token，{host} 代表页面加载自的主机。",
"Gzip a file when it is rotated. On when left out.": "切割时用 gzip 压缩文件。不设置时为开启。",
"HTTPS by default: a config that writes no listeners is served over HTTPS on port 443, with certificates obtained with acme for the host names its routes match, and over HTTP on port 80 only to be redirected; a listener whose tls is empty gets certificates for the host names of the routes it serves. On when left out.": "默认启用 HTTPS：未写任何监听器的配置，通过 HTTPS 在 443 端口提供服务，用 acme 为其路由所匹配的主机名获取证书，并仅为重定向而在 80 端口提供 HTTP；tls 为空的监听器会为其所服务路由的主机名获取证书。不设置时为开启。",
"Headers the request must have, each with one of the values listed as the value of one of its fields, or with any value when none are listed. Names ignore case; values do not.": "请求必须具有的请求头，每个请求头的值须是所列值之一，未列出值时可为任意值。名称不区分大小写；值区分大小写。",
"Host names to obtain certificates for with ACME, as the top-level acme says, through its challenges: the CA must reach fit at each name on port 80, where any listener of fit's in the clear answers HTTP-01, or on port 443, where this listener answers TLS-ALPN-01. A client asking for one of these names is given its certificate once there is one; until then, and for other names, the certificates from files.": "通过 ACME 获取证书的主机名，如顶层 acme 所述，经由其挑战（challenge）：CA 必须能在 80 端口访问到各名称对应的 fit，fit 的任何明文监听器在该端口应答 HTTP-01；或在 443 端口，由此监听器应答 TLS-ALPN-01。请求这些名称之一的客户端，在证书就绪后获得该证书；在此之前以及对其他名称，使用来自文件的证书。",
"Host names, exact, or with a leading \"*.\" wildcard, which stands for one label, or a leading \"**.\" wildcard, which stands for one label or more, as the Gateway API's wildcards do.": "主机名，可为精确名称，或以 \"*.\" 通配符开头（代表一个标签），或以 \"**.\" 通配符开头（代表一个或多个标签），与 Gateway API 的通配符一致。",
"How a request's line is written, with the same fields whichever: json, a JSON object; text, time, level, msg and the fields as key=value (logfmt); or line, the time and level, then the fields as key=value, as fit's own log writes lines. A request's level is its status's, as level says. json when left out. A change takes a restart.": "请求行的写法，无论哪种都含相同字段：json，JSON 对象；text，time、level、msg 及各字段，以 key=value 形式（logfmt）；line，先是时间和级别，再是各字段的 key=value，与 fit 自身日志的行格式相同。请求的级别取决于其状态，如 level 所述。不设置时为 json。修改后需重启生效。",
"How certificates are obtained during handshakes, for listeners whose tls sets on_demand: whom to ask whether a name may have one, and how fast and how many.": "握手期间如何获取证书，针对 tls 设置了 on_demand 的监听器：向谁询问某名称能否获得证书，以及速率和数量限制。",
"How certificates for the names listeners list in tls.acme are obtained and renewed; the defaults when left out. Its settings are read when fit starts: a change to them takes effect when fit restarts. The names follow every reload.": "对各监听器在 tls.acme 中列出的名称，如何获取和续期证书；不设置时使用默认值。其设置在 fit 启动时读取：修改后需重启 fit 才生效。名称则在每次重新加载时更新。",
"How each event loop waits while none of its connections has an event ready: park, in Go's network poller, which gives the loop's CPU to other work at once, but on a busy server looks for the loop's events only when a CPU runs out of work or every 10ms; or block, in epoll_wait, which wakes the loop as soon as one arrives. Choose block for a shorter latency tail near saturation over HTTP/1.1, at the cost of the median and a little h2 throughput: proxying an API at 200,000 requests a second on 6 CPUs, block took the HTTP/1.1 p99 from 4.3 to 2.9-3.9ms and the median from 0.95 to 1.57ms, left h2 and the maximum as they were, and served h2 0.9% less at saturation. Linux only. park when left out.": "每个事件循环在其连接都没有就绪事件时如何等待：park，在 Go 的网络轮询器中挂起，立即把该循环的 CPU 让给其他工作，但在繁忙的服务器上，只有某个 CPU 没有工作可做时或每 10ms 才会查看该循环的事件；或 block，在 epoll_wait 中等待，事件一到即被唤醒。若要在接近饱和时缩短 HTTP/1.1 的延迟尾部，可选 block，代价是中位延迟和少量 h2 吞吐：在 6 个 CPU 上以每秒 200,000 个请求代理 API 时，block 使 HTTP/1.1 的 p99 从 4.3 降至 2.9-3.9ms，中位延迟从 0.95 升至 1.57ms，h2 与最大值不变，饱和时 h2 少处理 0.9%。仅限 Linux。未设置时为 park。",
"How far back requests are counted, in ten steps; 10s when left out.": "请求统计回溯多久，分十步；不设置时为 10s。",
"How far exp and nbf may be off, for clocks that differ; none when left out.": "exp 和 nbf 允许偏差多少，用于时钟不一致的情况；不设置时不允许偏差。",
"How fib, the network engine fit serves and dials on, is set up: its event loops, workers and buffers. fib's own defaults for what is left out, and for all of it when engine is. Read when fit starts: a change takes effect when fit restarts.": "fib 的设置方式，fib 是 fit 用于监听和拨出的网络引擎：其事件循环、工作线程和缓冲区。未设置的部分使用 fib 自身的默认值，engine 未设置时全部如此。在 fit 启动时读取：修改后需重启 fit 才生效。",
"How hard the compressors work: fastest, default (gzip 5, zstd's default, brotli 4) or better (gzip 7, zstd's better, brotli 6); default when left out.": "压缩器的压缩力度：fastest、default（gzip 5、zstd 的默认级别、brotli 4）或 better（gzip 7、zstd 的 better、brotli 6）；不设置时为 default。",
"How large a file may grow before it is rotated: a write that would take it past this starts a new file. 1 GiB when left out; 0 does not rotate by size.": "文件长到多大后切割：会使文件超过该值的写入会先开始一个新文件。不设置时为 1 GiB；0 表示不按大小切割。",
"How long a QUIC connection may hear nothing from its peer before it is closed. 30s when left out.": "QUIC 连接在多久收不到对端任何消息后关闭。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a QUIC handshake may take. 10s when left out.": "QUIC 握手最多可用多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a TCP or TLS client's connection may stay open without an allocation, before its first Allocate or after its allocation ended, before it is closed. 30s when left out. A change starts a new server.": "TCP 或 TLS 客户端的连接，在没有分配（allocation）的情况下可保持打开多久，即首次 Allocate 之前或其分配结束之后，超时即关闭。不设置时为 30s。修改后会启动新的服务器。",
"How long a WHEP offer may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, its request held, before it is answered 404. Answered 404 at once when left out.": "WHEP offer 等待尚无发布者的流所允许的时长（其请求会被挂起），超时后返回 404。不设置时立即返回 404。",
"How long a call may run; past it the call is stopped and its instance replaced, and the request goes as a failure does (on_error). 100ms when left out.": "一次调用最多可运行多久；超时则调用被停止、其实例被替换，请求按失败处理（on_error）。不设置时为 100ms。",
"How long a call may wait for its response to begin. 5m when left out.": "一次调用等待其响应开始最多可多久。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long a client may take from connecting to publishing or playing. 10s when left out.": "客户端从连接到发布或播放所允许的时长。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a connect to a service may take; shorter than a hub's call_timeout, so that the hub hears either way. 5s when left out.": "连接到服务最多可用多久；短于中心节点的 call_timeout，使中心节点无论如何都能收到结果。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a connected peer may be silent, its media and ICE consent checks alike, before its session is ended: a publisher's ends its stream and its viewers. 30s when left out.": "已连接的对端可保持静默多久（媒体和 ICE 同意检查均计入），超时则结束其会话：发布者的会话结束时，其流及其观看者也随之结束。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a connection or a udp session may carry nothing either way before both sides are closed; 10m for a connection and 1m for a udp session when left out.": "连接或 udp 会话在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则两侧都被关闭；不设置时，连接为 10m，udp 会话为 1m。",
"How long a connection to an upstream may take. 10s when left out.": "到上游的连接最多可用多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a connection without a session may go without a request before it is closed. 60s when left out.": "没有会话的连接在无请求的情况下可保持多久，超时后关闭。不设置时为 60s。",
"How long a file is written before it is rotated, at the next period boundary of the log's time_zone: 24h turns at midnight, 1h on the hour; a fraction of a second, or a period over 24h that is not a whole number of days, is refused. Off when left out.": "一个文件写多久后切割，在日志 time_zone 的下一个周期边界切割：24h 在午夜切割，1h 在整点切割；小于 1 秒、或超过 24h 但不是整天数的间隔会被拒绝。不设置时不按时间切割。",
"How long a handshake waits for its name's certificate, as long as fib's handshake timeout by default. 10s when left out.": "握手等待其名称的证书最多多久，默认与 fib 的握手超时相同。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a job may wait for the file pool before it is given up, as a request answered 503. 10s when left out.": "作业等待文件池的最长时间，超过即放弃，相应的请求答 503。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a job, an action or an install, may run before it is killed, 10s to 168h. 1h when left out.": "一个作业、操作或安装最多可运行多久，超时则被终止，范围 10s 到 168h。不设置时为 1h。",
"How long a line may wait in the buffer before it is written; 1s when left out.": "一行日志在缓冲区中最多等待多久后写出；不设置时为 1s。",
"How long a link may hear nothing before it is pinged; one that hears nothing for three of them is closed. 15s when left out.": "链路在多久收不到任何消息后发送 ping；连续三个这样的间隔都没有收到任何消息则关闭该链路。不设置时为 15s。",
"How long a link may take to register once it is open; it is closed past it. 10s when left out.": "链路在打开后最多可用多久完成注册；超时则关闭。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a link waits after a failed dial, or a lost hub, before it dials again. 3s when left out.": "链路在拨号失败或丢失中心节点后，等待多久再重新拨号。不设置时为 3s。",
"How long a link's dial may take. 5s when left out.": "链路拨号最多可用多久。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a lock outlives an instance that stopped holding it without giving it back; its holder renews it every third of that. At least 10s; 30s when left out.": "锁在持有它的实例停止持有却未归还后，还能存续多久；其持有者每隔该时长的三分之一续期一次。至少 10s；不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a login lasts at most, however busy. 12h when left out.": "一次登录最长持续多久，无论多忙。不设置时为 12h。",
"How long a login lasts without a request. 30m when left out.": "一次登录在没有请求的情况下持续多久。不设置时为 30m。",
"How long a member stays in its room without a heartbeat: the pages send one every third of it. 30s when left out.": "成员在没有心跳的情况下可留在房间多久：页面每隔其三分之一时长发送一次心跳。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a name taken on demand is kept, and renewed, with no handshake asking for it; then it is dropped and no longer counts against max_names, and its certificate stays in the storage for the next handshake that asks for it, which the ask URL must allow again. 168h, a week, when left out.": "按需获取的名称在没有握手请求它的情况下，被保留并续期多久；之后它被丢弃，不再计入 max_names，其证书仍保留在存储中，供下一个请求它的握手使用，而 ask URL 必须再次允许该名称。不设置时为 168h，即一周。",
"How long a node may take to answer the hub: to open a tunnel, or to list or set its services. 15s when left out.": "节点最多可用多久应答中心节点：打开隧道，或列出、设置其服务。不设置时为 15s。",
"How long a nonce is good for; a request with an older one is answered 438 with a fresh one. 10m when left out. Applies to the next nonce.": "随机数（nonce）的有效期；带有更旧随机数的请求会收到 438 和一个新的随机数。不设置时为 10m。适用于下一个随机数。",
"How long a peer may send nothing, keep-alives included, before its session ends. 5s when left out.": "对端在不发送任何数据（包括保活）的情况下可保持多久，超时后其会话结束。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a ping may go unanswered before it counts as lost. 5s when left out.": "ping 最多可无应答多久，超时则计为丢失。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a ping may wait for its pong, behind everything sent before it, before the link is taken for too slow and closed. 30s when left out.": "ping 在排在它之前发送的所有内容之后，最多等待其 pong 多久，超时则认为链路过慢并关闭。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a player may outlive its stream's publisher, waiting for the next one. A player ends with its publisher when left out.": "播放器在其流的发布者离开后可继续存活多久，以等待下一个发布者。不设置时，播放器随其发布者一同结束。",
"How long a player may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, or for the next one after its publisher leaves. 404 at once for a stream without a publisher when left out.": "播放器等待尚无发布者的流、或等待发布者离开后的下一个发布者所允许的时长。不设置时，对没有发布者的流立即返回 404。",
"How long a player may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, or for the next one after its publisher leaves. A caller playing a stream without a publisher is rejected with 1404 when left out.": "播放器等待尚无发布者的流、或等待发布者离开后的下一个发布者所允许的时长。不设置时，播放没有发布者的流的调用方会被 1404 拒绝。",
"How long a player may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, or for the next one after its publisher leaves. A play of a stream without a publisher fails at once when left out.": "播放器等待尚无发布者的流、或等待发布者离开后的下一个发布者所允许的时长。不设置时，播放没有发布者的流会立即失败。",
"How long a playlist request may wait for a stream with no publisher yet. 404 at once when left out.": "播放列表请求等待尚无发布者的流所允许的时长。不设置时立即返回 404。",
"How long a probe may take, connecting included, before it fails; 2s when left out. No longer than interval.": "一次探测（包括连接）最多可用多久，超时则失败；不设置时为 2s。不得超过 interval。",
"How long a proxied connection may carry nothing either way before both sides are closed. 5m when left out.": "被代理的连接在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则两侧都被关闭。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long a publisher may send nothing, and a player's output not move, before its connection is closed. 30s when left out.": "发布者在不发送任何数据、播放器的输出也不前进的情况下可保持多久，超时后关闭其连接。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a relayed peer address may send nothing before its relay is closed, whatever its media server sends it; ICE's consent checks, every 5 seconds or so, keep a live one open. 30s when left out.": "被中继的对端地址在没有发送任何数据的情况下，其中继可保持多久后被关闭，无论其媒体服务器向它发送了什么；ICE 的同意检查约每 5 秒一次，可使存活的中继保持打开。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a request may wait for an instance; past it it is answered 503. 1s when left out.": "请求等待实例最多可多久；超时则返回 503。不设置时为 1s。",
"How long a request waits for another's fetch of its response before it goes on to fetch for itself. 5s when left out.": "请求等待另一个请求为其获取响应最多多久，之后改为自行获取。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a response is fresh for when it gives no lifetime of its own (no s-maxage, max-age or Expires) and its status allows one to be assumed (200, 203, 300, 301, 308, 404, 405, 410, 414, 501): in place of a tenth of the time since its Last-Modified, at most a day, which is used when this is left out.": "响应在没有给出自身生存期（无 s-maxage、max-age 或 Expires）且其状态允许假定一个生存期（200、203、300、301、308、404、405、410、414、501）时，保持新鲜多久：取代自其 Last-Modified 起经过时间的十分之一（至多一天，未设置本项时使用此值）。",
"How long a response may wait for its client to take what it was sent, each time it waits, before the client loses it: its HTTP/1 connection closed, its HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 stream reset. A client that keeps reading, however slowly, is not cut off, and nor is a response that has nothing to send. 30s when left out.": "响应每次等待其客户端接收已发送的内容时，最多可等待多久，超时则客户端丢失该响应：其 HTTP/1 连接被关闭，其 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3 流被重置。无论多慢，只要客户端持续读取就不会被切断，没有内容可发送的响应也不会。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a revoke may wait for the secret file's write before it is answered 504; the write, one at a time on a pool of its own, never blocks a worker. 10s when left out.": "一次吊销在返回 504 之前等待 secret 文件写入的最长时间；写入在自己的线程池上一次一个，从不阻塞 worker。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a room's event stream may wait for its browser to take what it was sent before it is cut off. 30s when left out.": "房间的事件流等待其浏览器接收已发送内容所允许的时长，超时后被切断。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a rotated file is kept after it was last written: 720h (30 days) when left out; 0 keeps it until a count or size limit removes it.": "切割出的文件在最后一次写入后保留多久：不设置时为 720h（30 天）；0 表示一直保留，直到数量或总大小上限将其删除。",
"How long a session is kept with nothing relayed for it: from its answer until its peer's first request, and after its last relay ends. Its ufrags are forgotten then, and its URL answers 404. 30s when left out.": "会话在没有任何内容为其中继时保留多久：从其应答到对端的第一个请求，以及其最后一次中继结束之后。届时其 ufrag 被遗忘，其 URL 返回 404。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a session may go without a request, RTCP or, while recording, RTP before it and its connection end; clients are told so in the Session header and send keep-alives. 60s when left out.": "会话在没有请求、RTCP（录制时还包括 RTP）的情况下可保持多久，超时后会话及其连接结束；客户端会在 Session 头中得知该时长并发送保活。不设置时为 60s。",
"How long a session may take from its answer to a connected PeerConnection before it is ended. 30s when left out.": "会话从其应答到连接上 PeerConnection 最多可用多久，超时则结束。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a session may take from its answer to a connected PeerConnection before it is ended; once connected, ICE consent bounds it. 15s when left out.": "会话从其应答到 PeerConnection 建立连接所允许的时长，超时则结束会话；连接建立后由 ICE consent 约束。不设置时为 15s。",
"How long a stream's segmenting runs without a request before it stops. 30s when left out.": "流的切片在没有请求的情况下运行多久后停止。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a stream, as a model call relayed between roles, may carry nothing either way before it ends. 2m when left out.": "流（即在各角色之间中继的模型调用）在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则结束。不设置时为 2m。",
"How long a token fit issues is good for, unless fit media-token's -ttl says otherwise. 12h when left out.": "fit 签发的 token 的有效期，除非 fit media-token 的 -ttl 另行指定。不设置时为 12h。",
"How long a tunnel may carry nothing either way before it and its connection to the destination are closed. 5m when left out.": "隧道在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则它及其到目标的连接都被关闭。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long a tunnel may carry nothing either way before it is closed. 2h when left out.": "隧道在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则关闭。不设置时为 2h。",
"How long a tunnel, as a WebSocket the proxy has joined to its upstream is, may carry nothing either way before it is closed; 10m when left out.": "隧道（即代理已与其上游连接起来的 WebSocket）在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则关闭；不设置时为 10m。",
"How long a whole response may take, from sending the request to the end of its body; 1h when left out. A request past it before its response began gets 504, and one past it later is cut short.": "整个响应最多可用多久，从发送请求到其响应体结束；不设置时为 1h。响应开始之前超时的请求得到 504，之后超时的则被截断。",
"How long an export may take, connecting included; a batch not sent by then is dropped and counted. 10s when left out.": "一次导出最多可用多久（包括连接）；到时尚未发出的批次被丢弃并计数。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long an idle connection is kept before it is closed; 60s when left out.": "空闲连接在被关闭前保留多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long an idle connection is kept; 60s when left out.": "空闲连接保留多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long an upstream may go silent in the middle of its response before the call is cut short. 5m when left out.": "上游在响应中途可静默多久，超时则调用被截断。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long an upstream may take to begin its response, from when the call starts, its connect included, as a model reading a long prompt does. 5m when left out.": "上游从调用开始（含其连接）到开始响应最多可用多久，例如模型读取长提示词时。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long connecting may take; 5s when left out. A request that times out connecting is answered 504.": "连接最多可用多久；不设置时为 5s。连接超时的请求返回 504。",
"How long each request to Consul may take, connecting included, beyond the five minutes a blocking query waits for a change. 10s when left out.": "向 Consul 发出的每个请求最多可用多久（包括连接），阻塞查询等待变更的五分钟除外。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long each request to etcd may take, connecting included, and a watch to start; a watch then lasts until it fails. 10s when left out.": "向 etcd 发出的每个请求最多可用多久（包括连接），以及一次监听（watch）的启动；监听启动后持续到其失败为止。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long each request to the API server may take, but watches, which last five minutes each. 10s when left out.": "向 API 服务器发出的每个请求最多可用多久，但监听（watch）除外，其每次持续五分钟。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long each request to the CA may take. 30s when left out.": "向 CA 发出的每个请求最多可用多久。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long each request to the store may take, connecting included. 10s when left out.": "向存储发出的每个请求最多可用多久（包括连接）。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long from the start of one probe of an address to the start of the next; 5s when left out.": "从一次对某地址的探测开始，到下一次探测开始之间间隔多久；不设置时为 5s。",
"How long it stays open before letting requests through to try; 30s when left out.": "熔断后保持打开多久，之后才放行请求进行试探；不设置时为 30s。",
"How long listing the containers may take, connecting included. 10s when left out.": "列出容器最多可用多久（包括连接）。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long obtaining one certificate may take, challenges included, before it is given up and tried again later. 10m when left out.": "获取一个证书最多可用多久（包括挑战），超时则放弃并稍后重试。不设置时为 10m。",
"How long opening a connection may take; 10s when left out. A request whose connect times out gets 504.": "建立连接最多可用多长时间；不设置时为 10s。连接超时的请求返回 504。",
"How long past its lifetime a response may still be answered when fetching it again fails, with no response or a 500, 502, 503 or 504, for a response that does not say how long itself (Cache-Control stale-if-error, RFC 5861). None when left out.": "当重新获取响应失败（无响应，或返回 500、502、503、504）时，对于自身未声明时长的响应，在其生命周期结束后仍可继续应答多久（Cache-Control stale-if-error，RFC 5861）。不设置时为无。",
"How long past its lifetime a response may still be answered while the cache fetches it again in the background, for a response that does not say how long itself (Cache-Control stale-while-revalidate, RFC 5861). None when left out. A response that says must-revalidate, proxy-revalidate or s-maxage is never answered stale.": "当缓存在后台重新获取响应时，对于自身未声明时长的响应，在其生命周期结束后仍可继续应答多久（Cache-Control stale-while-revalidate，RFC 5861）。不设置时为无。声明了 must-revalidate、proxy-revalidate 或 s-maxage 的响应绝不会以过期状态应答。",
"How long resolving and connecting to a destination may take. 10s when left out.": "解析并连接目标最多可用多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long resolving and connecting to a destination may take; past it the request is answered 504. 10s when left out.": "解析并连接目标最多可用多长时间；超时则请求返回 504。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long segments are: a stream with video is cut at the first key frame after it. Set it to the key frame interval. 2s when left out.": "分片的时长：含视频的流在其后的第一个关键帧处切分。应设置为关键帧间隔。不设置时为 2s。",
"How long the TURN credentials an answer carries are good for. 1h when left out.": "应答所携带的 TURN 凭据的有效时长。不设置时为 1h。",
"How long the application may go silent in the middle of a response; 60s when left out.": "应用在响应中途最多可静默多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long the application may take to begin its response; 60s when left out.": "应用开始响应最多可花多长时间；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long the client keeps the cookie, as its Max-Age; until the browser closes when left out.": "客户端保留该 cookie 的时长，即其 Max-Age；不设置时到浏览器关闭为止。",
"How long the hub may take to answer a registration or a call. 10s when left out.": "中心节点应答一次注册或调用最多可花多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long the opening of a tunnel may take, through the hub to the node and on to the service. 20s when left out.": "打开一条隧道（经中心节点到节点，再到服务）最多可花多长时间。不设置时为 20s。",
"How long the upstream may go silent in the middle of a response body; 60s when left out.": "上游在响应体中途最多可静默多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long the upstream may take, once the request is sent, to begin its response; 60s when left out. A request past it gets 504.": "请求发出后，上游开始响应最多可花多长时间；不设置时为 60s。超时的请求返回 504。",
"How long to wait for the auth service's answer, after which the request is answered 504 Gateway Timeout; 10s when left out. A service that cannot be reached is answered 502 Bad Gateway.": "等待认证服务应答的时长，超时后请求返回 504 Gateway Timeout；不设置时为 10s。无法连接的服务返回 502 Bad Gateway。",
"How long what the handler learned of a request path, the file it names and its validators, is trusted before the disk is looked at again; a change on disk shows within it. 1s when left out.": "处理器所获知的请求路径、其对应的文件及其校验信息，在再次查看磁盘之前被信任多久；磁盘上的变更会在此时间内体现。不设置时为 1s。",
"How many bytes of files are kept in memory at most; 64 MiB when left out.": "内存中最多保留多少字节的文件；不设置时为 64 MiB。",
"How many bytes of lines may wait to be written; lines past it are dropped. 4 MiB when left out.": "最多可有多少字节的行等待写入；超出的行会被丢弃。不设置时为 4 MiB。",
"How many bytes of responses may wait, across every connection, for clients to take them, the backpressure on them all; past it, every connection stops reading until some go. A number of bytes, or a share of the memory fit may use, such as \"25%\": the machine's, or the container's memory limit where that is lower. Takes effect at start, not on a reload. \"50%\" when left out or 0; 256 MiB where the memory cannot be read.": "所有连接上最多可有多少字节的响应等待客户端接收，即对全部连接的背压；超出后，所有连接都会停止读取，直到有部分被取走。可为字节数，或 fit 可用内存的占比，如 \"25%\"：取本机内存，或容器内存限制（若更低）。启动时生效，重新加载不生效。不设置或为 0 时为 \"50%\"；无法读取内存时为 256 MiB。",
"How many certificates are obtained at once; the rest wait their turn. 2 when left out or 0.": "同时获取多少个证书；其余的排队等待。不设置或为 0 时为 2。",
"How many certificates may be obtained every interval; a handshake past it fails. 10 when left out or 0.": "每个间隔内可获取多少个证书；超出后握手失败。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"How many event loops each engine waits for its connections' events on, which spread the waits, accepts and wake-ups over cores; the connections' work runs on the workers either way. fib's default when left out or 0: 1 on up to 4 CPUs, 2 on up to 16, and the CPUs divided by 8 on more. Windows has one loop whatever this says.": "每个引擎用多少个事件循环等待其连接的事件，这些循环将等待、accept 和唤醒分散到各个核心上；无论如何，连接的工作都在工作线程上运行。不设置或为 0 时取 fib 的默认值：最多 4 个 CPU 时为 1，最多 16 个时为 2，更多时为 CPU 数除以 8。Windows 无论此值为何都只有一个循环。",
"How many failed requests to an address within fail_timeout take it out of rotation for fail_timeout, as nginx's max_fails does: a connect that failed, an upstream that broke off or timed out. 1 when left out; 0 keeps every address in rotation.": "在 fail_timeout 内对某地址有多少次失败请求，就将其移出轮转 fail_timeout 的时间，与 nginx 的 max_fails 相同：连接失败、上游中断或超时。不设置时为 1；0 表示所有地址始终保持在轮转中。",
"How many idle connections to one address are kept for later requests; 32 when left out, and 0 keeps none.": "为后续请求保留多少个到同一地址的空闲连接；不设置时为 32，0 表示不保留。",
"How many instances of the plugin run calls at once, each with its own memory: the CPUs fit has, at most 16, when left out or 0.": "插件同时运行多少个调用实例，每个实例有各自的内存：不设置或为 0 时为 fit 可用的 CPU 数，最多 16。",
"How many links to the hub carry tunnels; each tunnel goes over one throughout. 10 when left out or 0.": "多少条到中心节点的链路承载隧道；每条隧道始终走其中一条。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"How many members a room may have; a join past it is answered 503. A room may have twice as many watchers, its members' event streams among them. 16 when left out.": "一个房间最多可有多少成员；超出的加入请求返回 503。房间的观看者可多一倍，成员的事件流也计算在内。不设置时为 16。",
"How many names may have certificates obtained on demand, in all; past it, a handshake for another fails. 1000 when left out or 0.": "总共最多允许按需获取多少个名称的证书；超出后，对其他名称的握手失败。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How many of the configs applied, the running one included, are kept to be read back. 10 when left out or 0.": "保留多少份已应用的配置（含当前运行的）以供回读。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"How many probes in a row must fail to take an address out of rotation; 2 when left out or 0.": "连续多少次探测失败才将某地址移出轮转；不设置或为 0 时为 2。",
"How many probes in a row must pass to put an address that was out back in; 2 when left out or 0.": "连续多少次探测通过才将已移出的地址放回轮转；不设置或为 0 时为 2。",
"How many requests a key may make at once, after it has been idle: the bucket's size. The rate, rounded up, when left out.": "某个键在空闲之后可一次发出多少个请求：即令牌桶的容量。不设置时为向上取整后的速率。",
"How many requests a second each key may make, on average; at least 0.001.": "每个键平均每秒可发出多少个请求；至少为 0.001。",
"How many requests it lets through, half-open, that must all fare well for it to close; 5 when left out. Others are answered 503 meanwhile.": "半开状态下放行多少个请求，这些请求必须全部成功才会关闭；不设置时为 5。其间其他请求返回 503。",
"How many requests may wait for a connection to one address once its max_conns are busy; one past it is answered 503 at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "当某地址的 max_conns 个连接都在忙时，最多有多少个请求可等待到该地址的连接；超出的请求立即返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How many requests may wait for a connection when max_conns are busy; past it a request is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "当 max_conns 个连接都在忙时，最多有多少个请求可等待连接；超出后请求返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How many requests may wait for an instance; past it a request is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "最多有多少个请求可等待实例；超出后请求返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How many requests the window must have counted before it can open; 20 when left out.": "窗口须统计多少个请求之后才可打开；不设置时为 20。",
"How many responses are compressed at once; past it, responses go uncompressed, so that the compressors' memory, a few hundred kilobytes each, is bounded. 1024 when left out.": "同时压缩多少个响应；超出后响应不再压缩，以便限制压缩器的内存（每个几百 KB）。不设置时为 1024。",
"How many rooms may have members or watchers at once; a join or a watch past it is answered 503. 64 when left out.": "同时允许多少个房间有成员或观看者；超出的加入或观看请求返回 503。不设置时为 64。",
"How many segments a playlist lists. 6 when left out or 0.": "一个播放列表列出多少个分片。不设置或为 0 时为 6。",
"How many tasks each engine's pool holds waiting for a worker. fib's default, which follows its workers, when left out or 0.": "每个引擎的池中最多有多少个任务等待工作线程。不设置或为 0 时取 fib 的默认值，该值随其工作线程数而定。",
"How many times a request may be sent again after the first; 2 when left out.": "首次之后，一个请求最多可重新发送多少次；不设置时为 2。",
"How many workers an idle pool keeps, rather than retiring every one and starting them again when work arrives. None when left out or 0.": "空闲的池保留多少个工作线程，而不是全部退出再在有工作到来时重新启动。不设置或为 0 时为无。",
"How messages are written, those of every logger loggers does not set one for, as fib writes its own: line, the time, level and message, then the attributes as key=value; text, every part as key=value (logfmt); or json, a JSON object a line. Each carries the logger's name as logger. line when left out. A change takes a restart.": "消息的写入方式，适用于 loggers 未为其设置格式的每个日志器，与 fib 自身的写法一致：line，时间、级别和消息，随后是 key=value 形式的属性；text，每个部分都是 key=value（logfmt）；或 json，每行一个 JSON 对象。每条都带有日志器名称，字段为 logger。不设置时为 line。更改需重启。",
"How often a quiet QUIC connection is pinged, so that it neither idles out nor loses its NAT mapping. 10s when left out.": "多久对空闲的 QUIC 连接发一次 ping，使其既不会空闲超时，也不会丢失 NAT 映射。不设置时为 10s。",
"How often spans are exported, and sooner when 256 KiB of them wait. 5s when left out.": "多久导出一次 span，当积压达到 256 KiB 时会更早导出。不设置时为 5s。",
"How often the JWK set is fetched again; 1h when left out. A token naming a kid the set does not have has it fetched sooner, at most every 10s.": "多久重新获取一次 JWK 集；不设置时为 1h。令牌中的 kid 若不在该集中，则会提前重新获取，最频繁为每 10s 一次。",
"How often the catalog is read again whether or not it changed. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有变化，多久重新读取一次目录。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the containers are listed again whether or not an event came, in case one was missed. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有事件到来，多久重新列出一次容器，以防遗漏事件。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the keys are read again whether or not a watch event came. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有监视事件到来，多久重新读取一次键。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the metrics are exported. 30s when left out.": "多久导出一次指标。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the node reads its hardware again, 5s to 1h. 30s when left out.": "节点多久重新读取一次其硬件信息，范围 5s 到 1h。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the roots are scanned again, at least 10s; a scan also runs when the library is made, when the config changes its roots, patterns or bounds, and on the Admin API's POST /media/library/<name>/rescan. A file whose size and time are unchanged is not probed again. 10m when left out.": "重新扫描根目录的间隔，至少 10s；媒体库创建时、配置修改其根目录、模式或上限时，以及 Admin API 的 POST /media/library/<name>/rescan 也会触发扫描。大小和时间都未变的文件不会再次探测。不设置时为 10m。",
"How often the round trip to the hub is measured. 5s when left out.": "多久测量一次到中心节点的往返时间。不设置时为 5s。",
"How often what the keys provide is sent again whether or not it changed, so that a part refused because of the rest of the config is tried again. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有变化，多久重新发送一次这些键所提供的内容，以便因配置其余部分而被拒绝的部分得到重试。不设置时为 30s。",
"How requests are matched, and what handles them.": "请求如何匹配，以及由什么处理。",
"How requests are spread over the addresses: round_robin, in turn; weighted_round_robin, in turn by weight (smoothly, as nginx does); least_conn, to the address with the fewest requests under way for its weight; random, at random by weight; p2c, to the less busy for its weight of two addresses chosen at random; ip_hash, uri_hash, header_hash and cookie_hash, by a consistent hash of the client's IP address, the request's path and query, the header hash_key names or the cookie it names, so that the same key goes to the same address while it is up, and adding or removing an address moves only the keys that went to it or will. A request without the header or cookie goes in turn. round_robin when left out, or weighted_round_robin when weights are given.": "请求如何分配到各地址：round_robin，依次轮流；weighted_round_robin，按权重依次轮流（平滑，与 nginx 相同）；least_conn，分给按权重计算正在处理请求最少的地址；random，按权重随机；p2c，在随机选出的两个地址中分给按权重计算较空闲的一个；ip_hash、uri_hash、header_hash 和 cookie_hash，分别按客户端 IP 地址、请求的路径和查询、hash_key 所指定的请求头或其所指定的 cookie 做一致性哈希，使相同的键在地址可用期间始终到同一地址，增删地址时只移动原本或将要分到该地址的键。没有该请求头或 cookie 的请求按轮流分配。不设置时为 round_robin，给出权重时为 weighted_round_robin。",
"How requests reach the upstream: http/1.1 in the clear, h2c (HTTP/2 in the clear, which the servers must expect), or h2 (TLS, with HTTP/2 when the server chooses it through ALPN and HTTP/1.1 otherwise). http/1.1 when left out.": "请求如何到达上游：http/1.1 明文，h2c（明文 HTTP/2，服务器必须预期此方式），或 h2（TLS，服务器通过 ALPN 选择时使用 HTTP/2，否则使用 HTTP/1.1）。不设置时为 http/1.1。",
"How the logger's messages are written: line, text or json, as the log's format. A change takes a restart.": "日志器的消息如何写入：line、text 或 json，含义同日志的 format。更改需重启。",
"IP addresses and CIDR prefixes, as in \"10.0.0.0/8\", the client's address must be in: the address of the connection, not of X-Forwarded-For.": "客户端地址必须在其中的 IP 地址和 CIDR 前缀，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"：指连接的地址，而非 X-Forwarded-For。",
"Instead of the password, its bcrypt hash, as fit hash-password makes it: Basic and the query's user and pass only, checked off fib's workers. A password once found right is remembered, as a keyed SHA-256, so that the next check is at once.": "用密码的 bcrypt 哈希代替密码，由 fit hash-password 生成：仅适用于 Basic 以及查询参数中的 user 和 pass，在 fib 的 worker 之外校验。校验通过的密码会以带密钥的 SHA-256 形式记住，下次校验即可立即完成。",
"Instead of the password, the long-term key it derives, as coturn's turnadmin -k prints it: MD5(name \":\" realm \":\" password) in hex, optionally after 0x, so that the password is not kept.": "不使用密码，而是使用由它派生的长期密钥，与 coturn 的 turnadmin -k 输出相同：MD5(name \":\" realm \":\" password) 的十六进制，可带 0x 前缀，这样就不必保存密码。",
"Instead of the token, its SHA-256 in hex, so that the config does not hold it, as sha256sum prints it for the token alone, without a newline: printf %s \"$TOKEN\" | sha256sum.": "用 token 的十六进制 SHA-256 代替 token，使配置中不保存 token 本身，其值与 sha256sum 对 token 单独（不含换行）的输出一致：printf %s \"$TOKEN\" | sha256sum。",
"Its share of the requests, against the others' weights.": "其占请求的份额，相对于其他项的权重而言。",
"Its value.": "其值。",
"Keep accounts, keys and certificates in Redis, etcd or Consul instead of a directory, for instances of fit on several hosts: one instance obtains a certificate, holding a lock there, and the others take it from there; each challenge's answer is kept there too, so that whichever instance the CA reaches answers it. Not with storage.": "将账户、密钥和证书保存在 Redis、etcd 或 Consul 中而不是目录里，用于多主机上的 fit 实例：一个实例获取证书时在那里持有锁，其他实例从那里取用；每个质询的应答也保存在那里，这样无论 CA 访问到哪个实例，都能应答。不能与 storage 同时使用。",
"Keep each client on one address with a cookie: a request whose cookie names an address that is up goes there, and any other gets the cookie for the address it went to. No cookie when left out.": "用 cookie 将每个客户端固定在一个地址：cookie 指向某个可用地址的请求会到该地址，其他请求则会得到其所到地址对应的 cookie。不设置时不使用 cookie。",
"Keep the config encrypted in a file of its own, the store, which is the base config fit runs from then on: every config applied is written to it, and what this file sets beside admin is only the store's first content, used when the store does not exist yet. Left out, the config lives in this file.": "将配置加密保存在其自身的文件即存储（store）中，它是此后 fit 运行所依据的基础配置：每次应用的配置都会写入其中，而本文件中除 admin 外的设置仅作为存储的初始内容，在存储尚不存在时使用。不设置时，配置保存在本文件中。",
"Keep the model without serving it.": "保留模型但不提供服务。",
"Keep them in Consul's KV store, with locks held by sessions.": "将其保存在 Consul 的 KV 存储中，锁由会话持有。",
"Keep them in Redis, a standalone server or a primary (not Redis Cluster), with locks of SET NX and an expiry.": "将其保存在 Redis（独立服务器或主节点，不支持 Redis Cluster）中，锁使用 SET NX 和过期时间。",
"Keep them in etcd, through its v3 JSON gateway, with locks held by leases.": "通过 etcd 的 v3 JSON 网关将其保存在 etcd 中，锁由租约持有。",
"Layer 4 services: the upstreams the connections of tcp listeners are proxied to, byte for byte, and the datagrams of udp listeners, one for one.": "第 4 层服务：tcp 监听器的连接按字节原样代理到的上游，以及 udp 监听器的数据报一对一转发到的上游。",
"Leave the Authorization field, with the password, on the request the handler sees; it is removed when left out.": "在处理器看到的请求上保留带密码的 Authorization 字段；不设置时会将其移除。",
"Leave the endpoint out of the dials, keeping it for later.": "将该端点从拨号列表中去掉，留待以后使用。",
"Let a request without a certificate through as well, unauthenticated; refused with 403 Forbidden when left out.": "同时放行没有证书的请求，视为未认证；不设置时以 403 Forbidden 拒绝。",
"Let linked hubs manage the node: edit its models, change GPU settings, run its fixed actions and follow their jobs. Never its own settings, and never a command of their own. Off when left out.": "允许已关联的中心节点管理该节点：编辑其模型、更改 GPU 设置、运行其固定操作并跟踪其作业。绝不能改其自身设置，也绝不能执行其自带的命令。不设置时为关闭。",
"Lets every request that misses fetch for itself. When left out, a request that misses while another fetches the same response waits for that fetch, up to lock_timeout, and is answered from what it keeps (a cache lock), so that many requests for a response not kept make one fetch.": "让每个未命中的请求各自去获取。不设置时，若某请求未命中而另一请求正在获取同一响应，则它会等待该次获取，最长 lock_timeout，然后用其保存的内容应答（缓存锁），这样对未缓存响应的大量请求只会产生一次获取。",
"Limits that apply to every listener.": "适用于每个监听器的限制。",
"List a directory that has no index file, rather than answering 404. Files whose names start with a dot are left out.": "当目录没有索引文件时列出其内容，而不是返回 404。名称以点开头的文件不会列出。",
"Listen listen_tcp and listen_tls with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default; listen's UDP sockets have none. A change of it starts a new server and drains the old one.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 listen_tcp 和 listen_tls，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭；listen 的 UDP 套接字没有该功能。更改它会启动新服务器并排空旧服务器。",
"Listen the Admin API with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default; a Unix socket has no paths.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 Admin API，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭；Unix 套接字没有路径可用。",
"Listen the RTMP connections with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 RTMP 连接，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listen the RTSP connections with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 RTSP 连接，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listen the console with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听控制台，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listen the listener's TCP connections with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not; a client without Multipath TCP falls back too. Off by default: a listener is plain TCP. udp listeners and HTTP/3 take none.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听该监听器的 TCP 连接，不支持时回退到普通 TCP；没有多路径 TCP 的客户端也会回退。不设置时为关闭：监听器就是普通 TCP。udp 监听器和 HTTP/3 没有该功能。",
"Listen the pages with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听页面，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listeners, routes, services and upstreams from a Kubernetes cluster's Gateway API resources: the Gateways of the GatewayClasses whose controllerName is fit's, and their HTTPRoutes, GRPCRoutes, TLSRoutes, TCPRoutes and UDPRoutes, whose status fit writes back.": "来自 Kubernetes 集群 Gateway API 资源的监听器、路由、服务和上游：controllerName 为 fit 的 GatewayClass 下的 Gateway，及其 HTTPRoute、GRPCRoute、TLSRoute、TCPRoute 和 UDPRoute，fit 会回写它们的状态。",
"Listeners, routes, upstreams and services from the keys under a prefix in Consul's KV store, each holding a JSON object of them.": "来自 Consul KV 存储中某前缀下各键的监听器、路由、上游和服务，每个键保存其中的一个 JSON 对象。",
"Listeners, routes, upstreams and services from the keys under a prefix in etcd, each holding a JSON object of them.": "来自 etcd 中某前缀下各键的监听器、路由、上游和服务，每个键保存其中的一个 JSON 对象。",
"Local addresses that serve a hub's console pages through its encrypted console_socket.": "通过中心节点加密的 console_socket 提供其控制台页面的本地地址。",
"Local addresses whose connections are tunneled to a node's service.": "其连接被隧道转发到某节点服务的本地地址。",
"Make no listener in the clear to redirect to HTTPS. ACME's HTTP-01 challenge is then answered by none, and certificates come through TLS-ALPN-01.": "不创建明文监听器来重定向到 HTTPS。这样 ACME 的 HTTP-01 质询无人应答，证书改经 TLS-ALPN-01 获取。",
"Mark the cookie Secure, so that it is sent only over HTTPS. It is always HttpOnly and SameSite=Lax.": "将该 cookie 标记为 Secure，使其仅通过 HTTPS 发送。它始终为 HttpOnly 和 SameSite=Lax。",
"Methods, as in \"GET\"; compared as written, since methods are case-sensitive.": "方法，如 \"GET\"；按原样比较，因为方法区分大小写。",
"Middleware a request passes through, in order, before the handler.": "请求在到达处理器之前依次经过的中间件。",
"More parameters for the application, set after fit's own.": "应用的更多参数，在 fit 自身的参数之后设置。",
"Named libraries of media files: directories scanned into a catalog of items, each a title with its renditions, audio, subtitles and poster, probed off fib's workers on a bounded file pool of the library's own, and read by the Admin API's /media/library. None when left out: no files are scanned or served.": "命名的媒体文件库：将目录扫描成条目目录（catalog），每个条目是一部作品及其各个版本（rendition）、音轨、字幕和海报；在媒体库自己的有界文件池上探测，不占用 fib 的 worker，并由 Admin API 的 /media/library 读取。不设置时为无：不扫描也不提供任何文件。",
"Named policies of who may publish and play which streams, with tokens, users and keys for tokens fit signs: the handlers and roles that take media (whip, whep, webrtc_proxy) refer to one with their auth param. A handler without auth lets everyone in, as the route's middleware allow.": "具名策略，规定谁可以发布和播放哪些流，包含 token、用户以及 fit 所签发 token 的密钥：接收媒体的处理器和角色（whip、whep、webrtc_proxy）通过其 auth 参数引用某个策略。没有 auth 的处理器放行所有人，由路由的中间件决定。",
"Obtain a certificate during the handshake for a name a client asks for that neither the files nor acme have, as the top-level acme.on_demand allows; needs it.": "当客户端请求的名称既不在文件中也不在 acme 中时，在握手期间获取其证书，与顶层 acme.on_demand 允许的相同；需要它。",
"On Linux, move a large upload (128KB or more, framed by its Content-Length) from a client's HTTP/1.1 connection without TLS to an HTTP/1.1 upstream without TLS with splice(2), the kernel passing its pages from one socket to the other, rather than copying it through the proxy. An upload that cannot go so, to an h2, h2c or TLS upstream, or chunked, goes the ordinary way. It costs the proxy about 40% less CPU on such uploads and the upstream about 5% more, which reads the body cold rather than as the proxy just wrote it, and more once the upstream itself is the bottleneck: false suits an upstream whose CPU is scarcer than the proxy's. False copies every upload. True when left out.": "在 Linux 上，用 splice(2) 把较大的上传（128KB 及以上、以 Content-Length 定界）从客户端不带 TLS 的 HTTP/1.1 连接搬到不带 TLS 的 HTTP/1.1 上游，由内核把页从一个 socket 交给另一个，而不经代理拷贝。不能这样走的上传（发往 h2、h2c 或 TLS 上游的，或 chunked 的）照常经代理转发。这样代理处理此类上传的 CPU 约少 40%，上游约多 5%（它读到的是冷数据，而不是代理刚写入的），上游本身成为瓶颈时会更多：上游 CPU 比代理更紧张时宜设为 false。为 false 时所有上传都拷贝。不设置时为 true。",
"OpenTelemetry: traces of requests, with W3C trace context sent on to upstreams, and metrics, exported over OTLP/HTTP to a collector. Neither when left out. Read when fit starts: a change takes effect when fit restarts.": "OpenTelemetry：请求的追踪（W3C trace context 会继续传给上游）和指标，通过 OTLP/HTTP 导出到收集器。不设置时两者均无。在 fit 启动时读取：更改在 fit 重启后生效。",
"PEM files of public keys or certificates (RSA, ECDSA or Ed25519) tokens are verified with.": "用于验证令牌的公钥或证书（RSA、ECDSA 或 Ed25519）的 PEM 文件。",
"PEM files of the certificate authorities a client's certificate must chain to. They are watched as certificate files are: a change loads the config again.": "客户端证书必须链到的证书颁发机构的 PEM 文件。它们与证书文件一样受监视：变更会重新加载配置。",
"Paths tried in turn for a request, as nginx's try_files: {path} stands for the request's path, and one ending in / for a directory, served by its index file. The first that exists is served, and when none does the answer is 404; [\"{path}\", \"{path}/\", \"/index.html\"] serves a single-page app. A directory asked for without its slash is not redirected then.": "依次为请求尝试的路径，与 nginx 的 try_files 相同：{path} 代表请求的路径，以 / 结尾的代表目录，由其索引文件提供。提供第一个存在的，都不存在时应答 404；[\"{path}\", \"{path}/\", \"/index.html\"] 可提供单页应用。此时请求目录而不带斜杠不会被重定向。",
"Paths tried in turn, as nginx's try_files, for the script to run: {path} stands for the request's path, and the first whose script exists under root runs; [\"{path}\", \"{path}/index.php\", \"/index.php\"] sends what is no script of its own to the front controller, as most PHP applications want. Looked up on a pool of goroutines of its own. Left out, the path runs as it is.": "依次尝试的路径，与 nginx 的 try_files 相同，用于确定要运行的脚本：{path} 代表请求的路径，第一个其脚本存在于 root 下的路径会被运行；[\"{path}\", \"{path}/index.php\", \"/index.php\"] 会把本身不是脚本的请求交给前端控制器，大多数 PHP 应用都需要如此。在其自有的 goroutine 池上查找。不设置时，路径按原样运行。",
"Paths, exact or ending in \"*\" to match a prefix.": "路径，精确匹配，或以 \"*\" 结尾以匹配前缀。",
"Prefixes to take off the path: the first that the path starts with, at a segment boundary, is removed, and what is left starts with '/'. \"/api\" makes \"/api/users\" \"/users\" and \"/api\" \"/\", and leaves \"/apix\" alone.": "要从路径中去掉的前缀：路径在段边界处所匹配的第一个前缀会被移除，剩余部分以 '/' 开头。\"/api\" 使 \"/api/users\" 变为 \"/users\"、\"/api\" 变为 \"/\"，而 \"/apix\" 保持不变。",
"Probe each address on a schedule, and take one that fails its probes out of rotation until it passes them again; no probes when left out. Probes and max_fails take an address out each on their own account.": "按计划探测每个地址，并将探测失败的地址移出轮转，直到其再次通过探测；不设置时不探测。探测和 max_fails 各自独立地将地址移出。",
"Put media servers behind fit: the UDP port the webrtc_proxy handler's answers name, which relays each peer to the media server that answered it, found by the ICE ufrag of the peer's first STUN request. Routes with webrtc_proxy handlers answer 503 without it. None when left out.": "将媒体服务器置于 fit 之后：webrtc_proxy 处理器的应答所指明的 UDP 端口，它按对端首个 STUN 请求的 ICE ufrag 找到应答它的媒体服务器，并将每个对端中继到该服务器。没有它时，带 webrtc_proxy 处理器的路由返回 503。不设置时为无。",
"Query parameters the request must have, each with one of the values listed, or with any value when none are listed; compared once unescaped.": "请求必须带有的查询参数，每个参数取所列值之一；未列出值时可取任意值；在反转义后比较。",
"Refuse to connect where an address, or the address its host name resolves to, is loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified, multicast or the host's own, decided once each connection is open and before anything is sent on it; a request refused so gets 502, as one whose connect fails. For addresses others choose: the Kubernetes provider sets it on the upstreams of ExternalName Services. Off when left out.": "拒绝连接到这样的地址：地址本身或其主机名解析出的地址是环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定、组播地址或本机自己的地址，在每个连接打开之后、发送任何内容之前判断；被这样拒绝的请求得到 502，与连接失败的请求相同。用于由他人选择的地址：Kubernetes provider 为 ExternalName Service 的 upstream 设置它。不设置时关闭。",
"Regular expressions in Go's syntax, matched against the path anywhere in it unless anchored with ^ and $.": "Go 语法的正则表达式，在路径的任意位置匹配，除非用 ^ 和 $ 锚定。",
"Request fields to set to claims, as {\"X-User\": \"sub\"}: a string as it is, anything else as JSON. Any of these fields the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, are removed, with or without the claim.": "要设置为声明（claim）值的请求字段，如 {\"X-User\": \"sub\"}：字符串按原样，其他类型按 JSON。客户端发送的这些字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）无论有无对应声明都会被移除。",
"Response headers. Content-Type defaults to text/plain; charset=utf-8 when there is a body.": "响应头。有响应体时 Content-Type 默认为 text/plain; charset=utf-8。",
"Retries allowed each second beyond budget_ratio, so that a proxy taking few requests may still retry; 10 when left out.": "在 budget_ratio 之外每秒允许的重试次数，使接收请求很少的代理仍可重试；不设置时为 10。",
"Retries may add at most this share of the requests the proxy takes, so that retries cannot multiply the load on an upstream already failing; 0.2 when left out.": "重试最多可占代理所接收请求的这一比例，使重试不会成倍加重已在失败的上游的负载；不设置时为 0.2。",
"Rotate the file log.output names, and remove old rotated files: the size and interval a file is rotated at, and the age, count and total size past which rotated files are removed. None when left out: the file grows without bound, as before.": "切割 log.output 指定的文件并清理旧的切割文件：文件按多大、按什么间隔切割，以及超过多长时间、多少个文件、多大总量后删除旧的切割文件。不设置时不做任何切割：文件会像以前一样无限增长。",
"Rotate the file output names, and remove old rotated files: the size and interval a file is rotated at, and the age, count and total size past which rotated files are removed. None when left out: the file grows without bound, as before.": "切割 output 指定的文件并清理旧的切割文件：文件按多大、按什么间隔切割，以及超过多长时间、多少个文件、多大总量后删除旧的切割文件。不设置时不做任何切割：文件会像以前一样无限增长。",
"Rotate this logger's file, when output names one of its own; the log's rotate is used when the logger writes to the log's output. The settings are the log's rotate's.": "当 output 指定该 logger 自己的文件时，切割这个文件；logger 写向日志的 output 时使用日志的 rotate。设置项与日志的 rotate 相同。",
"Routes with a higher priority are picked first; among equal ones, the most specific host, then path, then the one with the most other matchers set (method, header, query, remote_ip, path_regexp, expr), then the one written first.": "优先级较高的路由优先选取；优先级相同时，依次取最具体的 host、最具体的路径、设置了最多其他匹配器（method、header、query、remote_ip、path_regexp、expr）的路由，最后取写在最前面的。",
"Routes, upstreams and services from the labels of running Docker containers.": "来自运行中 Docker 容器标签的路由、上游和服务。",
"Routes, upstreams and services from the tags of the services in a Consul catalog, sending to their instances whose health checks pass.": "来自 Consul 目录中各服务标签的路由、上游和服务，发送到其健康检查通过的实例。",
"Run GPU settings, tool installs and actions that need root with sudo -n when fit does not run as root; sudo must not ask for a password. On when left out.": "当 fit 不以 root 运行时，用 sudo -n 运行需要 root 的 GPU 设置、工具安装和操作；sudo 不得询问密码。不设置时为开启。",
"Run a TURN server (RFC 8656), which relays UDP for WebRTC peers and other ICE agents that cannot reach each other directly. None when left out.": "运行 TURN 服务器（RFC 8656），为无法直接互通的 WebRTC 对端和其他 ICE 代理中继 UDP。不设置时为无。",
"Run a hub: nodes and proxies link to it, and it joins a proxy's tunnels to a node's.": "运行中心节点：节点和代理链接到它，由它连接代理的隧道与节点的隧道。",
"Run a hub: nodes and proxies link to it, and it passes calls between them.": "运行中心节点：节点和代理链接到它，由它在两者之间传递调用。",
"Run a node: it links to hubs and opens the tunnels they ask for to the services it exposes.": "运行节点：它链接到各中心节点，并按其要求打开到其所暴露服务的隧道。",
"Run a node: it serves models from local or remote upstreams to the hubs and proxies linked to it.": "运行节点：它将本地或远程上游的模型提供给链接到它的中心节点和代理。",
"Run a proxy: an OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible API, for agents, that calls the models of the nodes it reaches.": "运行代理：为智能体提供兼容 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 的 API，调用其所能到达的节点的模型。",
"Run a proxy: local ports and web proxies forwarded through a hub to the services of a node.": "运行代理：本地端口和 Web 代理经由中心节点转发到某节点的服务。",
"Run fit as a WebRTC media server: the UDP port the PeerConnections of the whip and whep handlers share, the ICE servers told to their peers, and their limits. Routes with whip or whep handlers answer 503 without it. None when left out.": "将 fit 作为 WebRTC 媒体服务器运行：whip 和 whep 处理器的 PeerConnection 共用的 UDP 端口、告知其对端的 ICE 服务器，以及其限制。没有它时，带 whip 或 whep 处理器的路由返回 503。不设置时为无。",
"STUN and TURN servers the pages' PeerConnections use, as a browser's iceServers. None when left out: fit's media server is an ICE lite agent that browsers reach directly, and tells them of its own ICE servers in its answers' Link headers.": "页面的 PeerConnection 使用的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器，即浏览器的 iceServers。不设置时为无：fit 的媒体服务器是 ICE lite 代理，浏览器可直接访问，并会在应答的 Link 头中告知其自身的 ICE 服务器。",
"STUN and TURN servers the peers are told of in Link headers (RFC 9725), for their side of ICE; fit's is an ICE lite agent on its own address.": "在 Link 头（RFC 9725）中告知对端的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器，供其 ICE 使用；fit 自身是位于其自有地址上的 ICE lite 代理。",
"STUN and TURN servers the peers are told of in Link headers (RFC 9725), for their side of ICE; fit's side needs none, as it is an ICE lite agent on its own address.": "通过 Link 头（RFC 9725）告知对端的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器，供其一侧的 ICE 使用；fit 一侧不需要，因为它在自己的地址上是 ICE lite 代理。",
"Send a copy of a share of the requests whose bodies arrive whole (64KB at most) to another upstream, and drop its answers. At most 256 copies are under way at once; past that, requests are not copied. The requests themselves do not wait for their copies.": "将一部分请求的副本（其请求体须完整到达，最大 64KB）发送到另一个上游，并丢弃其应答。同时最多有 256 个副本在途；超出后不再复制请求。请求本身不等待其副本。",
"Send a request that failed again, to the backend the upstream picks next: one whose connection could not be made, whatever its method, and, for GET, HEAD, OPTIONS, TRACE, PUT and DELETE, one that failed before its response began or was answered with a status of statuses. A request whose body streams (past 64KB, or still arriving) is never sent again. No retries when left out.": "将失败的请求重新发送到上游接着选取的后端：连接未能建立的请求，无论其方法；对于 GET、HEAD、OPTIONS、TRACE、PUT 和 DELETE，还包括在响应开始前失败，或应答状态码属于 statuses 的请求。请求体为流式（超过 64KB，或仍在到达）的请求绝不会重新发送。不设置时不重试。",
"Send each upstream connection a PROXY protocol header of this version (v1, text, or v2, binary) first, naming the client's address and the one it connected to. For tcp listeners.": "先向每个上游连接发送此版本的 PROXY 协议头（v1，文本；或 v2，二进制），写明客户端地址及其所连接的地址。用于 tcp 监听器。",
"Send requests to the backends of ExternalName Services, to the host name each names, refusing one that is loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified or multicast, by address or by the address the name resolves to, or the host's own: whoever may create a Service could otherwise point a route at fit's Admin API or the cloud's metadata service. Off when left out: a backend that is an ExternalName Service is not resolved, and its route says so in its status.": "把请求发送到 ExternalName Service 的后端，即它所指的主机名；但拒绝本身是或解析为环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定或组播地址，或本机自己地址的后端：否则任何能创建 Service 的人都能让路由指向 fit 的 Admin API 或云的元数据服务。不设置时关闭：ExternalName Service 后端不会被解析，其路由在 status 中说明原因。",
"Send to the port a container's port is published on, on the host, rather than to the container's own address: for a fit outside Docker that cannot reach containers' addresses, as on Docker Desktop.": "发送到容器端口在主机上发布的端口，而不是容器自身的地址：适用于无法访问容器地址的 Docker 外部的 fit，如 Docker Desktop。",
"Sent as Access-Control-Allow-Origin, as \"*\", for players on other origins. None when left out.": "作为 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 发送，如 \"*\"，供其他源的播放器使用。不设置时为无。",
"Sent as Access-Control-Allow-Origin, which a web player on another origin (flv.js, mpegts.js) needs, as \"*\". None when left out.": "作为 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 发送，其他源的网页播放器（flv.js、mpegts.js）需要它，如 \"*\"。不设置时为无。",
"Serve Ingresses too: those whose ingressClassName, or kubernetes.io/ingress.class annotation, names an IngressClass whose controller is controller_name, and those naming none when such a class is the default. Their rules are served on http_port, and on https_port for the hosts of their tls, with the certificates of its Secrets. fit's account then needs to list and watch Ingresses and IngressClasses. No Ingresses when left out.": "同时处理 Ingress：其 ingressClassName 或 kubernetes.io/ingress.class 注解指定了控制器为 controller_name 的 IngressClass 的，以及在此类为默认时未指定任何类的。其规则在 http_port 上提供，其 tls 的主机则在 https_port 上提供，使用其 Secret 中的证书。此时 fit 的账户需要列出和监视 Ingress 与 IngressClass。不设置时不处理 Ingress。",
"Serve TLS, with these certificates: the listener's HTTP is HTTPS.": "提供 TLS，使用这些证书：监听器的 HTTP 即为 HTTPS。",
"Serve the console, web pages behind a user name and password from which the whole config, admin aside, is read and changed; off when left out.": "提供控制台，即需用户名和密码访问的网页，可从中读取和更改整个配置（admin 除外）；不设置时为关闭。",
"Serve the pages: the index, the call, the publish and the play pages, and their script and style. False serves none of them: their paths answer 404, for a deployment whose page is its own; the login and the room API stay, for that page. True when left out.": "提供这些页面：首页、通话、推流和播放页，以及它们的脚本和样式。为 false 时一个都不提供：这些路径返回 404，供使用自有页面的部署使用；登录和房间 API 仍然可用。不设置时为 true。",
"Settings of some loggers of their own, by name (those levels lists), over level, output, format and rotate: engine's to a file of its own, say, or access_log's as json.": "按名称（levels 中列出的那些）为部分 logger 单独设置，覆盖 level、output、format 与 rotate：例如让 engine 写到自己的文件，或让 access_log 写成 json。",
"Show a login form for the users of the auth policy: a right password is answered with a token the policy signs, for its token_ttl, set as the HttpOnly cookie fit_media_token (SameSite=Strict, Secure over TLS), which the WHIP, WHEP and HLS requests of the pages carry, and handed to the page too. Without it the pages ask for a token instead, as fit media-token prints, when auth needs one.": "为 auth 策略的用户显示登录表单：密码正确时返回一个由该策略签发的 token，有效期为其 token_ttl，并设置为 HttpOnly cookie fit_media_token（SameSite=Strict，TLS 下为 Secure），页面的 WHIP、WHEP 和 HLS 请求会携带它，同时也交给页面。不设置时，若 auth 需要 token，页面会要求提供 token，可由 fit media-token 输出。",
"Sources of routes, upstreams, services and listeners other than this file and the Admin API, merged into the config: what this config writes wins over every provider, and a provider over those listed after it; a provider's element named as one before it is left out. The Admin API's /config/effective shows the result and where each part came from. Read when fit starts: a change takes effect when fit restarts.": "除本文件和 Admin API 外的路由、上游、服务和监听器来源，合并进配置：本配置所写的优先于所有提供者，提供者优先于其后列出的；提供者中与其前者同名的元素会被忽略。Admin API 的 /config/effective 显示结果及各部分的来源。在 fit 启动时读取：更改在 fit 重启后生效。",
"Static bearer tokens, each with the streams it may publish and play: sent as Authorization: Bearer, a token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie.": "静态 bearer token，每个 token 有其可发布和可播放的流：以 Authorization: Bearer、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie 发送。",
"Statuses of the upstream's, 5xx ones, that have a request of an idempotent method sent again, as 502, 503 and 504; none when left out, so that only requests that got no response are.": "上游的哪些状态码（5xx）会使幂等方法的请求被重新发送，如 502、503 和 504；不设置时为无，即仅未收到响应的请求会重发。",
"TCP addresses clients reach the server at, as in \":3478\", for clients on networks that block UDP: turn:host:3478?transport=tcp. Their allocations relay UDP, and end when their connection closes.": "客户端用来访问服务器的 TCP 地址，如 \":3478\"，供屏蔽 UDP 的网络上的客户端使用：turn:host:3478?transport=tcp。其分配中继 UDP，并在其连接关闭时结束。",
"TLS addresses clients reach the server at, as in \":5349\" or \":443\", with tls's certificates, for clients that only TLS gets through for: turns:host:5349?transport=tcp. As listen_tcp otherwise.": "客户端用来访问服务器的 TLS 地址，如 \":5349\" 或 \":443\"，使用 tls 的证书，供只能通过 TLS 的客户端使用：turns:host:5349?transport=tcp。其余同 listen_tcp。",
"Take a PROXY protocol header, of version 1 or 2, at the start of each connection from a trusted address, and serve the connection as from the client it names. For listeners of tcp and of HTTP over TCP; with tls the header comes before TLS. HTTP/3 takes none.": "在来自受信任地址的每个连接开头接受版本 1 或 2 的 PROXY 协议头，并按其所指明的客户端来处理该连接。适用于 tcp 监听器和基于 TCP 的 HTTP 监听器；与 tls 同用时，该头位于 TLS 之前。HTTP/3 不接受。",
"Take and play streams over RTMP, as rtmp://host/app/stream: OBS and ffmpeg publish, players play. None when left out.": "通过 RTMP 接收和播放流，如 rtmp://host/app/stream：OBS 和 ffmpeg 发布，播放器播放。不设置时为无。",
"Take and play streams over RTSP 1.0 with interleaved RTP (RTP/AVP/TCP), as rtsp://host/app/stream. None when left out.": "通过 RTSP 1.0 接收和播放流，RTP 以交织方式传输（RTP/AVP/TCP），如 rtsp://host/app/stream。不设置时为无。",
"Take and play streams over SRT, MPEG-TS on UDP, the stream named by the caller's stream ID. None when left out.": "通过 SRT（UDP 上的 MPEG-TS）接收和播放流，流由调用方的 stream ID 指定。不设置时为无。",
"Take any QUIC certificate, which lets anyone on the path read and change what the quic links carry: for tests only. Refused for a quic:// endpoint whose host is not a loopback one, unless body_password is set; pin and ca_file override it.": "接受任何 QUIC 证书，这会让路径上的任何人都能读取和篡改 quic 链路所承载的内容：仅用于测试。主机不是回环地址的 quic:// 端点不接受此项，除非设置了 body_password；pin 与 ca_file 优先于它。",
"Take every running container with routes or services in its labels; only those labelled <label_prefix>.enable=true when left out or false. A container labelled <label_prefix>.enable=false is never taken.": "接管每个标签中带有路由或服务的运行中容器；不设置或为 false 时，仅接管带 <label_prefix>.enable=true 标签的。带 <label_prefix>.enable=false 标签的容器绝不会被接管。",
"Take every service in the catalog; only those tagged <tag_prefix>.enable=true when left out or false. An instance tagged <tag_prefix>.enable=false is never taken.": "接管目录中的每个服务；不设置或为 false 时，仅接管带 <tag_prefix>.enable=true 标签的。带 <tag_prefix>.enable=false 标签的实例绝不会被接管。",
"The ACL user to authenticate as, with password_file; the default user when left out.": "用于认证的 ACL 用户，与 password_file 配合；不设置时为默认用户。",
"The API agents on this machine or the LAN call, /v1/chat/completions, /v1/messages, /v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent, /api/chat, /v2/chat and the rest; none when left out.": "本机或局域网上的智能体调用的 API：/v1/chat/completions、/v1/messages、/v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent、/api/chat、/v2/chat 等；不设置时为无。",
"The API the upstream speaks: openai (OpenAI and every OpenAI-compatible server, as DeepSeek, Qwen, Mistral, Groq, xAI, OpenRouter, vLLM, llama.cpp), anthropic, gemini (Google's Gemini API), azure_openai (Azure OpenAI deployments, which agents call as openai), ollama (Ollama's own API) or cohere (Cohere's v2 API). It sets the agent endpoints the model is reached through, the upstream URL and the auth header.": "上游所使用的 API：openai（OpenAI 及所有兼容 OpenAI 的服务器，如 DeepSeek、Qwen、Mistral、Groq、xAI、OpenRouter、vLLM、llama.cpp）、anthropic、gemini（Google 的 Gemini API）、azure_openai（Azure OpenAI 部署，智能体按 openai 调用）、ollama（Ollama 自有 API）或 cohere（Cohere 的 v2 API）。它决定访问模型所用的智能体端点、上游 URL 和认证头。",
"The Admin API, through which the running config is read and replaced, and which serves metrics in Prometheus's text format at /metrics; off when left out. Its settings are read when fit starts: a change to them takes effect when fit restarts.": "Admin API，用于读取和替换运行中的配置，并在 /metrics 以 Prometheus 文本格式提供指标；不设置时为关闭。其设置在 fit 启动时读取：更改在 fit 重启后生效。",
"The Docker network whose address of a container's is used, when the container is on several and has no <label_prefix>.network label; the first by name when left out.": "使用其地址的 Docker 网络，用于容器处于多个网络且没有 <label_prefix>.network 标签时；不设置时取按名称排在第一的。",
"The Host header sent upstream; the client's when left out.": "发往上游的 Host 头；不设置时为客户端的。",
"The IP address Gateway listeners are bound on, each on its port; every address when left out.": "绑定 Gateway 监听器的 IP 地址，每个监听器在各自的端口上；不设置时为所有地址。",
"The LLM feature's roles to run beside the gateway, on its engine: a hub, a node and a proxy, which share AI models among machines and serve them to agents. None when left out. What their web pages change is written back here.": "LLM 功能在网关旁其引擎上运行的角色：中心节点（hub）、节点（node）和代理（proxy），它们在机器之间共享 AI 模型并将其提供给智能体。不设置时为无。其网页所做的更改会回写到此处。",
"The OTLP/HTTP receiver: http:// or https:// and a host and port, as of an OpenTelemetry Collector; traces go to its /v1/traces and metrics to /v1/metrics, as JSON. http://127.0.0.1:4318 when left out.": "OTLP/HTTP 接收端：http:// 或 https:// 加主机和端口，如 OpenTelemetry Collector 的；追踪以 JSON 发送到其 /v1/traces，指标发送到 /v1/metrics。不设置时为 http://127.0.0.1:4318。",
"The PEM certificate the tls, wss and quic listeners without cert_file present, which nodes and proxies pin by its SHA-256 fingerprint; with key. When a listener needs one and none is set, the hub makes a self-signed one and keeps it: here, with admin.store, or else in a file beside the config, 0600, as fit.tunnel.hub.pem beside fit.json; so that it outlives a restart, and the pins of it stay good.": "没有 cert_file 的 tls、wss 和 quic 监听器出示的 PEM 证书，节点和代理按其 SHA-256 指纹固定；与 key 配合。当监听器需要而未设置时，中心节点会生成一个自签名证书并保存：有 admin.store 时保存在这里，否则保存在配置旁的文件中（权限 0600），例如 fit.json 旁的 fit.tunnel.hub.pem；这样重启后证书不变，对它的固定指纹依然有效。",
"The PEM private key of cert.": "cert 的 PEM 私钥。",
"The SHA-256 fingerprint of the hub's certificate, as its pages show it, which tls://, wss:// and quic:// endpoints check the certificate against, in place of the chain and name checks: for a hub with a self-signed certificate. Without it or ca_file, the certificate is checked against the system's roots.": "中心节点证书的 SHA-256 指纹，与其页面所示一致，tls://、wss:// 和 quic:// 端点据此校验证书，取代证书链和名称校验：用于使用自签名证书的中心节点。没有它或 ca_file 时，证书按系统根证书校验。",
"The SHA-256 of the key, in hex.": "密钥的 SHA-256，十六进制。",
"The TCP address RTMP clients connect to, as in \":1935\". A change of any field but auth starts the listener again, closing its connections.": "RTMP 客户端连接的 TCP 地址，如 \":1935\"。修改除 auth 之外的任何字段都会重新启动监听器，关闭其连接。",
"The TCP address RTSP clients connect to, as in \":8554\". RTP goes interleaved on the same connection (RTP/AVP/TCP); a SETUP asking for UDP is answered 461, which ffmpeg and most players then retry over TCP. A change of any field but auth starts the listener again, closing its connections.": "RTSP 客户端连接的 TCP 地址，如 \":8554\"。RTP 在同一连接上交织传输（RTP/AVP/TCP）；要求 UDP 的 SETUP 会返回 461，ffmpeg 和大多数播放器随后会改用 TCP 重试。修改除 auth 之外的任何字段都会重新启动监听器，关闭其连接。",
"The UDP address SRT callers reach, as in \":8890\". A change of any field but auth starts the listener again, ending its sessions.": "SRT 调用方访问的 UDP 地址，如 \":8890\"。修改除 auth 之外的任何字段都会重新启动监听器，结束其会话。",
"The UDP address every peer's media reaches fit at, one port all PeerConnections share, as in \":8189\". A wildcard host advertises the address of every interface that is up, unless public_ips is set. A change starts the media server again, ending its sessions.": "所有对端的媒体访问 fit 的 UDP 地址，所有 PeerConnection 共用一个端口，如 \":8189\"。通配主机会通告所有处于启用状态的接口的地址，除非设置了 public_ips。更改会重启媒体服务器，结束其会话。",
"The UDP address every peer's media reaches fit at, one port all the role's PeerConnections share, as in \":8188\"; not webrtc.media's. A wildcard host advertises every interface's address that is up, unless public_ips is set. A change of any field starts it again, ending its sessions.": "所有对端的媒体到达 fit 的 UDP 地址，该角色所有 PeerConnection 共用一个端口，如 \":8188\"；不是 webrtc.media 的。通配主机会通告所有已启用接口的地址，除非设置了 public_ips。修改任何字段都会重新启动它，结束其会话。",
"The UDP address peers reach the media servers behind fit at, one port for them all, as in \":8190\": the proxied answers name it as their only candidate. A wildcard host advertises the address of every interface that is up, unless public_ips is set. A change ends every relay and session.": "对端访问 fit 之后的媒体服务器的 UDP 地址，所有媒体服务器共用一个端口，如 \":8190\"：被代理的应答将其作为唯一的候选。通配主机会通告所有处于启用状态的接口的地址，除非设置了 public_ips。更改会结束所有中继和会话。",
"The UDP addresses clients reach the server at, as in \":3478\", the port TURN's turn: URIs default to. A change of listen, listen_tcp or listen_tls starts a new server and drains the old one.": "客户端用来访问服务器的 UDP 地址，如 \":3478\"，即 TURN 的 turn: URI 默认使用的端口。更改 listen、listen_tcp 或 listen_tls 会启动新服务器并排空旧服务器。",
"The UDP port the PeerConnections of the stream_whip and stream_whep handlers share, which publish into the hub with WHIP and play from it with WHEP. Routes with those handlers answer 503 without it. None when left out.": "stream_whip 和 stream_whep 处理器的 PeerConnection 共用的 UDP 端口，它们用 WHIP 发布到 hub，用 WHEP 从中播放。没有它时，带这些处理器的路由返回 503。不设置时为无。",
"The URL of a JWK set (RFC 7517) whose signing keys tokens are verified with.": "JWK 集（RFC 7517）的 URL，令牌用其中的签名密钥验证。",
"The URL of a stream's HLS playlist, {stream} standing for its name, as /hls/{stream}/index.m3u8 for the streaming role's hls handler: the play page plays it where the browser plays HLS itself, with the page's token. None when left out.": "流的 HLS 播放列表的 URL，{stream} 代表其名称，如流媒体角色的 hls 处理器的 /hls/{stream}/index.m3u8：在浏览器自身支持 HLS 的情况下，播放页会连同页面的 token 一起播放它。不设置时为无。",
"The URL of the CA's ACME directory. Let's Encrypt's when left out; https://acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory is its staging CA, for tests.": "CA 的 ACME directory 的 URL。不设置时为 Let's Encrypt 的；https://acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory 是其测试用的 staging CA。",
"The URL streams are played from with WHEP, {stream} standing for the stream's name. /whep/{stream} when left out.": "用 WHEP 播放流的 URL，{stream} 代表流的名称。不设置时为 /whep/{stream}。",
"The URL streams are published to with WHIP, {stream} standing for the stream's name: a whip handler's, or stream_whip's for the streaming role, on this server or another. /whip/{stream} when left out.": "用 WHIP 发布流的 URL，{stream} 代表流的名称：可以是 whip 处理器的，或流媒体角色的 stream_whip 的，位于本服务器或其他服务器上。不设置时为 /whip/{stream}。",
"The URL, with {stream}, {token} and {host} filled in by the page.": "URL，其中的 {stream}、{token} 和 {host} 由页面填入。",
"The actions anyone may take without credentials, as [\"play\"] for streams anyone may watch and only some may publish. None when left out: every request needs credentials.": "任何人无需凭据即可执行的操作，如 [\"play\"]，用于任何人可观看而只有部分人可发布的流。不设置时为无：每个请求都需要凭据。",
"The address clients are told for their relayed sockets instead of relay_ip, for a server behind a 1:1 NAT that maps it to relay_ip. Of relay_ip's family. A change starts a new server.": "告知客户端其中继套接字所用的地址，代替 relay_ip，用于位于 1:1 NAT 之后、将其映射到 relay_ip 的服务器。与 relay_ip 属同一地址族。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The address fit relays a media server's peers to, by the media server's address in the upstream, as {\"10.0.0.2:8080\": \"10.0.0.2:8189\"}, or an IP alone, which takes the port of its answer's candidate. When left out, the answer's first host candidate, or server-reflexive one, IPv4 first.": "fit 将媒体服务器的对端中继到的地址，按上游中的媒体服务器地址对应，如 {\"10.0.0.2:8080\": \"10.0.0.2:8189\"}，或仅给出 IP，此时取其应答中候选项的端口。不设置时取应答中的第一个 host 候选项，或 server-reflexive 候选项，IPv4 优先。",
"The address the CA may write to about the account's certificates; none when left out.": "CA 可就账户的证书向其发信的地址；不设置时为无。",
"The address the relayed sockets bind to, one of the host's, not a wildcard; clients are told it, unless public_ip is set. Its family is every allocation's. Peers on it, and on public_ip, are relayed to on the ports of the server's own relayed addresses alone, and on those allowed_peers lists with their port. A change starts a new server.": "中继套接字绑定的地址，须为主机自身的地址之一，不能是通配地址；除非设置了 public_ip，否则告知客户端的就是它。其地址族即每个分配的地址族。位于该地址及 public_ip 上的对端，仅按服务器自身中继地址的端口中继，以及按 allowed_peers 所列的带端口地址中继。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The address the sockets toward the media servers leave from, one of the host's, for a firewall in front of them that admits one source address, or a host with several interfaces. Of the media servers' family: a media address of the other family is not relayed. The route's pick when left out. Applies to the next relay.": "通向媒体服务器的套接字的出口地址，须为主机自身的地址之一，用于其前方只放行一个源地址的防火墙，或有多个网卡的主机。与媒体服务器属同一地址族：另一地址族的媒体地址不会被中继。不设置时由路由选择。对下一次中继生效。",
"The addresses (\"10.0.0.1\") and networks (\"10.0.0.0/8\") of proxies in front of fit: for a request that comes from one, the client's address is the last in X-Forwarded-For that is not one of them. None when left out, and the client is the connection's peer.": "fit 前方代理的地址（\"10.0.0.1\"）和网络（\"10.0.0.0/8\"）：对来自其中之一的请求，客户端地址取 X-Forwarded-For 中最后一个不属于它们的地址。不设置时为无，客户端即连接的对端。",
"The addresses (\"10.0.0.1\") and networks (\"10.0.0.0/8\") of proxies in front of this one, whose X-Forwarded-* and Forwarded fields are believed. None when left out.": "本代理前方代理的地址（\"10.0.0.1\"）和网络（\"10.0.0.0/8\"），其 X-Forwarded-* 和 Forwarded 字段被信任。不设置时为无。",
"The addresses and CIDR ranges of the clients that may use the proxy, as \"10.0.0.0/8\"; others are answered 403.": "可使用该代理的客户端的地址和 CIDR 范围，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"；其他客户端得到 403 响应。",
"The addresses and CIDR ranges of the clients that may use the proxy, as \"10.0.0.0/8\"; others are refused.": "可使用该代理的客户端的地址和 CIDR 范围，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"；其他客户端被拒绝。",
"The addresses and CIDR ranges of the proxies that send the header, as \"10.0.0.0/8\": a connection from one of them must begin with a header, within 10s, or it is closed, and one from elsewhere is served as it is, with no header.": "发送该头部的代理的地址和 CIDR 范围，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"：来自其中之一的连接必须在 10s 内以头部开始，否则被关闭；来自其他地址的连接则照常服务，不带头部。",
"The addresses and prefixes, as in \"10.1.0.0/16\", peers may be at even when denied_peers or the default denial cover them: loopback, private, link-local and other internal ranges are denied unless listed here, so that the relay cannot reach into the network it runs in. An address with a port, as in \"10.0.0.5:8189\", allows that port alone, which is how a peer on relay_ip itself, such as webrtc.media, is reached.": "即使 denied_peers 或默认拒绝规则覆盖了，对端仍可位于的地址和前缀，如 \"10.1.0.1/16\"：回环、私有、链路本地及其他内部范围默认被拒绝，除非在此列出，以使中继无法触及其所在的网络。带端口的地址，如 \"10.0.0.5:8189\"，仅允许该端口，这是触及位于 relay_ip 本身上的对端（如 webrtc.media）的方式。",
"The addresses fit listens on, and the protocols each one serves. When left out, HTTPS by default makes them from the routes' host names; see auto_https.": "fit 监听的地址，及各自提供的协议。不设置时，HTTPS 默认由路由的主机名生成；参见 auto_https。",
"The addresses of the upstream's servers, each a host and a port, as in \"10.0.0.1:8080\" or \"backend:80\".": "上游的服务器地址，每个为主机加端口，如 \"10.0.0.1:8080\" 或 \"backend:80\"。",
"The addresses peers are told to reach the port at instead of the interfaces' own, as behind a 1:1 NAT.": "告知对端用来访问该端口的地址，代替接口自身的地址，如位于 1:1 NAT 之后时。",
"The addresses peers are told to reach the port at, with its port, instead of the interfaces' own: a server behind a 1:1 NAT, or a load balancer that forwards the port unchanged. A change starts the media server again.": "告知对端用以访问该端口的地址（含端口），代替网卡自身的地址：用于位于 1:1 NAT 之后的服务器，或原样转发该端口的负载均衡器。更改会重启媒体服务器。",
"The addresses peers are told to reach the port at, with its port, instead of the interfaces' own: a server behind a 1:1 NAT. Applies to the next answer.": "告知对端用以访问该端口的地址（含端口），代替网卡自身的地址：用于位于 1:1 NAT 之后的服务器。对下一次应答生效。",
"The addresses where clients reach fit's Gateways, IP addresses or host names, written into each one's status.addresses, as clients of the Gateway API and its conformance tests read them. None are written when left out, and those there are kept.": "客户端访问 fit 的 Gateway 的地址，IP 地址或主机名，写入各 Gateway 的 status.addresses，供 Gateway API 的客户端及其一致性测试读取。不设置时不写入，已有的保持不变。",
"The algorithms tokens may be signed with; any that fits the keys when left out. none never is.": "令牌可使用的签名算法；不设置时为任何与密钥相符的算法。none 永远不允许。",
"The api-version query every call of an azure_openai model carries, as 2024-10-21: required for azure_openai, and only taken there.": "azure_openai 模型的每次调用所带的 api-version 查询参数，如 2024-10-21：azure_openai 必填，且仅在该处使用。",
"The bcrypt hash of the user's password, as fit hash-password makes it.": "用户密码的 bcrypt 哈希，由 fit hash-password 生成。",
"The bcrypt hash of the user's password, as fit hash-password or htpasswd -B makes it.": "用户密码的 bcrypt 哈希，由 fit hash-password 或 htpasswd -B 生成。",
"The bytes a connection may have waiting to be written before it stops reading until they drain, the backpressure on one connection; limits.max_pending_bytes bounds them all together. When left out or 0, fib sizes it from read_buffer_size and the machine: four read buffers, at least 64 KiB and at most 256 KiB, so 256 KiB at the default 64 KiB read buffer on a machine with enough memory.": "一个连接在停止读取、等待其排空之前，可以有多少字节等待写出，即单个连接的背压；limits.max_pending_bytes 则限制所有连接的总和。不设置或为 0 时，fib 根据 read_buffer_size 和机器情况确定：四个读缓冲区，至少 64 KiB、至多 256 KiB，因此在默认 64 KiB 读缓冲区、内存充足的机器上为 256 KiB。",
"The bytes a connection reads its socket into at a time, which is also the most a proxied body is passed on in one write. 64 KiB when left out or 0.": "连接每次读取套接字所用的缓冲区字节数，也是代理的请求体一次写出所传的最大字节数。不设置或为 0 时为 64 KiB。",
"The bytes each stream keeps of its latest group of pictures, from its last key frame on, so that a new player starts at once with a picture; a group that outgrows it is dropped and caching starts again at the next key frame. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "每个流保留的最近一组图像（自其最后一个关键帧起）的字节数，使新播放器能立即看到画面；超出的一组会被丢弃，并从下一个关键帧起重新缓存。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The bytes of segments one stream and format holds; the oldest go first. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个流及格式保留的分片字节数；最旧的先被丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The bytes one connection may have queued for its client before fit closes it, the bound on a peer that stops reading. 32 MiB when left out or 0. Takes effect at start, not on a reload.": "一个连接在 fit 将其关闭之前，可为其客户端排队的字节数，用于限制停止读取的对端。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。在启动时生效，重载时不生效。",
"The directories whose files the library holds, scanned with their subdirectories; an item's id is its path under its root. A root may not lie inside another. A root missing when scanned is reported, and the others are scanned.": "媒体库所含文件所在的目录，连同其子目录一起扫描；条目的 id 是其在根目录下的路径。根目录不能位于另一个根目录之内。扫描时缺失的根目录会被报告，其余根目录照常扫描。",
"The files looked at, by pattern: a pattern without '/' matches a file's name, as *.mp4, and one with '/' its path under the root, as films/**/*.mp4, where * matches within a name and ** any run of directories. Every file when left out; names starting with '.' are never looked at.": "按模式选取要查看的文件：不含 '/' 的模式匹配文件名，如 *.mp4；含 '/' 的模式匹配其在根目录下的路径，如 films/**/*.mp4，其中 * 匹配名称之内的字符，** 匹配任意层目录。不设置时查看所有文件；以 '.' 开头的名称从不查看。",
"The goroutines of the library's file pool, which probe, read sample tables and read the files' bytes, so that no fib worker waits on the disk: all the disk is asked to do at once. 4 a CPU, and at least 16, when left out or 0.": "媒体库文件池的 goroutine 数量，它们负责探测文件、读取样本表和读取文件的字节，使 fib 的 worker 不必等待磁盘：即同时向磁盘发出的全部请求。不设置或为 0 时为每个 CPU 4 个，且至少 16 个。",
"The hub's certificate, which its tls, wss and quic listeners present unless they have cert_file, and the connections of the quic listeners. The hub makes a self-signed certificate and writes it here when a listener needs one and none is set.": "中心节点的证书（其 tls、wss 和 quic 监听器在没有 cert_file 时出示它），以及 quic 监听器的连接。当监听器需要证书而未设置时，中心节点会生成自签名证书并写入此处。",
"The certificates of listen_tls, from files, as a listener's tls.certificates has them, and watched as theirs are: a change applies to the next handshake.": "listen_tls 的证书，来自文件，格式同监听器的 tls.certificates，并同样被监视：更改对下一次握手生效。",
"The challenges answered, in the order tried: http-01, which the CA checks on port 80 at the name, answered by any listener of fit's in the clear, and tls-alpn-01, which it checks on port 443, answered by the TLS listener that lists the name. A failed attempt is tried again with the next. Both, http-01 first, when left out.": "所应答的质询，按尝试顺序：http-01，CA 在该名称的 80 端口检查，由 fit 的任一明文监听器应答；tls-alpn-01，CA 在 443 端口检查，由列有该名称的 TLS 监听器应答。尝试失败则用下一个重试。不设置时两者都用，http-01 优先。",
"The codecs publishers may send, by encoding name: opus, VP8, VP9, H264 and AV1, every one when left out. Each publisher's offer is answered with the first of its codecs of each kind that is listed here, which its viewers must accept.": "发布者可发送的编解码器，按编码名称：opus、VP8、VP9、H264 和 AV1，不设置时为全部。对每个发布者的 offer，用此处所列其编解码器中每种类型的第一个应答，其观看者必须接受。",
"The console_socket's password.": "console_socket 的密码。",
"The controllerName of the GatewayClasses whose Gateways fit serves. lesismal.github.io/fit when left out.": "fit 所服务的 Gateway 所属 GatewayClass 的 controllerName。不设置时为 lesismal.github.io/fit。",
"The cookie's Path; / when left out.": "cookie 的 Path；不设置时为 /。",
"The cookie's name; fit_sticky when left out.": "cookie 的名称；不设置时为 fit_sticky。",
"The database selected. 0 when left out.": "所选的数据库。不设置时为 0。",
"The datacenter whose KV store is read; the agent's when left out.": "读取其 KV 存储的数据中心；不设置时为代理所在的数据中心。",
"The datacenter whose KV store is used; the agent's when left out.": "使用其 KV 存储的数据中心；不设置时为代理所在的数据中心。",
"The datacenter whose catalog is read; the agent's when left out.": "读取其目录的数据中心；不设置时为代理所在的数据中心。",
"The destination ports allowed; any when left out.": "允许的目标端口；不设置时为任意端口。",
"The destinations the proxy connects to: host names, \"*.example.com\" for every name below example.com, IP addresses and CIDR ranges, which also hold the address a host name resolves to. Every destination deny does not hold when left out, but for loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified and multicast addresses and the host's own, which are refused unless a range here lies inside theirs, as \"127.0.0.0/8\" does and \"0.0.0.0/0\" does not, or, for the host's own, names that address alone.": "代理所连接的目标：主机名，\"*.example.com\" 表示 example.com 之下的所有名称，IP 地址和 CIDR 范围（也涵盖主机名解析出的地址）。不设置时为 deny 未涵盖的所有目标，但环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定和组播地址以及本机自己的地址除外：这些地址被拒绝，除非这里有一个范围落在它们的范围之内（如 \"127.0.0.0/8\"，而 \"0.0.0.0/0\" 不算），对本机自己的地址则须单独写出该地址。",
"The destinations the proxy connects to: host names, \"*.example.com\" for every name below example.com, IP addresses and CIDR ranges, which also hold the address a host name resolves to. Every destination deny does not hold when left out, but for loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified and multicast addresses and the host's own, which are refused unless a range here lies inside theirs, as \"127.0.0.0/8\" does and \"0.0.0.0/0\" does not, or, for the host's own, names that address alone; others are answered 403, or 502 for a host name whose address decides.": "代理所连接的目标：主机名，\"*.example.com\" 表示 example.com 之下的所有名称，IP 地址和 CIDR 范围（也涵盖主机名解析出的地址）。不设置时为 deny 未涵盖的所有目标，但环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定和组播地址以及本机自己的地址除外：这些地址被拒绝，除非这里有一个范围落在它们的范围之内（如 \"127.0.0.0/8\"，而 \"0.0.0.0/0\" 不算），对本机自己的地址则须单独写出该地址；其他目标得到 403 响应，若由主机名的地址决定则得到 502。",
"The directory accounts, keys and certificates are kept in, which instances of fit may share. $XDG_DATA_HOME/fit, or ~/.local/share/fit, when left out.": "存放账户、密钥和证书的目录，fit 的多个实例可共用。不设置时为 $XDG_DATA_HOME/fit，或 ~/.local/share/fit。",
"The directory files are served from. On a file system that folds case, as Windows' and macOS' do by default, a request whose path is not written as the names on disk are, or for a file whose extension a fastcgi handler's split_path names, in any case, is answered 404, so that a route matching names, as \\.php$, is not passed by.": "提供文件服务的目录。在不区分大小写的文件系统上（Windows 与 macOS 默认如此），路径与磁盘上名称写法不一致的请求，以及扩展名（不论大小写）为某个 fastcgi 处理器 split_path 所列扩展名的文件，均返回 404，以免绕过按名称匹配的路由（如 \\.php$）。",
"The directory the certificates of HTTPS listeners are written to, from the Secrets they name, for fit's TLS to load: each Secret's chain and key in one file only fit's user may read, named for the Secret and a hash of its contents. Files of that form that are no longer named are removed. A directory of fit's own in the system's temporary directory, removed when fit stops, when left out.": "写入 HTTPS 监听器证书的目录，证书来自其所指定的 Secret，供 fit 的 TLS 加载：每个 Secret 的证书链和密钥放在一个仅 fit 的用户可读的文件中，以 Secret 的名称和其内容的哈希命名。不再被引用的此类文件会被删除。不设置时为系统临时目录中 fit 自己的目录，fit 停止时删除。",
"The directory the zone's responses are kept in, made if it is missing. It is the zone's alone: no other zone may name it. What it holds is found again when fit starts.": "存放该区域响应的目录，不存在时创建。它仅属于该区域：其他区域不得使用同一目录。其中的内容在 fit 启动时会被重新找到。",
"The document root, which SCRIPT_FILENAME, DOCUMENT_ROOT and PATH_TRANSLATED are made from, as the application sees it.": "文档根目录，SCRIPT_FILENAME、DOCUMENT_ROOT 和 PATH_TRANSLATED 由它生成，即应用所看到的路径。",
"The encodings offered, the one the client prefers most chosen, and among those it prefers as much, the first here; zstd, br and gzip when left out.": "所提供的编码，选择客户端最偏好的一种；偏好程度相同的，取此处靠前的；不设置时为 zstd、br 和 gzip。",
"The files that stand for a directory, tried in order; [\"index.html\"] when left out, and none for [].": "代表目录的文件，按顺序尝试；不设置时为 [\"index.html\"]，设为 [] 则为无。",
"The highest local port of the sockets toward the media servers; with port_min. The range bounds the relays at once, beside max_relays.": "通向媒体服务器的套接字的最高本地端口；与 port_min 配合。该范围同时限制中继数量，与 max_relays 并用。",
"The highest port of the relayed sockets; with port_min.": "中继套接字的最高端口；与 port_min 配合。",
"The host and port it listens on, as in \":7000\"; an empty host is every address.": "监听的主机和端口，如 \":7000\"；主机为空表示所有地址。",
"The host and port the API listens on: a loopback address serves agents on this machine; a LAN address, or an empty host, serves agents on other machines too, and needs cert_file and key_file, so that keys never cross a network in the clear.": "API 监听的主机和端口：回环地址只服务本机的代理；局域网地址或空主机也服务其他机器上的代理，且需要 cert_file 和 key_file，以使密钥不会以明文跨网络传输。",
"The host and port the WebSocket listens on; it answers on any path.": "WebSocket 监听的主机和端口；任何路径都会应答。",
"The host and port the console listens on. A host that is not a loopback address needs cert_file and key_file, so that passwords never cross a network in the clear. 127.0.0.1:2020 when left out.": "控制台监听的主机和端口。非回环地址的主机需要 cert_file 和 key_file，以使密码不会以明文跨网络传输。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:2020。",
"The host and port the pages listen on. A host that is not a loopback address needs cert_file and key_file, so that passwords never cross a network in the clear.": "页面监听的主机和端口。非回环地址的主机需要 cert_file 和 key_file，以使密码不会以明文跨网络传输。",
"The host and port the role takes links on, as a binding of its own on the listeners' engine; the WebSocket path is /ws. An empty host listens on every address.": "该角色接受链路的主机和端口，作为监听器所用引擎上自身的绑定；WebSocket 路径为 /ws。主机为空表示监听所有地址。",
"The host and port to listen on, as in \":8080\" or \"127.0.0.1:8080\".": "监听的主机和端口，如 \":8080\" 或 \"127.0.0.1:8080\"。",
"The hub's address: tls://host:port for TCP over TLS, wss://host:port/path for a WebSocket over TLS, quic://host:port for QUIC; or, only to a loopback host or with body_password, host:port or tcp://host:port for TCP and ws://host:port/path for a WebSocket in the clear. An address has no query, fragment or user ('?', '#', '@'): pin and ca_file say how the hub's certificate is checked.": "中心节点的地址：基于 TLS 的 TCP 用 tls://host:port，基于 TLS 的 WebSocket 用 wss://host:port/path，QUIC 用 quic://host:port；仅当主机为回环地址或设置了 body_password 时，才可用明文的 TCP（host:port 或 tcp://host:port）和 WebSocket（ws://host:port/path）。地址不含查询、片段或用户信息（'?'、'#'、'@'）：如何校验中心节点的证书由 pin 与 ca_file 决定。",
"The hub's addresses, in the order each link tries them: it dials the first one not disabled, and the next when that fails.": "中心节点的地址，按每条链路尝试的顺序：拨号第一个未禁用的，失败则拨下一个。",
"The hub's body_password, when it has one. A tcp:// or ws:// endpoint whose host is not a loopback one needs it.": "中心节点的 body_password，如果它有的话。主机不是回环地址的 tcp:// 或 ws:// 端点需要它。",
"The hub's console_socket, as ws://host:port/.": "中心节点的 console_socket，形如 ws://host:port/。",
"The hub's name here, which forwards and the pages name it by. The first endpoint's address when left out.": "中心节点在此处的名称，转发和页面用它来指代该节点。不设置时为第一个端点的地址。",
"The hub's name, for the pages.": "中心节点的名称，用于页面。",
"The hub's stable ID, which its peers know it by. Made when left out, and written back here.": "中心节点的稳定 ID，其对端凭此识别它。不设置时自动生成，并写回此处。",
"The hub's web pages; none when left out.": "中心节点的网页；不设置时为无。",
"The hubs and nodes the proxy dials. Its pages change them.": "代理所拨号的中心节点和节点。其页面可更改它们。",
"The hubs and proxies the node dials. Its pages change them.": "节点所拨号的中心节点和代理。其页面可更改它们。",
"The hubs the node links to and registers with. None when left out: the console's pages add them.": "节点所链接并注册的中心节点。不设置时为无：控制台的页面可添加它们。",
"The hubs the proxy links to and registers with. None when left out: the console's pages add them.": "代理所链接并注册的中心节点。不设置时为无：控制台的页面可添加它们。",
"The interval rate counts over. 1m when left out.": "rate 统计所依据的时间间隔。不设置时为 1m。",
"The iss a token must have; any when left out.": "令牌必须具有的 iss；不设置时为任意值。",
"The key nonces are made with; a random one when left out. Servers behind one load balancer, which may each see a client's requests, share one. A change starts a new server.": "用于生成 nonce 的密钥；不设置时随机生成。位于同一负载均衡器之后、可能各自看到某客户端请求的多个服务器，应共用同一个。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The key sent upstream: as Authorization: Bearer for openai, ollama and cohere, as x-api-key for anthropic, x-goog-api-key for gemini, api-key for azure_openai. None when left out. The pages never show it whole.": "发往上游的密钥：openai、ollama 和 cohere 用 Authorization: Bearer，anthropic 用 x-api-key，gemini 用 x-goog-api-key，azure_openai 用 api-key。不设置时为无。页面从不完整显示它。",
"The key's ID, 16 hex digits.": "密钥的 ID，16 位十六进制数字。",
"The key's first characters, to tell it by on the pages.": "密钥的前几个字符，用于在页面上识别它。",
"The key's name: 1 to 64 letters, digits, '_', '.', '~' and '-', which a media_tokens request names to sign with it, and a revoke to rotate it.": "密钥的名称：1 到 64 个字母、数字、'_'、'.'、'~' 和 '-'，media_tokens 的请求用它指定签发用的密钥，吊销也用它指定要轮换的密钥。",
"The key's secret, at least 16 bytes. Or secret_file, one of the two.": "该密钥的 secret，至少 16 字节。或 secret_file，二者取其一。",
"The key, at least 16 bytes, that tokens fit issues are signed with (HMAC-SHA256): fit media-token's and the media pages' logins. Tokens are good for this policy alone, until their expiry. When left out, a random key of the process's signs the pages' logins, which a restart forgets; fit media-token needs it. Or secret_file, one of the two, or keys.": "fit 签发的 token 所用的签名密钥（HMAC-SHA256），至少 16 字节：包括 fit media-token 签发的以及媒体页面登录时签发的。token 仅对该策略有效，直至过期。不设置时，进程会用一个随机密钥为页面登录签名，重启后即失效；fit media-token 则必须设置它。或 secret_file，二者取其一，或 keys。",
"The keys agents call the API with, each kept as its SHA-256 alone. Its pages make and delete them.": "代理调用 API 所用的密钥，每个只保存其 SHA-256。其页面可创建和删除它们。",
"The keys read are those starting with it. Each holds a JSON object of listeners, routes, upstreams and services, as a config holds them; keys ending in '/' and empty ones are passed over, and a key whose value is not such an object is left out and reported. fit/ when left out.": "所读取的键是以它开头的键。每个键保存一个由监听器、路由、上游和服务组成的 JSON 对象，与配置所含的相同；以 '/' 结尾的键和空键会被跳过，值不是此类对象的键会被忽略并报告。不设置时为 fit/。",
"The kubeconfig's context to use; its current-context when left out.": "所用的 kubeconfig 上下文；不设置时为其 current-context。",
"The largest RTMP message a client may send, a video frame among them; a larger one closes its connection. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "客户端可发送的最大 RTMP 消息（包括视频帧）；更大的消息会关闭其连接。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The largest body a request of the room API or the login may have, in bytes; a larger one is answered 413. 1024 when left out.": "房间 API 或登录请求的请求体最大字节数；更大的返回 413。不设置时为 1024。",
"The largest body kept; a larger response goes to its client without being kept. At most a sixteenth of max_bytes. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "所保留的最大响应体；更大的响应直接交给其客户端而不保留。至多为 max_bytes 的十六分之一。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The largest config the Admin API takes; a larger one gets 413. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "Admin API 接受的最大配置；更大的得到 413。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"The largest file a member may send in a room's chat, in bytes; a larger one is answered 413, and the page refuses it before sending. 5 MiB (5242880) when left out.": "成员在房间聊天中可发送的文件最大字节数；更大的文件返回 413，页面会在发送前拒绝它。不设置时为 5 MiB（5242880）。",
"The largest file kept in memory, in bytes; 1 MiB when left out.": "内存中保留的最大文件，单位为字节；不设置时为 1 MiB。",
"The largest message a TCP or TLS client may send, and so what its connection buffers of one not yet whole; a connection whose next message claims more is closed. At least 2048. 8 KiB when left out or 0. A change starts a new server.": "TCP 或 TLS 客户端可发送的最大消息，也就是其连接为尚未完整的一条消息所缓冲的上限；下一条消息声称更大的连接会被关闭。至少 2048。不设置或为 0 时为 8 KiB。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The largest offer taken; a larger one is answered 400. At most 64 KiB. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "接受的最大 offer；更大的返回 400。最大为 64 KiB。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The largest offer taken; a larger one is answered 413. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "接受的最大 offer；更大的得到 413。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The largest request and answer passed on, an offer and an answer among them; a larger request is answered 413, and a larger answer 502. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "转发的最大请求和应答，其中包括 offer 和 answer；更大的请求得到 413，更大的应答得到 502。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The largest request body a call may carry; one past it fails. A body is held whole only when the model's upstream differs from the name the call gives and the model is named in the body (its JSON model, or a form's model field), to set it. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次调用可携带的最大请求体；超过则失败。仅当模型的上游与调用所给的名称不同，且请求体中指明了模型（其 JSON 的 model，或表单的 model 字段）以便设置它时，才会完整保存请求体。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The largest request body a call may carry; one past it gets 413. It is held whole, to read the model it names and to send it again when a route cannot serve it. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次调用可携带的最大请求体；超过则得到 413。它会被完整保存，以读取其中指明的模型，并在某个路由无法处理时再次发送。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The largest request body a listener takes, whether it arrives whole or streams through; a larger one gets 413, or, once it has begun to stream, its connection or stream is ended. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "监听器接受的最大请求体，无论是整体到达还是以流的方式传入；更大的得到 413，若已开始流式传输，则其连接或流被终止。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The largest request body the route takes; a larger one is answered 413. 64 KiB when left out.": "路由接受的最大请求体；更大的返回 413。不设置时为 64 KiB。",
"The largest request header a listener takes; a larger one gets 431. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "监听器接受的最大请求头；更大的得到 431。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The largest sidecar, <name>.json, read; a larger one is reported and left out. At most 1 MiB. 64 KiB when left out or 0.": "读取的 sidecar（<name>.json）的最大大小；更大的会被报告并略过。最多 1 MiB。不设置或为 0 时为 64 KiB。",
"The largest subtitle file served, .vtt or .srt turned into WebVTT; a larger one is listed with its error and not served. 2 MiB when left out or 0.": "提供的字幕文件（.vtt，或转换为 WebVTT 的 .srt）的最大大小；更大的字幕会连同其错误一起列出，且不提供。不设置或为 0 时为 2 MiB。",
"The least level of some loggers, by name, over level: server (listeners, loading and reloading configs, shutting down), admin (the Admin API), tls (certificates: ACME, OCSP, certificate files), provider (providers), telemetry (exporting over OTLP), access_log (the access log's dropped lines), plugin (wasm plugins), fastcgi (what FastCGI applications write to their stderr), llm and tunnel (their roles), webrtc (the TURN server) and engine (fib, the network engine, and whatever else writes to Go's log and log/slog). The same as loggers' level, which a logger may not have both of. A change takes effect on reload.": "按名称为某些日志记录器设置的最低级别，优先于 level：server（监听器、加载和重载配置、关闭）、admin（Admin API）、tls（证书：ACME、OCSP、证书文件）、provider（提供者）、telemetry（经 OTLP 导出）、access_log（访问日志被丢弃的行）、plugin（wasm 插件）、fastcgi（FastCGI 应用写入其 stderr 的内容）、llm 和 tunnel（它们的角色）、webrtc（TURN 服务器）以及 engine（fib，即网络引擎，以及其他写入 Go 的 log 和 log/slog 的内容）。与 loggers 的 level 相同，同一个日志记录器不能同时设置两者。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least level of the requests written: a response with a status below 400 is info, a 4xx warn and a 5xx error, so warn writes the requests answered with 4xx and 5xx, and error those answered with 5xx. Every request when left out. A change takes effect on reload.": "所写入请求的最低级别：状态码低于 400 的响应为 info，4xx 为 warn，5xx 为 error，因此 warn 会写入以 4xx 和 5xx 应答的请求，error 则写入以 5xx 应答的请求。不设置时写入每个请求。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least level the logger writes. A change takes effect on reload.": "该日志记录器所写入的最低级别。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least level written, of every logger levels and loggers do not set one for: debug, info, warn or error. info when left out. A change takes effect on reload.": "所写入的最低级别，适用于 levels 和 loggers 均未设置级别的所有日志记录器：debug、info、warn 或 error。不设置时为 info。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least time between two key frame requests (PLI) passed to a publisher, for the viewers that join or lose packets: the rest are dropped. 500ms when left out.": "传给发布者的两次关键帧请求（PLI）之间的最短时间，针对加入或丢包的观看者：其余的会被丢弃。不设置时为 500ms。",
"The length of each listening socket's queue of connections not yet accepted. The system's when left out or 0.": "每个监听套接字中尚未被接受的连接队列的长度。不设置或为 0 时取系统的值。",
"The library's name, which handlers and the Admin API's /media/library/<name> refer to it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "媒体库的名称，处理器和 Admin API 的 /media/library/<name> 以此引用它。由字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-' 组成。",
"The lifetime of an allocation whose client asks for less, or for none; clients refresh it before it ends. 10m when left out. Applies to the next allocation or refresh.": "客户端所请求的生存期少于此值或未请求时，分配的生存期；客户端在其结束前刷新。不设置时为 10m。对下一次分配或刷新生效。",
"The local host and port the forward listens on.": "转发所监听的本地主机和端口。",
"The local host and port the pages are served on.": "提供页面服务的本地主机和端口。",
"The longest a request may ask a token to be good for; a longer ttl is answered 400. 24h when left out.": "请求可要求 token 有效的最长时间；更长的 ttl 返回 400。不设置时为 24h。",
"The longest lifetime a client may ask for. 1h when left out. Applies to the next allocation or refresh.": "客户端可请求的最长生存期。不设置时为 1h。对下一次分配或刷新生效。",
"The lowest local port of the sockets toward the media servers, for a firewall in front of them that admits a range; with port_max. A port in use is skipped, and a peer address that finds the range full is dropped. Ports the kernel picks when both are left out. Applies to the next relay.": "通向媒体服务器的套接字的最低本地端口，用于其前方放行一个范围的防火墙；与 port_max 配合。正在使用的端口会被跳过，发现范围已满的对端地址会被丢弃。两者都不设置时由内核选择端口。对下一次中继生效。",
"The lowest port of the relayed sockets, as a firewall that opens a range expects; with port_max. Ports the kernel picks when both are left out. A change starts a new server.": "中继套接字的最低端口，如开放一个范围的防火墙所期望的；与 port_max 配合。两者都不设置时由内核选择端口。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The media_auth policy RTSP requests must satisfy, by the stream's path: ANNOUNCE publish and DESCRIBE play on the stream their URL names, RECORD publish and PLAY play on the stream of the connection's session (one whose URL names another stream is refused with 455), and a SETUP play on its stream, or once a session is set up, play or publish on the session's. Credentials are a user with a plaintext password by Digest, a user by Basic when auth_methods offers it, or a token in the URL's query, as rtsp://host/live/cam?token=T. A refusal is 401 with the challenges, or 403. Everyone may publish and play when left out. A change applies to the next request.": "RTSP 请求必须满足的 media_auth 策略，按流的路径判定：ANNOUNCE 需要其 URL 所指流的 publish，DESCRIBE 需要其 play；RECORD 需要该连接会话的流的 publish，PLAY 需要其 play（URL 指向别的流时以 455 拒绝）；SETUP 需要其流的 play，会话建立之后则需要会话的流的 play 或 publish。凭据为使用明文密码用户的 Digest、auth_methods 提供时使用用户的 Basic，或 URL 查询参数中的 token，如 rtsp://host/live/cam?token=T。拒绝时返回带质询的 401 或 403。不设置时所有人均可发布和播放。修改后对下一个请求生效。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy to play the stream: its credentials need play on the stream's name, or the policy makes play public. Missing or bad credentials are answered 401 with a Bearer challenge, others 403. A session's URL takes its DELETE without credentials, as whip's. Everyone may play when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "POST 播放该流所必须满足的 media_auth 策略：其凭据需要对流的名称具有 play 权限，或该策略将 play 设为公开。缺少或错误的凭据返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，其他情况返回 403。会话的 URL 的 DELETE 无需凭据，与 whip 相同。不设置时所有人均可播放，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy to publish the stream: its credentials, a bearer token or a user and password, need publish on the stream's name, or the policy makes publish public. Missing or bad credentials are answered 401 with a Bearer challenge, others 403. A session's URL takes its DELETE without credentials: its ID, 128 random bits, is the capability. Everyone may publish when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "POST 发布该流所必须满足的 media_auth 策略：其凭据（bearer token 或用户和密码）需要对流的名称具有 publish 权限，或该策略将 publish 设为公开。缺少或错误的凭据返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，其他情况返回 403。会话的 URL 的 DELETE 无需凭据：其 ID（128 位随机数）即为凭证。不设置时所有人均可发布，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy, play on the stream's path, as stream_whip's. A session's URL takes PATCH and DELETE without credentials. Everyone may play when left out.": "POST 必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 play 权限，与 stream_whip 相同。会话的 URL 的 PATCH 和 DELETE 无需凭据。不设置时所有人均可播放。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy, publish on the stream's path: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie. 401 with a Bearer challenge without credentials, 403 when they do not allow it. A session's URL takes PATCH and DELETE without credentials, its random ID being the capability (RFC 9725). Everyone may publish when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "POST 必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 publish 权限：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie。没有凭据时返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，凭据不被允许时返回 403。会话的 URL 的 PATCH 和 DELETE 无需凭据，其随机 ID 即为凭证（RFC 9725）。不设置时所有人均可发布，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a caller must satisfy, publish for m=publish and play otherwise, by the stream ID's resource: a token as s= (#!::r=live/cam,m=publish,s=T), a user and password as u= and s=, or token, or user and pass, in the resource's query (live/cam?token=T). A refusal rejects the handshake with 1401 (unauthorized) or 1403 (forbidden). Everyone may publish and play when left out. A change applies to the next caller.": "调用方必须满足的 media_auth 策略，m=publish 时需要 publish，否则需要 play，按 stream ID 的资源判定：以 s= 给出 token（#!::r=live/cam,m=publish,s=T），以 u= 和 s= 给出用户和密码，或在资源的查询参数中给出 token，或 user 和 pass（live/cam?token=T）。拒绝时以 1401（未授权）或 1403（禁止）拒绝握手。不设置时所有人均可发布和播放。修改后对下一个调用方生效。",
"The media_auth policy a player must satisfy, play on the stream's path: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter (/live/cam.flv?token=T) or the fit_media_token cookie. 401 with a Bearer challenge without credentials, 403 when they do not allow it. Everyone may play when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "播放器必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 play 权限：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数（/live/cam.flv?token=T）或 fit_media_token cookie。没有凭据时返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，凭据不被允许时返回 403。不设置时所有人均可播放，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a publish and a play must satisfy, by the stream's path, app/stream: credentials go in the query of the stream name or the app, as rtmp://host/live/cam?token=T or ?user=U&pass=P. A refusal is answered with NetStream.Publish.Unauthorized or NetStream.Play.Failed and the connection closed. Everyone may publish and play when left out. A change applies to the next publish and play.": "发布和播放必须满足的 media_auth 策略，按流的路径 app/stream 判定：凭据放在流名称或 app 的查询参数中，如 rtmp://host/live/cam?token=T 或 ?user=U&pass=P。拒绝时返回 NetStream.Publish.Unauthorized 或 NetStream.Play.Failed 并关闭连接。不设置时所有人均可发布和播放。修改后对下一次发布和播放生效。",
"The media_auth policy an offer must satisfy before it is sent to a media server: its credentials need action on the stream, the last segment of the POST's path, which must then be 1 to 128 letters, digits, '.', '_', '~' and '-', decoded, or the offer is answered 400. Missing or bad credentials are answered 401 with a Bearer challenge, others 403. A session's URL is passed on without credentials, its ID being the capability; the request's Authorization goes on to the media server as it came. Everyone may when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "offer 在发送给媒体服务器之前必须满足的 media_auth 策略：其凭据需要对该流（POST 路径的最后一段）具有 action 权限，该段解码后须为 1 到 128 个字母、数字、'.'、'_'、'~' 或 '-'，否则 offer 答 400。缺少或错误的凭据返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，其他情况返回 403。会话的 URL 无需凭据即可转发，其 ID 即为凭证；请求的 Authorization 原样转发给媒体服务器。不设置时所有人均可，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy every request, playlist and segment, must satisfy, play on the stream's path: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie. A playlist fetched with a token in its query names its playlists, segments and parts with the token too, so that a player that sends no header (Safari, ffmpeg) plays on. Everyone may play when left out.": "每个请求（播放列表和分片）都必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 play 权限：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie。带 token 查询参数获取的播放列表，其中的播放列表、分片和 part 也会带上该 token，使不发送请求头的播放器（Safari、ffmpeg）也能继续播放。不设置时所有人均可播放。",
"The media_auth policy that signs the tokens, as whip's auth names one: it must set secret_file, or a keyring whose keys each set secret_file, so that a revoke can rotate a secret file and outlive a restart.": "签发 token 的 media_auth 策略，如 whip 的 auth 引用一条策略：它必须设置 secret_file，或设置 keys 密钥环且其中每个密钥都设置 secret_file，以便吊销时轮换 secret 文件并在重启后依然有效。",
"The media_auth policy the room API checks, and the pages' login and tokens belong to: joining a room and following it needs play on <room>-*, announcing that one publishes publish on <room>-<name>, as the WHIP and WHEP endpoints the pages use check with their own auth, which should name the same policy. Everyone may use the room API when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "房间 API 检查的 media_auth 策略，页面的登录和 token 也属于该策略：加入并关注房间需要对 <room>-* 具有 play 权限，宣告加入则需要对 <room>-<name> 具有 publish 权限，页面使用的 WHIP 和 WHEP 端点会以各自的 auth 检查，其 auth 应指向同一策略。不设置时所有人均可使用房间 API，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The model ID sent upstream in place of name: in the body's model, a form's model field, Gemini's path, or as an azure_openai model's deployment. name when left out.": "发往上游的模型 ID，代替 name：置于请求体的 model、表单的 model 字段、Gemini 的路径中，或作为 azure_openai 模型的部署名。不设置时为 name。",
"The models the node serves: each an upstream API endpoint. Its pages, and a hub that settings.allow_hub_manage lets, change them.": "节点所服务的模型：每个为一个上游 API 端点。其页面，以及 settings.allow_hub_manage 所允许的中心节点，可更改它们。",
"The module's name within its namespace.": "模块在其命名空间内的名称。",
"The module's params.": "模块的 params。",
"The most PeerConnections at once, publishers' and viewers'; one more offer is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时存在的最大 PeerConnection 数，含发布者和观看者；再多一个 offer 就得到 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most QUIC handshakes under way at once; a new connection past it is dropped, and its proxy tries again. Past half of them, a client proves its address with a Retry first, so that Initials from forged addresses hold at most half. 64 when left out or 0.": "同时进行的最大 QUIC 握手数；超出的新连接会被丢弃，其代理会重试。超过一半后，客户端须先以 Retry 证明其地址，使伪造地址的 Initial 最多占一半。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most WHIP and WHEP sessions at once; one more offer is answered 503. 256 when left out or 0.": "同时允许的最大 WHIP 和 WHEP 会话数；多出的 offer 返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most WebSockets open at once; one past it is closed as soon as it opens. A WebSocket that has not proven the password, with a message it seals, is closed after 10s, and one IP address may have a quarter of them open that have not. 32 when left out or 0.": "同时打开的最大 WebSocket 数；超出的在打开后立即被关闭。未以其加密的消息证明密码的 WebSocket 在 10 秒后被关闭，且同一 IP 地址最多可占其中四分之一处于未证明状态。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"Let registered proxies set nodes' services through the hub, as a proxy's pages do; a node takes them only with its allow_hub_services. Every proxy that has the password could then do it. Off when left out: only the hub's own pages ask nodes to change their services.": "允许已注册的代理经由 hub 设置节点的服务（如代理页面所做）；节点只有开启 allow_hub_services 才接受。届时每个持有密码的代理都能这样做。不设置时关闭：只有 hub 自己的页面能请节点修改服务。",
"Let the hubs the node registers with set its services, which are the addresses it opens tunnels to, and write them into this member. Off when left out: only this member and the node's own pages set them.": "允许节点所注册的 hub 设置其服务（即它为隧道连接的地址），并写入本成员。不设置时关闭：只有本成员和节点自己的页面能设置。",
"The most files and directories a scan looks at, across the roots; past it the scan stops there, and says so. 200000 when left out or 0.": "一次扫描在所有根目录中查看的文件和目录的最大数量；超过时扫描在该处停止，并予以说明。不设置或为 0 时为 200000。",
"The most files probed at once on the library's file pool, so that a scan leaves the pool's other workers to the files being served. 4 when left out or 0.": "在媒体库文件池上同时探测的文件的最大数量，使扫描把文件池的其他 worker 留给正在提供的文件。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most items the catalog holds; past it the rest are left out, and the scan says so. 20000 when left out or 0.": "目录所含条目的最大数量；超过时其余条目被略去，并且扫描会予以说明。不设置或为 0 时为 20000。",
"The most jobs that wait for the file pool; one more is refused, as a request answered 503. 4096 when left out or 0.": "等待文件池的作业的最大数量；再多一个会被拒绝，相应的请求答 503。不设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most links from one IP address open at once that have not registered yet; one past it is closed as soon as it opens, and its node or proxy links again after its retry_interval. 32 when left out or 0.": "同一 IP 地址同时打开、尚未注册的最大链路数；超出的在打开后立即被关闭，其节点或代理在 retry_interval 后重新连接。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most links open at once that have not registered yet, which anyone who reaches a listener can open; one past it is closed as soon as it opens, so that they cannot take every link from the nodes and proxies that register. 256 when left out or 0.": "同时打开、尚未注册的最大链路数（任何能连到监听器的人都能打开这类链路）；超出的在打开后立即被关闭，使它们无法占满注册节点和代理的全部链路。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most a dialer waits between attempts at a peer it cannot reach; the waits grow to it, at random within each step. 5s when left out.": "拨号方在尝试连接无法到达的对端之间等待的最长时间；等待时间逐步增长直至该值，每一步内随机取值。不设置时为 5s。",
"The most a request may take, from its last byte to the media server's answer read whole; past it, it is answered 504. 10s when left out.": "一个请求可花费的最长时间，从其最后一个字节到完整读完媒体服务器的应答；超过则得到 504。不设置时为 10s。",
"The most a request may take, from when the proxy takes it to the end of its response, retries included: one past it before its response began is answered 504, and one whose response is under way is cut short. None when left out.": "一个请求可花费的最长时间，从代理接收它到其响应结束，含重试：在响应开始前超过的，得到 504；响应进行中超过的，被中途截断。不设置时为无。",
"The most a whole exchange may take; 10m when left out.": "整个交换可花费的最长时间；不设置时为 10m。",
"The most allocations held at once; one more is refused with 508. Each holds a relayed socket on every event loop. 1024 when left out or 0. A change applies to the next allocation; those held past a lowered one are kept until they end.": "同时持有的最大分配数；再多一个会被拒绝并返回 508。每个分配在每个事件循环上持有一个中继套接字。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。更改对下一次分配生效；因调低而超出的已有分配保留至其结束。",
"The most allocations of one username; one more is refused with 486. 16 when left out or 0. Applies to the next allocation.": "同一用户名的最大分配数；再多一个会被拒绝并返回 486。不设置或为 0 时为 16。对下一次分配生效。",
"The most bits a second a publisher may send: told to it as REMB feedback, which browsers keep under, and enforced with two seconds of burst, past which its packets are dropped. 8000000 when left out or 0.": "发布者每秒可发送的最大比特数：以 REMB 反馈告知它，浏览器会遵守，并以两秒的突发量强制执行，超过则丢弃其数据包。不设置或为 0 时为 8000000。",
"The most bytes a request's body may have.": "请求体可有的最大字节数。",
"The most bytes a second relayed for one username each way, to peers and from them, with a second's worth of burst; datagrams past it are dropped. 2 MiB when left out or 0.": "同一用户名每个方向每秒中继的最大字节数，即发往对端和来自对端的，附带一秒量的突发；超出的数据报被丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 2 MiB。",
"The most bytes of spans waiting to be exported, besides the batch being sent; spans past it are dropped and counted. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "除正在发送的批次外，等待导出的 span 的最大字节数；超出的 span 被丢弃并计数。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"The most bytes the response's CGI header may take; past it the request is answered 502. 64 KiB when left out or 0.": "响应的 CGI 头部可占的最大字节数；超过则请求得到 502。不设置或为 0 时为 64 KiB。",
"The most bytes the zone keeps in memory, bodies, fields and keys counted; past it the least recently used responses go. 128 MiB when left out or 0. Caches of one zone take the size of the last one loaded.": "该区域在内存中保留的最大字节数，计入响应体、字段和键；超过则最近最少使用的响应被移除。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。同一区域的多个缓存取最后加载的大小。",
"The most bytes the zone keeps on disk; past it the least recently used responses go. 1 GiB when left out or 0.": "该区域在磁盘上保留的最大字节数；超过则最近最少使用的响应被移除。不设置或为 0 时为 1 GiB。",
"The most calls and streams a peer may have running here on one link at once; one past it fails at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "对端在此处一条链路上可同时运行的最大调用和流数；超出的立即失败。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most calls the API forwards at once; one past it gets 429. 256 when left out or 0.": "API 同时转发的最大调用数；超出的得到 429。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most calls the node forwards at once, across its models; a call past it goes to another node. 256 when left out or 0.": "节点同时转发的最大调用数，跨其所有模型；超出的调用转给另一节点。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most calls to the model the node forwards at once; a call past it goes to another node. No bound but proxy.max_inflight's when left out or 0.": "节点同时转发的对该模型的最大调用数；超出的调用转给另一节点。不设置或为 0 时仅受 proxy.max_inflight 限制。",
"The most channels one allocation binds; one more is refused with 508. 64 when left out or 0. Applies to the next request.": "一个分配可绑定的最大通道数；再多一个会被拒绝并返回 508。不设置或为 0 时为 64。对下一次请求生效。",
"The most client connections the listeners keep open at once, across all of them; one past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. Takes effect at start, not on a reload. 100000 when left out or 0.": "监听器同时保持打开的最大客户端连接数，跨所有监听器；超出的在被接受后立即关闭。在启动时生效，重载时不生效。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The most connections and udp sessions the service proxies at once; a connection past it is closed as soon as it is accepted, and the datagrams of a session past it are dropped. 10000 when left out or 0.": "该服务同时代理的最大连接数和 udp 会话数；超出的连接在被接受后立即关闭，超出的会话的数据报被丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most connections at once; one more is closed as it opens. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时允许的最大连接数；多出的一个连接在建立时即被关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most connections open at once; one past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. 32 when left out or 0.": "同时打开的最大连接数；超出的在被接受后立即关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most connections open, or being opened, to one address; a request past it waits for one to be free. 256 when left out or 0.": "到同一地址同时打开或正在打开的最大连接数；超出的请求等待有空闲连接。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most connections the API keeps open at once; one past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. 256 when left out or 0.": "API 同时保持打开的最大连接数；超出的在被接受后立即关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most connections the Admin API keeps open at once, a quarter of them kept for those that have made a request with the token (any request, without token_file). When they are taken, a new connection closes the oldest of those that have not, of the client holding the most, and is closed as it is accepted only when every one has; one past a client's share, a quarter of them, is closed too, but for loopback clients. A connection that has not is closed 5s after it is accepted, whatever it is doing. 16 when left out or 0.": "Admin API 同时保持打开的最大连接数，其中四分之一留给已发出带令牌请求的连接（没有 token_file 时为任意请求）。连接占满时，新连接关闭尚未发出此类请求的连接中、持有最多此类连接的客户端最早的那个；只有每个连接都已发出此类请求时，新连接才在被接受后立即关闭；超出单个客户端份额（四分之一）的连接也被关闭，回环客户端除外。尚未发出此类请求的连接在被接受 5s 后关闭，无论其正在做什么。不设置或为 0 时为 16。",
"The most connections the console keeps open at once, a quarter of them kept for those with a login. When they are taken, a new connection closes the oldest of those without one, of the client holding the most, and is closed as it is accepted only when every one has a login; one past a client's share, a quarter of them, is closed too, but for loopback clients. 32 when left out or 0.": "控制台同时保持打开的最大连接数，其中四分之一留给已登录的连接。连接占满时，新连接关闭未登录连接中、持有最多此类连接的客户端最早的那个；只有每个连接都已登录时，新连接才在被接受后立即关闭；超出单个客户端份额（四分之一）的连接也被关闭，回环客户端除外。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most connections the pages keep open at once, a quarter of them kept for those with a login. When they are taken, a new connection closes the oldest of those without one, of the client holding the most, and is closed as it is accepted only when every one has a login; one past a client's share, a quarter of them, is closed too, but for loopback clients. 32 when left out or 0.": "页面同时保持打开的最大连接数，其中四分之一留给已登录的连接。连接占满时，新连接关闭未登录连接中、持有最多此类连接的客户端最早的那个；只有每个连接都已登录时，新连接才在被接受后立即关闭；超出单个客户端份额（四分之一）的连接也被关闭，回环客户端除外。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most connections to the application, each carrying one request at a time. 64 when left out or 0.": "到应用的最大连接数，每个连接一次承载一个请求。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most containers taken; past it, the rest, by name, are left out and reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "所取的最大容器数；超出的其余容器按名称被忽略并报告。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most entries a listing reads and shows; a directory with more is listed in part, and says so. 10000 when left out or 0.": "目录列表读取并显示的最大条目数；条目更多的目录只列出一部分，并会注明。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most events one wait of an event loop collects; the rest wait for the next. 1024 when left out or 0.": "事件循环一次等待所收集的最大事件数；其余的等下一次。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most idle connections kept for later requests. 16 when left out or 0.": "为后续请求保留的最大空闲连接数。不设置或为 0 时为 16。",
"How many leading bits of an IPv6 client address name the client with key ip: a host is given a /64 to pick its addresses from, so counting each address apart would let it make a fresh key with each request. 64 when left out or 0; 128 counts each address apart.": "key 为 ip 时，用 IPv6 客户端地址的前多少位来认定一个客户端：一台主机会分到一个 /64，从中任选地址，若每个地址分开计数，它每个请求都能换一个新键。不写或为 0 时为 64；128 表示每个地址分开计数。",
"The most keys kept at once, which bounds the memory the buckets take: under 100 bytes each, and up to 128 more for a header; 100000 when left out or 0.": "同时保留的最大键数，它限制桶所占的内存：每个不到 100 字节，带头部的最多再加 128；不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The most keys taken; past it, the rest, by key, are left out and reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "所取的最大键数；超出的其余键按键名被忽略并报告。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most links one node or proxy may register, from however many processes of the same name. 128 when left out or 0.": "一个节点或代理可注册的最大链路数，无论来自多少个同名进程。不设置或为 0 时为 128。",
"The most links the hub keeps open at once, registered or not; one past it is closed as soon as it opens. 1024 when left out or 0.": "中心节点同时保持打开的最大链路数，无论是否已注册；超出的在打开后立即关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most links the role takes from its peers at once; one past it is refused, and its dialer backs off. 1024 when left out or 0.": "该角色同时接受其对端的最大链路数；超出的被拒绝，其拨号方会退避。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most logins kept at once; one more ends the oldest. 64 when left out or 0.": "同时保留的最大登录数；再多一个会结束最早的。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most memory an instance may have; one that asks for more fails its call. 128 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个实例可使用的最大内存；请求更多的实例其调用失败。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。",
"The most memory the catalog takes, as reckoned from its items' paths, titles, tracks and codec configurations; past it the rest of the items are left out, and the scan says so. 64 MiB when left out or 0.": "目录所占的最大内存，按其条目的路径、标题、轨道和编解码器配置估算；超过时其余条目被略去，并且扫描会予以说明。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。",
"The most memory the sample tables read from the files take, kept for the files being served; past it the least recently used are dropped, and a table larger than all of it is refused. 128 MiB when left out or 0.": "从文件读取的样本表为正在提供的文件所保留的最大内存；超过时丢弃最久未用的，比全部上限还大的样本表会被拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。",
"The most nodes and proxies registered at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时注册的节点和代理数量上限。未设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most nodes the hub keeps in its table, offline ones included; past it the offline node seen longest ago is forgotten; online nodes are bounded by limits.max_conns and the hub's peers. 1024 when left out or 0.": "中心节点在其表中保留的节点数量上限，含离线节点；超出后，最久之前见到的离线节点会被遗忘；在线节点受 limits.max_conns 和中心节点的对端数量限制。未设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most objects of each kind kept: past it, the rest are left out and reported. 10000 when left out or 0.": "每类对象保留的数量上限：超出后，其余的会被舍弃并报告。未设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most one call may take, from its start to the end of its response. 30m when left out.": "一次调用从开始到响应结束所允许的最长时间。未设置时为 30m。",
"The most one call may take, to the end of its response. 30m when left out.": "一次调用到响应结束所允许的最长时间。未设置时为 30m。",
"The most peer addresses relayed at once, each with a UDP socket of its own toward its media server; past it, a new address's STUN request is dropped. A session relays at most 8 of its peer's addresses. 4096 when left out or 0.": "同时中继的对端地址数量上限，每个地址各有一个通往其媒体服务器的专用 UDP 套接字；超出后，新地址的 STUN 请求会被丢弃。一个会话最多中继其对端的 8 个地址。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most permissions, peer addresses, one allocation holds; one more is refused with 508. A channel's peer counts. 64 when left out or 0. Applies to the next request.": "一个分配（allocation）所持有的权限（即对端地址）数量上限；再多一个会被以 508 拒绝。通道的对端也计入。未设置或为 0 时为 64。对下一个请求生效。",
"The most players of one stream at once, over every protocol, HLS counting once a stream and format; one more is refused. Each packet a publisher sends is handed to every player on the worker that received it. 256 when left out or 0.": "同一个流同时允许的最大播放器数（所有协议合计，HLS 按每个流及格式计一次）；多出的一个会被拒绝。发布者发送的每个包都会在接收它的 worker 上交给每个播放器。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most requests under way at once.": "同时处理中的请求数量上限。",
"The most responses the zone keeps on disk, which bounds the memory their index takes, a few hundred bytes each. 100000 when left out or 0.": "区域在磁盘上保留的响应数量上限，它决定其索引占用的内存，每条约几百字节。未设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The most rotated files kept, newest first; 0 or left out has no count limit.": "最多保留多少个切割文件（从新到旧）；0 或不设置表示不限数量。",
"The most services taken; past it, the rest, by name, are left out and reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "接收的服务数量上限；超出后，其余的服务按名称被舍弃并报告。未设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most sessions at once; one more caller is rejected with 1402. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时允许的最大会话数；多出的调用方会被 1402 拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most sessions proxied at once; one more offer is answered 503 before it reaches a media server. 4096 when left out or 0.": "同时代理的会话数量上限；再多一个 offer 会在到达媒体服务器之前以 503 应答。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most streams at once, each a path with a publisher or players waiting for one; one more publisher is refused. 64 when left out or 0. A change of max_streams, max_players or gop_cache_bytes starts the hub again, ending every stream and connection.": "同时允许的最大流数，每个流是一条有发布者、或有播放者在等待发布者的路径；多出的发布者会被拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 64。修改 max_streams、max_players 或 gop_cache_bytes 会重新启动 hub，结束所有流和连接。",
"The most streams published at once; one more publisher is answered 503. 64 when left out or 0.": "同时发布的流数量上限；再多一个发布者会以 503 应答。未设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most the rotated files may total, the oldest removed until they fit. 1 GiB when left out; 0 does not limit the total.": "切割出的文件总量上限，超出时从最旧的开始删除直到满足。不设置时为 1 GiB；0 表示不限制总量。",
"The most tokens one request may ask for; more is answered 400. 100 when left out.": "一个请求最多可要求的 token 数；更多返回 400。不设置时为 100。",
"The most tunnels open at once, over every forward; a connection past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. 4096 when left out or 0.": "所有转发合计同时打开的隧道数量上限；超出后的连接在被接受后立即关闭。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most tunnels open at once, over every hub; a hub's request for one more is refused. 4096 when left out or 0.": "所有中心节点合计同时打开的隧道数量上限；中心节点再请求多开一个会被拒绝。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most tunnels the hub passes at once; a proxy's request for one more is refused. 16384 when left out or 0.": "中心节点同时放行的隧道数量上限；代理再请求多开一个会被拒绝。未设置或为 0 时为 16384。",
"The most viewers of one stream; one more is answered 503. Each packet a publisher sends is sent again to every viewer, on the worker that received it. 256 when left out or 0.": "一个流的观看者数量上限；再多一个会以 503 应答。发布者发送的每个数据包都会在接收它的 worker 上再发送给每个观看者。未设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most workers each engine's pool runs connections' reads and callbacks on at once. 100 for each CPU fit may use, and at least min_workers, when left out or 0.": "每个引擎的池同时用于运行连接读取和回调的 worker 数量上限。未设置或为 0 时为 fit 可用的每个 CPU 100 个，且不少于 min_workers。",
"The name agents ask for the model by: 1 to 128 characters, no spaces. A name is unique among a node's models of one agent API: an azure_openai model shares openai's.": "代理（agent）请求该模型时使用的名称：1 到 128 个字符，不含空格。名称在节点上同一代理 API 的模型中唯一：azure_openai 模型与 openai 共用同一范围。",
"The name of the hub the tunnels go through. When left out, they are spread over every hub that has the node, more of them through the faster ones.": "隧道所经过的中心节点名称。未设置时，隧道会分散到所有拥有该节点的中心节点上，经由较快者的更多。",
"The name of the upstream connections go to: one of its addresses, picked by its load_balancing (ip_hash by the client's address; header, cookie and URI hashes, which a connection has none of, in turn), out of rotation for its max_fails and health checks as for HTTP, dialed within its connect_timeout. A connect that fails is tried on the next address picked, up to three addresses. Its protocol and HTTP settings are not used.": "连接所前往的上游名称：从其地址中选取一个，按其 load_balancing 选择（ip_hash 按客户端地址；header、cookie 和 URI 哈希因连接没有这些信息，依次退而求其次），按其 max_fails 和健康检查（与 HTTP 相同）移出轮转，并在其 connect_timeout 内拨号。连接失败时会尝试选出的下一个地址，最多三个地址。其协议和 HTTP 设置不被使用。",
"The name of the upstream requests go to; or upstreams.": "请求所前往的上游名称；或 upstreams。",
"The name of the upstream the auth service is.": "认证服务所对应的上游名称。",
"The name of the upstream the copies go to.": "副本所前往的上游名称。",
"The name of the upstream.": "上游的名称。",
"The name the hub shows its peers; the host's name when left out. Its pages change it.": "中心节点向其对端显示的名称；未设置时为主机名。可通过其页面修改。",
"The name the hub tells the nodes and proxies that register. The host's name when left out.": "中心节点告知注册的节点和代理的名称。未设置时为主机名。",
"The name the node shows its peers; the host's name when left out. Its pages, and a hub that settings.allow_hub_manage lets, change it.": "节点向其对端显示的名称；未设置时为主机名。可通过其页面修改，也可由 settings.allow_hub_manage 允许的中心节点修改。",
"The name the provider goes by in the Admin API's /config/effective and in logs: lower-case letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-', unique among the providers. Its kind, as docker, when left out.": "提供者在 Admin API 的 /config/effective 和日志中使用的名称：小写字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'，在各提供者中唯一。未设置时为其类型，如 docker。",
"The name the proxy shows its peers; the host's name when left out. Its pages change it.": "代理向其对端显示的名称；未设置时为主机名。可通过其页面修改。",
"The names of the listeners the route serves; every listener when left out.": "路由所服务的监听器名称；未设置时为所有监听器。",
"The names of the listeners whose connections the service takes: those that serve tcp, alone or beside other protocols, and udp listeners, each one service's. A udp listener's session is a client's address: the datagrams it sends go to one upstream address, from a socket of the session's own, and what comes back to that socket goes to the client.": "服务接收其连接的监听器名称：包括提供 tcp 的监听器（单独或与其他协议并存）以及 udp 监听器，后者每个只属于一个服务。udp 监听器的会话以客户端地址标识：它发来的数据报会从会话专属的套接字发往一个上游地址，而返回到该套接字的数据则发给客户端。",
"The namespaces whose Gateways and routes are served; every namespace when left out. Resources are watched across the cluster either way, so fit's account needs to list and watch them cluster-wide, Secrets of type kubernetes.io/tls among them, and to patch the status of GatewayClasses, Gateways and routes.": "其 Gateway 和路由被服务的命名空间；未设置时为所有命名空间。无论如何，资源都会在整个集群范围内被监视，因此 fit 的账户需要有集群范围的列出和监视权限，其中包括 kubernetes.io/tls 类型的 Secret，并需要有修补 GatewayClass、Gateway 和路由状态的权限。",
"The node whose service the tunnels go to.": "隧道所前往的服务所在的节点。",
"The node's name, which proxies name to reach its services. The host's name when left out.": "节点的名称，代理通过该名称访问其服务。未设置时为主机名。",
"The node's own settings; the defaults when left out. Only its own pages change them.": "节点自身的设置；未设置时为默认值。只有其自己的页面可以修改。",
"The node's service the tunnels go to.": "隧道所前往的节点服务。",
"The node's stable ID, which its peers know it by. Made when left out, and written back here.": "节点的稳定 ID，其对端凭此识别它。未设置时自动生成，并写回此处。",
"The node's web pages; none when left out.": "节点的网页；未设置时没有。",
"The nodes and proxies the hub dials. Its pages change them.": "中心节点拨号连接的节点和代理。可通过其页面修改。",
"The pages' title; fit media when left out.": "页面的标题；不设置时为 fit media。",
"The part of the path before the stream's. /whep/ when left out.": "路径中位于流之前的部分。不设置时为 /whep/。",
"The part of the path before the stream's. /whip/ when left out.": "路径中位于流之前的部分。不设置时为 /whip/。",
"The part of the path before the stream's: with /flv/, /flv/live/cam.flv plays live/cam. / when left out: /live/cam.flv plays live/cam, the stream rtmp://host/live/cam publishes.": "路径中位于流之前的部分：前缀为 /flv/ 时，/flv/live/cam.flv 播放 live/cam。不设置时为 /：/live/cam.flv 播放 live/cam，即 rtmp://host/live/cam 发布的流。",
"The part of the path before the stream's: with /hls/, /hls/live/cam/index.m3u8 is the playlist of live/cam. / when left out.": "路径中位于流之前的部分：前缀为 /hls/ 时，/hls/live/cam/index.m3u8 是 live/cam 的播放列表。不设置时为 /。",
"The password hubs prove to link as a hub, on a node's or a proxy's listener; password when left out.": "中心以中心身份建立链路时证明的密码，用于节点或代理的监听；不设置时为 password。",
"The password nodes prove to link as a node, on a hub's or a proxy's listener; password when left out.": "节点以节点身份建立链路时证明的密码，用于中心或代理的监听；不设置时为 password。",
"The password of every role the listener links with that has no password of its own: peers prove they know it when they link, and it never crosses the network. Whoever holds it may link as any of those roles, so give each role its own instead. None when left out.": "监听所连接的、没有自己密码的各角色共用的密码：对端建立链路时证明自己知道它，它不会在网络上传输。持有它的任何一方都可以以这些角色中的任意一个建立链路，因此应改为给每个角色设置自己的密码。不设置时没有。",
"The password proxies prove to link as a proxy, on a hub's or a node's listener; password when left out.": "代理以代理身份建立链路时证明的密码，用于中心或节点的监听；不设置时为 password。",
"The password the WebSocket's messages are encrypted with, which a proxy's web_proxy needs. The hub's password when left out.": "用于加密 WebSocket 消息的密码，代理的 web_proxy 需要它。未设置时为中心节点的密码。",
"The password the store is encrypted with. Written here, it protects a store copied away from this file, not one read beside it; password_file or password_env keep it out of the file.": "用于加密存储的密码。写在此处只能保护被复制走的存储，而不能防止与此文件放在一起被读取的存储；用 password_file 或 password_env 可使其不出现在文件中。",
"The password; or key.": "密码；或 key。",
"The path the pages are served under, which the route must match with what is below it, as /media/* beside /media; a request outside it gets 404. /media when left out.": "页面所在的路径，路由必须同时匹配该路径及其下的内容，如 /media 旁加 /media/*；该路径之外的请求返回 404。不设置时为 /media。",
"The path the route serves under: the route must match it and what is below it, as /media-tokens and /media-tokens/*; a request outside it gets 404. /media-tokens when left out.": "路由提供服务的路径：路由必须匹配它及其下面的路径，即 /media-tokens 和 /media-tokens/*；其外的请求返回 404。不设置时为 /media-tokens。",
"The path, and query, of the request sent to the auth service; / when left out.": "发送给认证服务的请求的路径和查询；未设置时为 /。",
"The peer's host and port, as its listen.address says.": "对端的主机和端口，如其 listen.address 所示。",
"The name the peer listener's certificate must have with ca_file, and the TLS server name sent; the address's host when left out.": "配合 ca_file 时对端监听证书须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名称；不设置时取 address 中的主机。",
"The PEM certificate self_signed made; with key. Written by the role; delete both for a new one, which every peer must pin again.": "self_signed 生成的 PEM 证书；与 key 一起使用。由角色写入；删除两者会生成新证书，所有对端都须重新固定其指纹。",
"The SHA-256 fingerprint of the certificate the peer's listener presents, 64 hex digits (colons allowed), as its pages and its log show it: the link is made over TLS (wss://) and only to a listener with exactly that certificate. A peer at an address other than a loopback one needs pin or ca_file.": "对端监听所出示证书的 SHA-256 指纹，64 个十六进制数字（可含冒号），即其页面与日志中显示的值：连接走 TLS（wss://），且只连向恰好持有该证书的监听。非回环地址的对端需要 pin 或 ca_file。",
"A PEM file with the certificate the listener presents, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, links are taken over TLS (wss://), and peers check it with their ca_file or pin. A listener on an address other than a loopback one needs TLS: this, or self_signed. Read when the listener starts, and again when it changes on disk (fit run -watch-certs): links from then on are taken with the new certificate, and those open stay.": "PEM 文件，包含监听出示的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，以 TLS（wss://）接受连接，对端用其 ca_file 或 pin 校验该证书。非回环地址上的监听需要 TLS：设置此项，或 self_signed。在监听启动时读取，磁盘上的文件变化时再次读取（fit run -watch-certs）：此后的连接使用新证书，已建立的连接保持不变。",
"A PEM file with the private key of cert_file.": "PEM 文件，包含 cert_file 的私钥。",
"Take links over TLS (wss://) with a self-signed certificate the role makes and keeps, so that it outlives a restart: in cert and key with admin.store, or else in a file beside the config, 0600, as fit.llm.hub.pem beside fit.json; its pages and its log show its SHA-256 fingerprint, which peers set as their pin. For a listener without cert_file.": "以 TLS（wss://）接受连接，使用角色生成并保存的自签名证书，重启后保持不变：有 admin.store 时保存在 cert 与 key 中，否则保存在配置旁的文件中（权限 0600），例如 fit.json 旁的 fit.llm.hub.pem；其页面与日志显示该证书的 SHA-256 指纹，对端将其设为 pin。用于没有 cert_file 的监听。",
"A PEM file with the certificates of the authorities the peer listener's certificate must chain to: the link is made over TLS (wss://), and the certificate must name server_name, or the address's host. Or pin, one of the two.": "PEM 文件，包含对端监听证书须链接到的证书颁发机构的证书：连接走 TLS（wss://），且证书须包含 server_name，或 address 中的主机名。与 pin 二选一。",
"The plugin: a WebAssembly module that exports fit_on_request, as a WASI reactor; package plugin/wasm/guest builds one from Go with GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared.": "插件：一个导出 fit_on_request 的 WebAssembly 模块，作为 WASI reactor；包 plugin/wasm/guest 可用 GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared 从 Go 构建一个。",
"The policy's name, which the auth param of whip, whep and webrtc_proxy, and the media roles, refer to it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "策略的名称，whip、whep、webrtc_proxy 以及各媒体角色的 auth 参数通过它引用该策略。可包含字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The port Ingresses' rules are served on over HTTP. 80 when left out or 0.": "Ingress 的规则通过 HTTP 提供服务的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 80。",
"The port of the HTTPS listener, and the one redirects name when it is not 443. 443 when left out or 0.": "HTTPS 监听器的端口，也是重定向在其不是 443 时所指向的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 443。",
"The port of the listener in the clear that redirects to HTTPS. 80 when left out or 0.": "重定向到 HTTPS 的明文监听器的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 80。",
"The port probes go to, in place of each address's own.": "探测所前往的端口，取代各地址自身的端口。",
"The port the hosts of Ingresses' tls are served on over HTTPS. 443 when left out or 0.": "Ingress 的 tls 中的主机通过 HTTPS 提供服务的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 443。",
"The property's path, by segment, as [\"route_metadata\", \"filter_metadata\", \"envoy.filters.http.wasm\", \"auth\"].": "属性的路径，按段给出，如 [\"route_metadata\", \"filter_metadata\", \"envoy.filters.http.wasm\", \"auth\"]。",
"The protocol: tls, TCP over TLS; wss, a WebSocket over TLS, for networks that let only HTTPS through; quic, over UDP; or tcp and ws, the same in the clear, which only a loopback address, or a hub with body_password, may take.": "协议：tls，基于 TLS 的 TCP；wss，基于 TLS 的 WebSocket，用于只允许 HTTPS 通过的网络；quic，基于 UDP；或 tcp 和 ws，即对应的明文协议，只有回环地址或设置了 body_password 的中心节点才能使用。",
"The protocols served: http/1.1, h2c (HTTP/2 in the clear) and, with tls, h2 (HTTP/2 over TLS, chosen through ALPN) and h3 (HTTP/3 over QUIC, on the same port in UDP, announced to HTTP/1 and HTTP/2 clients with Alt-Svc); tcp, raw TCP, whose connections the services that list the listener proxy to their upstreams; socks, a SOCKS5 and SOCKS4 forward proxy, as socks says; or udp alone, whose datagrams a service proxies. A listener that serves more than one of HTTP, tcp and socks tells them apart on its port by what a client sends first: a TLS ClientHello goes to the service whose server_names hold its name, or else, with tls, is served HTTPS, or else goes to the service without server_names; a SOCKS greeting to socks; an HTTP request, in the clear, to HTTP; and whatever else to the service without server_names, or it is closed. A client that waits for the server to speak first is closed after 10s: such a protocol needs a listener of its own. http/1.1 alone when left out, or http/1.1 and h2 with tls.": "所提供的协议：http/1.1、h2c（明文 HTTP/2），以及在有 tls 时的 h2（TLS 上的 HTTP/2，通过 ALPN 选择）和 h3（QUIC 上的 HTTP/3，在同一端口的 UDP 上，通过 Alt-Svc 向 HTTP/1 和 HTTP/2 客户端宣告）；tcp，原始 TCP，其连接由列出该监听器的服务代理到其上游；socks，SOCKS5 和 SOCKS4 正向代理，如 socks 所述；或单独的 udp，其数据报由服务代理。同时提供 HTTP、tcp 和 socks 中不止一种的监听器，根据客户端先发送的内容在其端口上区分它们：TLS ClientHello 交给 server_names 包含其名称的服务，否则在有 tls 时按 HTTPS 提供服务，否则交给没有 server_names 的服务；SOCKS 问候交给 socks；明文的 HTTP 请求交给 HTTP；其他任何内容交给没有 server_names 的服务，否则关闭连接。等待服务器先发言的客户端会在 10s 后被关闭：这类协议需要独占一个监听器。未设置时仅为 http/1.1，有 tls 时为 http/1.1 和 h2。",
"The proxy's name, which the hubs and nodes show. The host's name when left out.": "代理的名称，中心节点和节点会显示它。未设置时为主机名。",
"The proxy's stable ID, which its peers know it by. Made when left out, and written back here.": "代理的稳定 ID，其对端凭此识别它。未设置时自动生成，并写回此处。",
"The proxy's web pages; none when left out.": "代理的网页；未设置时没有。",
"The realm of the challenges, which Digest's response is computed with. fit when left out.": "质询的 realm，Digest 的响应据此计算。不设置时为 fit。",
"The realm of the credentials, sent in every challenge: clients derive their key from their name, the realm and their password. A change starts a new server, ending the allocations of the old one when they share an address and draining it otherwise.": "凭据的 realm，在每次质询中发送：客户端根据其名称、realm 和密码派生其密钥。更改会启动一个新服务器；若新旧服务器共用一个地址，则结束旧服务器的分配，否则将其排空。",
"The realm the browser shows when it asks for a user and password; fit when left out.": "浏览器请求用户名和密码时显示的 realm；未设置时为 fit。",
"The receive latency asked for, the time a packet may take to be sent again when lost; the caller's wins when larger. 120ms when left out.": "所要求的接收延迟，即丢包后重发所允许花费的时间；调用方的值更大时以调用方为准。不设置时为 120ms。",
"The request's fields sent to the auth service; all but the hop-by-hop ones and those of the body when left out.": "发送给认证服务的请求字段；未设置时为除逐跳字段和请求体相关字段之外的全部字段。",
"The response body.": "响应体。",
"The role the peer must announce; a link to a peer of another role is refused. Never the dialing role's own.": "对端必须宣告的角色；与其他角色的对端建立链路会被拒绝。绝不能是拨号方自己的角色。",
"The schemes a 401 offers for users: digest, which needs a user's plaintext password, and basic, which sends the password in the clear and is the only one a password_hash user can use. [\"digest\"] when left out.": "401 为用户提供的方案：digest 需要用户的明文密码，basic 以明文发送密码，且是 password_hash 用户唯一可用的方案。不设置时为 [\"digest\"]。",
"The script a path ending in / runs; index.php when left out.": "以 / 结尾的路径所运行的脚本；未设置时为 index.php。",
"The segment format of a playlist's URL without a format query parameter: fmp4, fragmented MP4 for H.264, H.265, AV1, AAC and Opus, or ts, MPEG-TS for H.264, H.265, AAC and Opus. The other is played with ?format=ts or ?format=fmp4. fmp4 when left out.": "没有 format 查询参数的播放列表 URL 所用的分片格式：fmp4，即分片 MP4，适用于 H.264、H.265、AV1、AAC 和 Opus；或 ts，即 MPEG-TS，适用于 H.264、H.265、AAC 和 Opus。另一种格式用 ?format=ts 或 ?format=fmp4 播放。不设置时为 fmp4。",
"The server names (SNI) of the TLS connections the service takes from its tcp listeners, which it proxies as they are, without terminating their TLS; \"*.example.com\" takes the names one label below example.com. A tcp listener may then be listed by several services: a connection goes to the one whose names hold the name its ClientHello asks for, or else to the listener's service without server_names, if it has one, as one that is not TLS or asks for no name does; otherwise it is closed. The ClientHello must come within 10s.": "服务从其 tcp 监听器接收的 TLS 连接的服务器名称（SNI），服务按原样代理这些连接，不终止其 TLS；\"*.example.com\" 匹配 example.com 之下一级标签的名称。这样一个 tcp 监听器可以被多个服务列出：连接会交给其名称包含 ClientHello 所请求名称的服务，否则交给该监听器中没有 server_names 的服务（如果有），非 TLS 或未请求名称的连接同样如此；否则连接被关闭。ClientHello 必须在 10s 内到达。",
"The server's host and port. 127.0.0.1:6379 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口。未设置时为 127.0.0.1:6379。",
"The server's stun:, stuns:, turn: or turns: URLs.": "服务器的 stun:、stuns:、turn: 或 turns: URL。",
"The servers requests can be proxied to, by name.": "可以将请求代理到的服务器，按名称。",
"The service's TCP address, host and port.": "服务的 TCP 地址，含主机和端口。",
"The service's name among the node's, which proxies' forwards name.": "服务在节点的服务中的名称，代理的转发通过该名称引用它。",
"The service.name of the resource traces and metrics are about. fit when left out.": "追踪和指标所针对的资源的 service.name。未设置时为 fit。",
"The services the node reaches, and the only addresses it opens tunnels to.": "节点可访问的服务，也是它仅有的可以打开隧道的地址。",
"The share of failures in the window that opens it; 0.5 when left out.": "窗口内触发开启的失败占比；未设置时为 0.5。",
"The share of requests copied, chosen at random; all of them when left out.": "被复制的请求占比，随机选取；未设置时为全部请求。",
"The share of requests traced among those whose caller did not decide: from 0 to 1. A request whose traceparent says its caller sampled it is always traced, and one that says it did not is never. 0, only those a caller sampled, when left out.": "在调用方未决定的请求中被追踪的请求占比：0 到 1。traceparent 表明调用方已采样的请求总是被追踪，表明未采样的则绝不追踪。未设置时为 0，即仅追踪调用方已采样的请求。",
"The shared secret of time-limited credentials, as coturn's static-auth-secret (use-auth-secret) has it: a username \"<expiry in Unix seconds>:<anything>\" whose password is the base64 of HMAC-SHA1(secret, username), valid until the expiry. A web service that knows the secret hands them out.": "限时凭据的共享密钥，与 coturn 的 static-auth-secret（use-auth-secret）相同：用户名为 \"<expiry in Unix seconds>:<anything>\"，其密码是 HMAC-SHA1(secret, username) 的 base64，在过期时间前有效。知道该密钥的 Web 服务会分发这些凭据。",
"The shortest declared body compressed; 1024 when left out. A body that declares no length, as one that streams, is compressed.": "被压缩的响应体声明长度的最小值；未设置时为 1024。未声明长度的响应体（如流式响应体）会被压缩。",
"The status code; 200 when left out.": "状态码；未设置时为 200。",
"The status of a request refused; 429 when left out, or 503 as nginx's limit_conn answers.": "被拒绝请求的状态码；未设置时为 429，或如 nginx 的 limit_conn 那样为 503。",
"The status of a request refused; 429 when left out.": "被拒绝请求的状态码；未设置时为 429。",
"The status: 301 and 308 are permanent, 302, 303 and 307 temporary; 307 and 308 keep the method and body. 302 when left out.": "状态码：301 和 308 为永久重定向，302、303 和 307 为临时重定向；307 和 308 保留方法和请求体。未设置时为 302。",
"The statuses that count as failures; 500 to 599 when left out.": "算作失败的状态码；未设置时为 500 到 599。",
"The store responses are kept in. Caches of the same zone, in one route or several, share it, its size and its keys; it is kept across reloads while a cache uses it. default when left out.": "响应保存所在的存储。同一区域的缓存，无论在一个路由还是多个路由中，共享该存储、其大小及其键；只要有缓存在使用它，它就会在重新加载后保留。未设置时为 default。",
"The store's file, made 0600 when it is written. fit stops at start if it exists and does not open with the password.": "存储的文件，写入时权限为 0600。如果它存在而无法用该密码打开，fit 会在启动时停止。",
"The stream's name. When left out, the name is the last segment of the path a POST is sent to, as cam1 in /whep/cam1 on a route of /whep/*: one route plays every stream. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too, as /watch/* beside /watch.": "流的名称。未设置时，名称为 POST 所发送路径的最后一段，如路由为 /whep/* 时 /whep/cam1 中的 cam1：一个路由播放所有流。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配它，如 /watch 旁边的 /watch/*。",
"The stream's name. When left out, the name is the last segment of the path a POST is sent to, as cam1 in /whip/cam1 on a route of /whip/*: one route takes every stream. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too, as /live/* beside /live.": "流的名称。未设置时，名称为 POST 所发送路径的最后一段，如路由为 /whip/* 时 /whip/cam1 中的 cam1：一个路由接收所有流。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配它，如 /live 旁边的 /live/*。",
"The stream's path. When left out, it is the path after prefix a POST is sent to, as live/cam in /whep/live/cam. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too.": "流的路径。不设置时为 POST 所发送的 prefix 之后的路径，如 /whep/live/cam 中的 live/cam。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配该 URL。",
"The stream's path. When left out, it is the path after prefix a POST is sent to, as live/cam in /whip/live/cam. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too.": "流的路径。不设置时为 POST 所发送的 prefix 之后的路径，如 /whip/live/cam 中的 live/cam。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配该 URL。",
"The stream-name prefixes this route may sign for: every publish and play pattern of a request must start with one of them, so that a token cannot be signed for a stream outside them, as mtg- for mtg-42-*. Any valid pattern when left out.": "该路由可以为其签发 token 的流名前缀：请求中的每个 publish 和 play 模式都必须以其中之一开头，因此无法为这些前缀之外的流签发 token，例如用 mtg- 对应 mtg-42-*。不设置时接受任何合法模式。",
"The streams the token may play, as publish lists them. None when left out.": "该 token 可播放的流，写法与 publish 相同。不设置时为无。",
"The streams the token may publish, by name or path, with * matching any run of characters, '/' among them, as live/* or room1-*. None when left out.": "该 token 可发布的流，按名称或路径给出，* 匹配任意一串字符（包括 '/'），如 live/* 或 room1-*。不设置时为无。",
"The streams the user may play. None when left out.": "该用户可播放的流。不设置时为无。",
"The streams the user may publish, as a token's publish lists them. None when left out.": "该用户可发布的流，写法与 token 的 publish 相同。不设置时为无。",
"The token, at least 16 characters. Or token_sha256, one of the two.": "token，至少 16 个字符。与 token_sha256 二选一。",
"The tunnel's roles to run beside the gateway, on its engine: a hub, a node and a proxy, which reach services behind NAT through the hub. None when left out. What their web pages change is written back here.": "在网关旁边、在其引擎上运行的隧道角色：hub、node 和 proxy，它们通过中心节点访问 NAT 之后的服务。未设置时没有。它们的网页所做的更改会写回此处。",
"The upstream of the media servers, picked by its load balancing for each offer: fit's own whip and whep, or any WHIP or WHEP server. Its health checks and timeouts apply.": "媒体服务器的上游，每个 offer 按其负载均衡选取：fit 自己的 whip 和 whep，或任何 WHIP 或 WHEP 服务器。其健康检查和超时适用。",
"The upstream's base URL, http or https, without a query or a trailing slash. openai, anthropic and cohere calls go to it with their path appended, as base_url/chat/completions with http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1; gemini's to base_url/models/{upstream}:{method}, with https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta; azure_openai's to base_url/openai/deployments/{upstream}/{path}, with https://{resource}.openai.azure.com; ollama's to base_url/api/chat, with http://127.0.0.1:11434.": "上游的基础 URL，http 或 https，不含查询和末尾斜杠。openai、anthropic 和 cohere 的调用发往它并附加其路径，如 http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1 时为 base_url/chat/completions；gemini 的发往 base_url/models/{upstream}:{method}，如 https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta；azure_openai 的发往 base_url/openai/deployments/{upstream}/{path}，如 https://{resource}.openai.azure.com；ollama 的发往 base_url/api/chat，如 http://127.0.0.1:11434。",
"The user to authenticate as, with password_file, when etcd's authentication is on; none when left out.": "当 etcd 的认证开启时，配合 password_file 用于认证的用户；未设置时没有。",
"The user's name.": "用户名。",
"The user's name; it may not contain a colon or a control character.": "用户名；不得包含冒号或控制字符。",
"The user's name; it may not contain a colon.": "用户名；不能包含冒号。",
"The user's password. A user with one can also log in with RTSP's Digest, which needs the password itself. Or password_hash, one of the two.": "用户的密码。设置了密码的用户也可以使用 RTSP 的 Digest 登录，Digest 需要密码本身。与 password_hash 二选一。",
"The username.": "用户名。",
"The users allowed in, with their passwords' bcrypt hashes.": "允许进入的用户，附带其密码的 bcrypt 哈希。",
"The users with fixed credentials. With secret, or alone; at least one of the two.": "使用固定凭据的用户。配合 secret 使用，或单独使用；二者至少要有一个。",
"The version of fit's config this one is written for, 1; fit refuses a config written for a version it does not read, rather than read it wrongly. Optional: a config that leaves it out is read as version 1.": "此配置所针对的 fit 配置版本，即 1；fit 会拒绝为其不能读取的版本编写的配置，而不是错误地读取。可选：未设置的配置按版本 1 读取。",
"The window max_fails are counted in, and how long an address that reached them stays out; 10s when left out.": "统计 max_fails 的窗口，也是达到该值的地址被移出的时长；未设置时为 10s。",
"The zone a line's time is written in, and the zone a file's interval is rotated at: local (the default), utc, or an IANA zone name such as Asia/Shanghai. json and text wrote UTC and line local before this setting; now every format writes this zone, local when left out, and 24h turns at local midnight. A change takes effect on reload.": "一行时间写入所用、以及文件按 interval 切割所用的时区：local（默认）、utc，或 Asia/Shanghai 这类 IANA 时区名。在此设置之前，json 和 text 写 UTC、line 写本地时间；现在每种格式都写这个时区，不设置时为本地时间，24h 在本地午夜切割。修改后重载即生效。",
"The zone the time of every line is written in, and the zone a file's interval is rotated at: local (the default), utc, or an IANA zone name such as Asia/Shanghai. So 24h turns at local midnight by default, and at UTC midnight with utc. The zone database is embedded, so an IANA name works in a container without zoneinfo. A change takes effect on reload.": "每行时间写入所用、以及文件按 interval 切割所用的时区：local（默认）、utc，或 Asia/Shanghai 这类 IANA 时区名。因此默认 24h 在本地午夜切割，设为 utc 时在 UTC 午夜切割。时区数据库已内嵌，没有 zoneinfo 的容器中 IANA 名称也可用。修改后重载即生效。",
"Trace requests: a server span for each one sampled, and its context sent on to upstreams in traceparent. No traces when left out.": "追踪请求：为每个被采样的请求生成一个服务端 span，并通过 traceparent 将其上下文继续发送给上游。未设置时不追踪。",
"Turn HTTPS by default off: no listeners are made for a config that writes none, and an empty tls gets no certificates.": "关闭默认的 HTTPS：对于未写任何监听器的配置不创建监听器，空的 tls 也不会获得证书。",
"Turns on Low-Latency HLS with parts this long, 200ms to 1s being usual: blocking playlist reloads, EXT-X-PART and preload hints. Off when left out.": "启用低延迟 HLS，分片（part）为此时长，通常为 200ms 到 1s：阻塞式播放列表重载、EXT-X-PART 和预加载提示。不设置时关闭。",
"URLs of fit's own TURN server, webrtc.turn, as peers reach it, as in \"turn:turn.example.com:3478\": each answer's Link headers carry them with time-limited credentials made from webrtc.turn's secret, which must be set.": "fit 自己的 TURN 服务器 webrtc.turn 的 URL，即对端访问它时使用的地址，如 \"turn:turn.example.com:3478\"：每个应答的 Link 头会携带它们，以及由 webrtc.turn 的 secret 生成的限时凭据，该 secret 必须已设置。",
"Up to how much longer than interval each wait between probes may be, chosen at random each time, so that probes from many upstreams spread out; a tenth of interval when left out. Less than interval.": "每次探测之间的等待时间最多可比 interval 长多少，每次随机选取，使来自众多上游的探测错开；未设置时为 interval 的十分之一。小于 interval。",
"Upstreams requests are spread over at random by weight, as a canary release does, in place of upstream.": "请求按权重随机分配到的上游，如金丝雀发布所做的那样，取代 upstream。",
"Users with a password, each with the streams they may publish and play: sent as Authorization: Basic, as user and pass query parameters where a protocol has no header (RTMP, SRT), or RTSP's Digest. They also log in to fit's media pages, which hand out tokens signed with secret.": "带密码的用户，每个用户有其可发布和可播放的流：以 Authorization: Basic 发送，在协议没有请求头时（RTMP、SRT）以 user 和 pass 查询参数发送，或使用 RTSP 的 Digest。他们也可以登录 fit 的媒体页面，页面会发放用 secret 签名的 token。",
"Values to add to fields, after any already there.": "要添加到字段的值，附加在已有的值之后。",
"What a call that fails, traps or runs past its timeout leads to: fail answers 500, or fails a response under way, closing its HTTP/1 connection or resetting its stream; skip lets the request or its response go on as if the plugin were not there. fail when left out.": "调用失败、触发 trap或超时后的处理：fail 应答 500，或使进行中的响应失败，关闭其 HTTP/1 连接或重置其流；skip 让请求或其响应继续进行，就像插件不存在一样。未设置时为 fail。",
"What a request must match; every request when left out.": "请求必须匹配的条件；未设置时匹配每个请求。",
"What an offer asks of auth: publish for a WHIP endpoint, play for a WHEP one. Required with auth.": "offer 对 auth 的要求：WHIP 端点为 publish，WHEP 端点为 play。设置了 auth 时必填。",
"What answers the request.": "应答请求的内容。",
"What ends a script's name in a path, the rest being PATH_INFO: \"/index.php/a/b\" runs /index.php with PATH_INFO /a/b. A static handler on a file system that folds case serves no file with one of these extensions, in any case. [\".php\"] when left out.": "脚本名称在路径中的结束标志，其余部分为 PATH_INFO：\"/index.php/a/b\" 运行 /index.php，PATH_INFO 为 /a/b。在不区分大小写的文件系统上，static 处理器不提供带这些扩展名（不论大小写）的任何文件。未设置时为 [\".php\"]。",
"What fit runs for WebRTC beside the gateway, on its engine: a TURN server, the media port of the whip and whep handlers, and the relay of the webrtc_proxy handler. None when left out.": "fit 在网关旁边、在其引擎上为 WebRTC 运行的内容：TURN 服务器、whip 和 whep 处理器的媒体端口，以及 webrtc_proxy 处理器的中继。未设置时没有。",
"What replaces each match of regexp, in which $1 or ${name} stand for the regexp's groups.": "用于替换 regexp 每处匹配的内容，其中 $1 或 ${name} 代表 regexp 的分组。",
"What requests are counted by: ip, the client's address; route, every request of the route together; or header:Name, a header's value, with a request without it counted by ip. ip when left out.": "请求计数所依据的对象：ip，客户端地址；route，路由的所有请求合计；或 header:Name，某个头的值，没有该头的请求按 ip 计数。未设置时为 ip。",
"What the URL is, as RTMP or SRT.": "该 URL 的类别，如 RTMP 或 SRT。",
"What the key is for: 1 to 64 characters.": "该密钥的用途：1 到 64 个字符。",
"What the keys kept start with, as fit/certificates/<CA>/<name>.pem; instances that share certificates share it. fit/ when left out.": "所保存的密钥的前缀，如 fit/certificates/<CA>/<name>.pem；共享证书的实例共用它。未设置时为 fit/。",
"What the labels read start with, as in fit.routes.web.host. fit when left out.": "所读取标签的前缀，如 fit.routes.web.host。未设置时为 fit。",
"What the service is, for the pages.": "该服务是什么，用于页面显示。",
"What the tags read start with, as in fit.routes.web.host=example.com; tags without '=' are passed over. Besides the routes, services and upstream settings a Docker container's labels may set, <tag_prefix>.name names the upstream, the service's name when left out. fit when left out.": "所读取标签（tag）的前缀，如 fit.routes.web.host=example.com；不含 '=' 的标签会被跳过。除 Docker 容器的标签可设置的路由、服务和上游设置外，<tag_prefix>.name 为上游命名，未设置时为服务的名称。未设置时为 fit。",
"What the token is called in logs, which never show the token itself: token:<name>, or token when left out.": "日志中对该 token 的称呼，日志从不显示 token 本身：token:<name>，不设置时为 token。",
"When the key was made, in seconds since 1970.": "密钥的创建时间，自 1970 年起的秒数。",
"Where Consul's HTTP API is, as of the local agent: http:// or https:// and a host and port. http://127.0.0.1:8500 when left out.": "Consul 的 HTTP API 所在位置，即本地代理的位置：http:// 或 https:// 加主机和端口。未设置时为 http://127.0.0.1:8500。",
"Where a line is written for each request, as JSON or, as its format says, text or line; no access log when left out.": "为每个请求写入一行的位置，格式为 JSON，或按其 format 所指定的 text 或 line；未设置时没有访问日志。",
"Where etcd's client API is: http:// or https:// and a host and port, for each member to try, in turn when one fails. http://127.0.0.1:2379 when left out.": "etcd 客户端 API 所在位置：http:// 或 https:// 加主机和端口，每个成员各一个，一个失败时依次尝试下一个。未设置时为 http://127.0.0.1:2379。",
"Where nodes and proxies link to the hub, each over its protocol. A tcp or ws listener on an address that is not a loopback one needs body_password: use tls, wss or quic there. None when left out: the console's pages add them.": "节点和代理连接到中心节点的位置，各自基于其协议。非回环地址上的 tcp 或 ws 监听器需要 body_password：在那里请使用 tls、wss 或 quic。未设置时没有：控制台的页面会添加它们。",
"Where requests to a Service go: endpoints, to its ready endpoints from its EndpointSlices, balanced by fit; or cluster_ip, to its cluster IP, balanced by the cluster. endpoints when left out.": "对 Service 的请求前往的位置：endpoints，前往其 EndpointSlice 中就绪的端点，由 fit 做负载均衡；或 cluster_ip，前往其集群 IP，由集群做负载均衡。未设置时为 endpoints。",
"Where the Admin API listens: a host and port, or \"unix/\" and the path of a Unix socket, as in \"unix//run/fit/admin.sock\". A host that is not a loopback address or localhost needs token_file, cert_file and key_file, so that only holders of the token reach the API and the token never crosses a network in the clear. 127.0.0.1:2019 when left out.": "Admin API 监听的位置：主机和端口，或 \"unix/\" 加 Unix 套接字的路径，如 \"unix//run/fit/admin.sock\"。主机不是回环地址或 localhost 时，需要 token_file、cert_file 和 key_file，使只有持有令牌者能访问 API，且令牌不会以明文穿过网络。未设置时为 127.0.0.1:2019。",
"Where the Docker daemon's API is: unix:// and a socket's path, or tcp:// and a host and port, as of a socket proxy, in plain HTTP. unix:///var/run/docker.sock when left out.": "Docker 守护进程 API 所在位置：unix:// 加套接字路径，或 tcp:// 加主机和端口（如套接字代理的），使用明文 HTTP。未设置时为 unix:///var/run/docker.sock。",
"Where the application listens: a host and port, as \"127.0.0.1:9000\", or \"unix/\" and a socket's path, as \"unix//run/php/php-fpm.sock\".": "应用监听的位置：主机和端口，如 \"127.0.0.1:9000\"，或 \"unix/\" 加套接字路径，如 \"unix//run/php/php-fpm.sock\"。",
"Where the hub takes links from nodes and proxies; none when left out. Its pages change it.": "中心节点接收来自节点和代理的链路的位置；未设置时没有。可通过其页面修改。",
"Where the node takes links from hubs and proxies; none when left out. Its pages change it.": "节点接收来自中心节点和代理的链路的位置；未设置时没有。可通过其页面修改。",
"Where the proxy takes links from hubs and nodes; none when left out. Its pages change it.": "代理接收来自中心节点和节点的链路的位置；未设置时没有。可通过其页面修改。",
"Where the token is: header, after Bearer in the Authorization field; header:Name, the whole of that field; cookie:name; or query:name. header when left out.": "令牌所在位置：header，Authorization 字段中 Bearer 之后；header:Name，该字段的全部内容；cookie:name；或 query:name。未设置时为 header。",
"Where to: a URL or a path, in which {scheme}, {host} (with its port, as the client sent it), {path}, {query} (without the '?') and {uri} (the path and query) stand for the request's, and, with regexp, $1 or ${name} for its groups, as in \"https://{host}{uri}\" or \"/new/$1\".": "目标位置：URL 或路径，其中 {scheme}、{host}（含端口，与客户端发送的一致）、{path}、{query}（不含 '?'）和 {uri}（路径和查询）代表请求的相应部分，配合 regexp 时 $1 或 ${name} 代表其分组，如 \"https://{host}{uri}\" 或 \"/new/$1\"。",
"Whether a member's camera is on when it joins a call in the pages: off when left out, for the member to switch on, and a publisher sends a frame with its name while it is off, so a switch never renegotiates. The URL's cam=0 or cam=1 overrides it.": "页面中成员加入通话时摄像头是否开启：不设置时为关闭，由成员自行开启；关闭期间推流方发送带名字的帧，因此开关不会触发重新协商。URL 中的 cam=0 或 cam=1 覆盖此设置。",
"Whether a member's microphone is on when it joins a call in the pages: off when left out, for the member to switch on, and a publisher sends a silent track while it is off, so a switch never renegotiates. The URL's mic=0 or mic=1 overrides it.": "页面中成员加入通话时麦克风是否开启：不设置时为关闭，由成员自行开启；关闭期间推流方发送静音轨道，因此开关不会触发重新协商。URL 中的 mic=0 或 mic=1 覆盖此设置。",
"Whether a room call has a chat: the pages show it, and the room API carries the members' text messages and small files between them. False answers the chat's API 404 and shows no chat window. True when left out.": "房间通话是否有聊天：页面显示聊天窗口，房间 API 在成员之间传递文字消息和小文件。为 false 时聊天的 API 返回 404，且不显示聊天窗口。不设置时为 true。",
"Whether files and directories whose names start with a dot, as .git, .env and .htpasswd do, are served: deny answers a request for one, or for anything under a dot directory, 404, as for a file not there, but /.well-known/ under the root, for ACME's HTTP-01 challenge and security.txt; allow serves them as other files. Listings leave them out either way. On Windows deny also hides a path with a segment shaped as an 8.3 short name, as GIT~1 for .git, which NTFS may give a dotfile. deny when left out.": "是否提供名称以点开头的文件和目录（如 .git、.env 和 .htpasswd）：deny 对请求它们或点目录之下任何内容的请求返回 404，如同文件不存在，但根目录下的 /.well-known/ 除外，供 ACME 的 HTTP-01 质询和 security.txt 使用；allow 像其他文件一样提供它们。无论哪种，目录列表都不列出它们。在 Windows 上，deny 还会隐藏含有形如 8.3 短文件名的段的路径（如 .git 的 GIT~1，NTFS 可能为点文件生成）。不设置时为 deny。",
"Whether scripts whose paths have a segment starting with a dot, as /.git/x.php or /.env, run: deny answers a request for one 404, and try_files passes over it, but /.well-known/ under the root; allow runs them as other scripts. On Windows deny also refuses a script with a segment shaped as an 8.3 short name, as GIT~1 for .git, which NTFS may give a dotfile. The path info after a script is not looked at. deny when left out.": "路径中有以点开头的段的脚本（如 /.git/x.php 或 /.env）是否运行：deny 对请求它们的请求返回 404，try_files 也会跳过它们，但根目录下的 /.well-known/ 除外；allow 像其他脚本一样运行它们。脚本之后的 path info 不受检查。在 Windows 上，deny 还会拒绝含有形如 8.3 短文件名的段的脚本（如 .git 的 GIT~1，NTFS 可能为点文件生成）。不设置时为 deny。",
"Who may log in: at least one user.": "谁可以登录：至少一个用户。",
"Who may use the listener's socks, and where it connects them: needed with socks. It serves CONNECT, without authentication, and refuses BIND and UDP ASSOCIATE.": "谁可以使用监听器的 socks，以及将其连接到何处：使用 socks 时必需。它提供 CONNECT，不做认证，并拒绝 BIND 和 UDP ASSOCIATE。",
"With h2: a PEM file of the certificates the servers' are checked against, in place of the system's roots. It is watched, as a listener's certificate files are: a change loads the config again.": "配合 h2：一个 PEM 文件，包含用于校验服务器证书的证书，取代系统根证书。它会被监视，与监听器的证书文件一样：更改会重新加载配置。",
"With h2: a PEM file of the client certificate, and the chain after it, that fit presents to servers that ask for one (mutual TLS); needs tls_key_file. It is watched, as tls_ca_file is: a change loads the config again.": "配合 h2：一个 PEM 文件，包含 fit 向索要客户端证书的服务器出示的客户端证书及其后的证书链（双向 TLS）；需要 tls_key_file。它会被监视，与 tls_ca_file 一样：更改会重新加载配置。",
"With h2: the PEM file of tls_cert_file's private key.": "配合 h2：tls_cert_file 的私钥的 PEM 文件。",
"With h2: the name the servers' certificates are checked against, and sent in SNI; each address's host when left out.": "配合 h2：用于校验服务器证书并在 SNI 中发送的名称；未设置时为各地址的主机。",
"With header_hash, the header, and with cookie_hash, the cookie, whose value requests are hashed by.": "配合 header_hash 时为头，配合 cookie_hash 时为 cookie，请求按其值做哈希。",
"With http: the Host field the probe sends; the address's host when left out.": "配合 http：探测发送的 Host 字段；未设置时为地址的主机。",
"With http: the path, and query, the probe asks for; / when left out.": "配合 http：探测请求的路径和查询；未设置时为 /。",
"With http: the statuses that pass; any from 200 to 399 when left out.": "配合 http：视为通过的状态码；未设置时为 200 到 399 的任意状态码。",
"With slow_threshold, the share of slow responses in the window that opens it; 0.5 when left out.": "配合 slow_threshold：窗口内触发开启的慢响应占比；未设置时为 0.5。",
"fit's own log: what it says about starting, reloading, certificates, providers and the engine, by logger, each with the least level written, and the format and output it writes in, as fib writes its own. Messages at info and debug to stdout and the rest to stderr, at info and above, as lines, when left out.": "fit 自己的日志：它关于启动、重新加载、证书、提供者和引擎的输出，按 logger 区分，每个 logger 有写入的最低级别，以及写入的格式和输出位置，与 fib 写自己的日志一样。未设置时，info 和 debug 级别的消息输出到 stdout，其余输出到 stderr，级别为 info 及以上，格式为行。",
"fit's streaming role, beside the gateway on its engine: one media hub where a stream is published once, over RTMP, RTSP, SRT or WHIP, and played over any of them, HTTP-FLV and HLS too, each listener and handler with its media_auth policy. None when left out.": "fit 的流媒体角色，运行在其引擎上、与网关并列：一个媒体 hub，流只需发布一次（通过 RTMP、RTSP、SRT 或 WHIP），即可通过其中任何一种以及 HTTP-FLV 和 HLS 播放，每个监听器和处理器各有其 media_auth 策略。不设置时为无。",
"http sends a GET request, over the upstream's protocol, and passes on an expected status; tcp passes once a connection opens. http when left out.": "http 通过上游的协议发送 GET 请求，并放行预期的状态码；tcp 在连接打开后即视为通过。未设置时为 http。",
"require: a client without a valid certificate is refused in the handshake; verify_if_given: a client may send none, and a route that needs one says so with the client_cert middleware, but one it sends must be valid. require when left out. A listener that requires certificates cannot answer ACME's TLS-ALPN-01 challenge, whose CA sends none.": "require：没有有效证书的客户端在握手时被拒绝；verify_if_given：客户端可以不发送证书，需要证书的路由通过 client_cert 中间件声明这一点，但客户端发送的证书必须有效。未设置时为 require。要求证书的监听器无法应答 ACME 的 TLS-ALPN-01 质询，因为其 CA 不发送证书。",
"The PEM private key of cert_file.": "cert_file 的 PEM 私钥。",
"A PEM file of the CAs that sign the hub's certificate, which tls://, wss:// and quic:// endpoints check it against, its name too, in place of the system's roots. Read at each dial. Not with pin.": "PEM 文件，包含为中心节点证书签名的 CA，tls://、wss:// 和 quic:// 端点据此校验证书及其名称，取代系统根证书。每次拨号时读取。不能与 pin 同时设置。",
"A tls, wss or quic listener's certificate: a PEM file with it, followed by any intermediates, for nodes and proxies that check it with ca_file or the system's roots; with key_file. Read when the hub's member is applied, and again when it changes on disk (fit run -watch-certs). The hub's own certificate, in quic, when left out.": "tls、wss 或 quic 监听器的证书：PEM 文件，包含该证书及其后的中间证书，供用 ca_file 或系统根证书校验它的节点和代理使用；与 key_file 配合。在应用中心节点的配置成员时读取，磁盘上的文件变化时再次读取（fit run -watch-certs）。不设置时使用中心节点自己的证书（在 quic 中）。",
"Anything else about the token, for the pages; up to 1024 bytes.": "关于该令牌的其他说明，供页面显示；最多 1024 字节。",
"The members that first linked with the token, which no other token may link as: a tunnel's node/<name> or proxy/<name>, an LLM role's ID. Written by the listener; revoking the token frees them.": "首次用该令牌连接的成员，其他令牌不能再以它们的身份连接：隧道中为 node/<name> 或 proxy/<name>，LLM 中为角色的 ID。由监听方写入；吊销该令牌即释放它们。",
"The token the hub issued for this node or proxy, as fitt1.<id>.<secret>, which its pages, its Admin API module or fit token show once when they make it. Set token or password, not both.": "中心节点为本节点或代理签发的令牌，形如 fitt1.<id>.<secret>，由其页面、Admin API 模块或 fit token 在生成时显示一次。token 与 password 只设其一。",
"The shared password of the dialing role on the peer's listener, deprecated for token: a node dials with the peer's listen.node_password, a proxy with its listen.proxy_password, a hub with its listen.hub_password, or with its listen.password when it has none for the role. Taken in this release, with a warning on the peer's pages; refused in the next.": "拨号角色在对端监听上的共享密码，已弃用，请改用 token：节点使用对端的 listen.node_password，代理使用其 listen.proxy_password，中心节点使用其 listen.hub_password；对端没有该角色的密码时使用其 listen.password。本版本仍接受，对端页面会给出警告；下一版本将拒绝。",
"When set, the body of every frame on the links is encrypted with AES-256-GCM, and nodes and proxies need the same one: each frame is authenticated, so a tcp or ws listener on an address that is not a loopback one is allowed only with it. A link registered with a token derives its keys from the token and this, by HKDF; one with the password, from the password's PBKDF2. It applies to the links that open after it changes.": "设置后，链路上每一帧的消息体都用 AES-256-GCM 加密，节点和代理需要相同的值：每一帧都经过认证，因此只有设置了它，非回环地址上才允许 tcp 或 ws 监听。用令牌注册的链路由令牌与此值经 HKDF 派生密钥；用密码注册的链路由密码的 PBKDF2 派生。修改后对此后新建的链路生效。",
"When the token was made, in seconds since 1970.": "令牌的生成时间，自 1970 年起的秒数。",
"The hub's shared password: deprecated for token, taken by hubs of this release with a warning, and refused by the next.": "中心节点的共享密码：已弃用，请改用 token；本版本的中心节点仍接受并给出警告，下一版本将拒绝。",
"The password every node and proxy may register with, which they prove they know without sending it: deprecated for tokens, which give each member a credential of its own. Still taken in this release, with a warning on the pages while a member uses it; refused in the next. Without it, only tokens register.": "所有节点和代理都可用来注册的密码，它们无需发送即可证明自己知道它：已弃用，请改用令牌，令牌让每个成员拥有自己的凭据。本版本仍接受，有成员使用时页面会给出警告；下一版本将拒绝。不设置时只接受令牌注册。",
"When the token expires, in seconds since 1970: it is refused from then on, and the links it holds are closed. Never when left out or 0.": "令牌的过期时间，自 1970 年起的秒数：此后它将被拒绝，其持有的链路被关闭。不设置或为 0 时永不过期。",
"The tokens the node's listener issued, which hubs and proxies link with in place of a password: each its own credential, of no role, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The pages, the Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "节点监听签发的令牌，中心节点和代理用它代替密码连接：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，不绑定角色，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The tokens the proxy's listener issued, which hubs and nodes link with in place of a password: each its own credential, of no role, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The pages, the Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "代理监听签发的令牌，中心节点和节点用它代替密码连接：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，不绑定角色，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The tokens the hub's listener issued, which nodes and proxies link with in place of a password: each its own credential, of no role, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The pages, the Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "中心节点监听签发的令牌，节点和代理用它代替密码连接：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，不绑定角色，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The token the peer's listener issued for this role, as fitt1.<id>.<secret>, which the peer's pages, its Admin API module or fit token show once when they make it. Set token or password, not both.": "对端监听为本角色签发的令牌，形如 fitt1.<id>.<secret>，由对端的页面、Admin API 模块或 fit token 在生成时显示一次。token 与 password 只设其一。",
"The tokens the hub issued, which nodes and proxies register with in place of the password: each its own credential, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The hub's pages, its Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "中心节点签发的令牌，节点和代理用它代替密码注册：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由中心节点的页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The token's ID, 16 hex digits, the part of the token before its secret; unique among the listener's.": "令牌的 ID，16 位十六进制数，即令牌中密钥之前的部分；在同一监听的令牌中唯一。",
"The SHA-256 of the key the token's secret derives, in hex: what the listener checks a link's proof with, which cannot be used to link. The token itself is not kept.": "由令牌密钥派生出的密钥的 SHA-256，十六进制：监听方用它校验链路的证明，但它本身不能用来连接。令牌本身不保存。",
"What the token is for, as the pages list it: 1 to 64 characters.": "令牌的用途，页面列表中显示：1 到 64 个字符。",
"The workbench's assistant, a chat beside the console's pages that reads what fit does and drafts changes for a person to submit, calling the model APIs set here; off when left out, and then nothing is sent anywhere. Needs console. With a store, these settings are the first ones only: once the Settings page saves, the store's are used, keys included.": "工作台的助手：控制台页面旁的对话，读取 fit 的运行情况并起草修改，由人来提交；它调用此处设置的模型 API。不设置时关闭，此时不会向任何地方发送任何内容。需要 console。有 store 时，这些设置只是最初的设置：设置页一旦保存，便使用 store 中的设置（包括密钥）。",
"The model APIs the assistant may call, each by name. Their keys are not written here: the Settings page keeps them in admin.store, or api_key_env names a variable that holds one.": "助手可以调用的模型 API，各有名称。其密钥不写在这里：由设置页保存在 admin.store 中，或由 api_key_env 指定保存密钥的环境变量。",
"The provider and model the chat uses; the first model of the first provider when left out.": "对话使用的提供方与模型；不设置时为第一个提供方的第一个模型。",
"What a model call asks for: its output, temperature and thinking.": "模型调用的参数：输出、温度与思考。",
"Bounds on the assistant's conversations, tool calls and model answers; the defaults when left out.": "助手的对话、工具调用与模型回答的上限；不设置时使用默认值。",
"What of fit's logs may be sent to a model, and more of what is redacted before anything is.": "fit 的哪些日志可以发送给模型，以及发送前额外要脱敏的内容。",
"What each console user may have the assistant do, by user name; a user not listed has default_level.": "各控制台用户可以让助手做什么，按用户名设置；未列出的用户使用 default_level。",
"The level of a console user that users does not list: off, read (the read tools only), edit (also drafts on the open page, never submitted), propose (also proposals) or apply (also applies them). read when left out.": "users 未列出的控制台用户的级别：off、read（仅读取类工具）、edit（另可在打开的页面上起草，从不提交）、propose（另可提出变更提案）或 apply（另可应用提案）。不设置时为 read。",
"The provider's name, which default_model and the Settings page name it by: letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "提供方的名称，default_model 与设置页以此指代它：字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The API it speaks: anthropic (Messages), openai (Chat Completions), openai_responses (Responses), gemini (generateContent), azure_openai (Chat Completions of a deployment), ollama (/api/chat), openai_compatible (Chat Completions at any base_url, as vLLM, llama.cpp, DeepSeek or a gateway), or llm_proxy, this fit's own llm.proxy, reached on its api address, so that the assistant uses the mesh's models.": "它使用的 API：anthropic（Messages）、openai（Chat Completions）、openai_responses（Responses）、gemini（generateContent）、azure_openai（某个部署的 Chat Completions）、ollama（/api/chat）、openai_compatible（任意 base_url 上的 Chat Completions，如 vLLM、llama.cpp、DeepSeek 或网关），或 llm_proxy，即本 fit 自己的 llm.proxy，经其 api 地址访问，使助手使用网格中的模型。",
"The API's base URL, as https://api.openai.com/v1; the vendor's when left out, and needed for openai_compatible and azure_openai. Not for llm_proxy. A key is sent only over https, or to a loopback host.": "API 的基础 URL，如 https://api.openai.com/v1；不设置时为厂商的地址，openai_compatible 与 azure_openai 必须设置。llm_proxy 不使用。密钥只经 https 发送，或发送到回环主机。",
"The api-version of an azure_openai provider's calls, as 2024-10-21; needed for it, and for no other kind.": "azure_openai 提供方调用所带的 api-version，如 2024-10-21；该类型必须设置，其他类型不使用。",
"An environment variable holding the API key, read when a call is made; a key the Settings page keeps in the store comes first.": "保存 API 密钥的环境变量，在调用时读取；设置页保存在 store 中的密钥优先。",
"Headers sent with every call, as an organization or a gateway's own; not the key's headers, Host or the body's framing.": "每次调用都发送的请求头，如组织或网关自己的请求头；不能是密钥所用的请求头、Host 或请求体的分帧字段。",
"The models offered from this provider; the Settings page reads the provider's own list to add them.": "此提供方可用的模型；设置页可读取提供方自己的模型列表来添加。",
"How long a connect, TLS included, may take. 10s when left out.": "一次连接（含 TLS）可用的时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a call may wait for its answer to begin. 2m when left out.": "一次调用等待回答开始的最长时间。不设置时为 2m。",
"How long a streamed answer may go silent. 1m when left out.": "流式回答可以停顿的最长时间。不设置时为 1m。",
"The most one call may take, to the end of its answer. 10m when left out.": "一次调用直到回答结束的最长时间。不设置时为 10m。",
"How often a call is tried again when it failed before any of its answer was taken: the connect failed, or the API answered 408, 429, 500, 502, 503, 504 or 529. 2 when left out; 0 tries once.": "调用在尚未取得任何回答前失败时的重试次数：连接失败，或 API 返回 408、429、500、502、503、504 或 529。不设置时为 2；0 表示只尝试一次。",
"The model's ID, as the provider names it.": "模型的 ID，与提供方的命名相同。",
"The model's context window, in tokens; 0 or left out when not known.": "模型的上下文窗口，以 token 计；未知时为 0 或不设置。",
"Whether the model calls tools. On when left out.": "模型是否调用工具。不设置时为是。",
"A provider's name.": "某个提供方的名称。",
"The model's ID.": "模型的 ID。",
"The most tokens a model's answer may have. 4096 when left out or 0.": "模型回答的最多 token 数。不设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The sampling temperature; the model's own when left out.": "采样温度；不设置时使用模型自己的默认值。",
"How much a model that thinks before it answers may: off, low, medium or high, as its API takes it (an effort, or a budget of tokens). off when left out.": "会先思考再回答的模型可思考的程度：off、low、medium 或 high，按其 API 的方式传递（推理强度，或 token 预算）。不设置时为 off。",
"The most turns a conversation keeps, a user's message and the answer to it each. 40 when left out or 0.": "一次对话保留的最多轮数，每轮为用户的一条消息及其回答。不设置或为 0 时为 40。",
"The most tools an answer may call before the assistant stops it. 16 when left out or 0.": "一次回答在被助手停止前最多可调用的工具数。不设置或为 0 时为 16。",
"The most bytes of a tool's result handed to the model; a longer one is cut, and says so. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "交给模型的工具结果最多字节数；更长的结果会被截断并注明。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The most conversations kept for each user; one more removes the oldest. 50 when left out or 0.": "每个用户保留的最多对话数；再多一个时删除最早的。不设置或为 0 时为 50。",
"The most answers being made at once, across users; one more is refused until one ends. 4 when left out or 0.": "所有用户合计同时生成的最多回答数；超出的请求会被拒绝，直到有回答结束。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most tokens, in and out, one user's calls may take in a day, as the APIs count them. 1000000 when left out or 0.": "一个用户的调用一天内最多可用的 token 数（输入与输出合计，按 API 的计数）。不设置或为 0 时为 1000000。",
"The most bytes of one model answer as it streams in; a larger one is cut and fails. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次模型回答在流式接收时的最多字节数；更大的回答会被截断并失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The most entries the assistant's audit log keeps; one more removes the oldest. 1000 when left out or 0.": "助手审计日志保留的最多条目数；再多一条时删除最早的。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"An MCP server at /mcp on the console's address, for outside agents (Claude Code, Cursor, an SDK's client) to call the assistant's tools, read the config, the schema and the docs, and use the skills as prompts, with the MCP tokens users make on the workbench's MCP page. A token has its user's level, at most propose: what it proposes is applied only in the workbench. Off when left out.": "控制台地址上 /mcp 处的 MCP 服务器，供外部代理（Claude Code、Cursor、SDK 的客户端）凭用户在工作台 MCP 页上创建的 MCP 令牌调用助手的工具、读取配置、schema 与文档，并把技能用作提示词。令牌具有其用户的级别，最高为 propose：其提出的提案只在工作台中应用。不设置时关闭。",
"The addresses (as 127.0.0.1) and prefixes (as 10.0.0.0/8) MCP clients may call from; a token may narrow them further. Loopback only when left out.": "MCP 客户端可从中发起调用的地址（如 127.0.0.1）与前缀（如 10.0.0.0/8）；令牌可再加以收窄。不设置时仅限回环地址。",
"The most MCP tokens a console user may hold. 10 when left out or 0.": "每个控制台用户最多可持有的 MCP 令牌数。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"The longest a token may last, in days, from when it is made. 90 when left out or 0.": "令牌自创建起最长的有效天数。不设置或为 0 时为 90。",
"The most sessions a token keeps for clients of the protocol's versions before 2026-07-28, which open one with initialize; one more ends the one used least recently. 4 when left out or 0.": "对使用 2026-07-28 之前协议版本（以 initialize 打开会话）的客户端，每个令牌最多保留的会话数；再多一个时结束最久未用的会话。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"How long such a session is kept without a request. 1h when left out.": "此类会话在没有请求时保留的时长。不设置时为 1h。",
"The most bytes of a request's body, beside the console's own bound. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "请求体的最大字节数，在控制台自身的限制之外另加。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The most requests of one token served at once; one more is answered 429. 4 when left out or 0.": "同一令牌同时处理的最多请求数；再多一个时回答 429。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most requests of one token in a minute; past it they are answered 429 until the minute's share comes back. 120 when left out or 0.": "同一令牌每分钟的最多请求数；超过后回答 429，直到该分钟的额度恢复。不设置或为 0 时为 120。",
"Let the tools hand lines of fit's own log to the model, redacted. Off by default.": "允许工具把 fit 自身日志的行（脱敏后）交给模型。默认关闭。",
"Let the tools hand lines of the access log to the model, redacted. Off by default.": "允许工具把访问日志的行（脱敏后）交给模型。默认关闭。",
"Regular expressions (Go's syntax) whose matches are replaced in everything the tools hand a model, beside the keys, hashes, tokens and private keys that always are.": "正则表达式（Go 语法）：工具交给模型的所有内容中与之匹配的部分会被替换；密钥、哈希、令牌与私钥则始终会被替换。",
"A console user's name.": "控制台用户的名称。",
"What the user may have the assistant do: off, read, edit, propose or apply, each including the ones before it.": "该用户可以让助手做什么：off、read、edit、propose 或 apply，每一级都包含之前各级。",
"The media_library whose items are served.": "提供其条目的 media_library。",
"The part of the path before an item's ID: with /vod/films/, /vod/films/films/bbb/index.m3u8 is the playlist of the item films/bbb. /vod/<library>/ when left out.": "路径中位于条目 ID 之前的部分：前缀为 /vod/films/ 时，/vod/films/films/bbb/index.m3u8 是条目 films/bbb 的播放列表。不设置时为 /vod/<library>/。",
"The media_auth policy every request, playlist, segment, subtitle and file, must satisfy, play on the stream vod/<library>/<id>: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie. A playlist fetched with a token in its query names its playlists, segments and subtitles with the token too, so that a player that sends no header (Safari, ffmpeg) plays on. Everyone may play when left out.": "每个请求（播放列表、分片、字幕和文件）都必须满足的 media_auth 策略，对流 vod/<library>/<id> 执行 play：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie。查询中带 token 取得的播放列表，其列出的播放列表、分片和字幕也带上该 token，使不发送请求头的播放器（Safari、ffmpeg）能继续播放。不设置时所有人都可以播放。",
"The segments of index.m3u8: fmp4, fragmented MP4 for H.264, H.265, AV1, AAC and Opus, or ts, MPEG-TS for H.264, H.265, AAC and Opus, for older players. Either is played by its own name too, index.fmp4.m3u8 and index.ts.m3u8. fmp4 when left out.": "index.m3u8 的分片格式：fmp4，即分片 MP4，用于 H.264、H.265、AV1、AAC 和 Opus；或 ts，即 MPEG-TS，用于 H.264、H.265、AAC 和 Opus，供较旧的播放器使用。两者也都可以用各自的名称播放：index.fmp4.m3u8 和 index.ts.m3u8。不设置时为 fmp4。",
"About how long segments are: a file with video is cut at the keyframe nearest this after a segment's start, so set it to the keyframe interval the files were made with, or a multiple of it. 1s to 60s. 4s when left out.": "分片的大致时长：有视频的文件在距分片起点最接近此时长的关键帧处切分，因此应设为制作文件时的关键帧间隔或其倍数。1s 到 60s。不设置时为 4s。",
"The most memory the handler keeps of what it builds from the files, for the next request: how each is cut into segments, its playlists, its segments and subtitles, the least recently used dropped; and of what it is building. 256 MiB when left out or 0.": "处理器为后续请求保留的、由文件构建出的内容最多占用的内存：每个文件的分片切分、其播放列表、分片和字幕，最久未用的先淘汰；以及正在构建的内容。不设置或为 0 时为 256 MiB。",
"The largest segment: one that would be larger is cut at an earlier keyframe, or without one when there is none. 64 KiB to 1 GiB, and at most a quarter of max_cache_bytes. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "最大的分片：会超过它的分片在更早的关键帧处切分，没有关键帧时不按关键帧切分。64 KiB 到 1 GiB，且不超过 max_cache_bytes 的四分之一。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"Sent as Cache-Control with every playlist, segment, subtitle and file, so that a CDN keeps them, as \"public, max-age=86400\": they change only when their file does, which their ETag and Last-Modified say. None when left out.": "随每个播放列表、分片、字幕和文件发送的 Cache-Control，使 CDN 可以缓存它们，如 \"public, max-age=86400\"：它们只在其文件变化时才变化，这由其 ETag 和 Last-Modified 表明。不设置时不发送。",
"How long a request may wait for what it needs to be read and built on the library's file pool; past it the answer is 503. 30s when left out.": "请求等待其所需内容在媒体库文件池上读取和构建的最长时间；超过则回答 503。不设置时为 30s。",
"Channels: items of a media_library played into the hub as live streams, in order, shuffled, looped or on a schedule, paced by their timestamps, which run on from one item to the next; every egress plays them under its auth. A reload changes a channel in place, from its next item. At most 256. None when left out.": "频道：把 media_library 的条目作为直播流播放进 hub，按顺序、随机、循环或按排期，以其时间戳控制节奏，时间戳从一个条目延续到下一个；每种出口都在其 auth 之下播放它们。重新加载时就地修改频道，从其下一个条目起生效。最多 256 个。不设置时没有。",
"How long connecting may take, the RTMP handshake and publish or the SRT handshake. 10s when left out.": "连接最多可用多长时间：RTMP 握手与发布，或 SRT 握手。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long the first retry waits, after a target refuses, drops or cannot be reached, or the stream is not published; each retry waits twice the last, up to retry_max, and a push that has stayed up retry_max starts again from retry_min. 1s when left out.": "首次重试等待多久：在目标拒绝、断开或无法连接，或流尚未发布之后；每次重试等待上一次的两倍，直至 retry_max，持续连接达 retry_max 的推流再次从 retry_min 开始。不设置时为 1s。",
"How much of the items is read ahead of what is sent, on the library's file pool, so that a slow disk does not stall the channel and the next item follows the last without a gap. 500ms to 1m. 3s when left out.": "在已发送内容之前预读多少条目内容（在媒体库的文件池上），使慢速磁盘不会让频道停顿，并让下一个条目紧接上一个、没有间隙。500ms 到 1m。不设置时为 3s。",
"Items started at set times, in time_zone, cutting what plays: daily, on days of the week, or once. A slot whose time has passed while its item would still be playing, when the channel starts, is joined where it would be. Between slots the channel plays items, or goes quiet without them. At most 1000.": "在 time_zone 中的设定时间开始的条目，打断正在播放的内容：每天、每周的某几天，或仅一次。频道启动时，若某时段的时间已过而其条目仍在播放期内，则从它应在的位置加入。时段之间频道播放 items，没有 items 时保持安静。最多 1000 个。",
"Outside RTMP or SRT servers, as a CDN's ingest, that streams of the hub are relayed to, each reconnected with backoff when it drops; a channel's own push lists its own. A reload keeps a target whose stream and url are unchanged connected. At most 256 in all. None when left out.": "流被转推到的外部 RTMP 或 SRT 服务器，例如 CDN 的接入点，每个在断开后以退避方式重连；频道自己的 push 列出它自己的目标。重新加载时，流与 url 都未变的目标保持连接。总共最多 256 个。不设置时没有。",
"Outside servers the channel is relayed to, as streaming's push names them, their stream being the channel's.": "频道被转推到的外部服务器，写法同 streaming 的 push，其流就是该频道。",
"Play items again from the first once the last has played. With loop off, the channel goes quiet after the last, staying published, until its next slot, or until the Admin API stops and starts it, which plays the list again from the first. On when left out.": "播完最后一个条目后从第一个重新播放。关闭 loop 时，频道在最后一个条目之后保持安静但仍处于发布状态，直到其下一个时段，或直到 Admin API 停止并再次启动它，这会从第一个条目重新播放列表。不设置时打开。",
"The IANA time zone the schedule's times are in, as Asia/Shanghai or Local for the host's. UTC when left out.": "排期时间所用的 IANA 时区，例如 Asia/Shanghai，或用 Local 表示主机的时区。不设置时为 UTC。",
"The ID of the library's item the slot plays, from its start.": "该时段从头播放的媒体库条目 ID。",
"The IDs of the library's items the channel plays, in this order unless order is shuffle, and again from the first when loop is on; between the schedule's slots too. An item the library does not hold, or cannot serve, is skipped. At most 10000.": "频道播放的媒体库条目 ID，除非 order 为 shuffle，否则按此顺序播放，loop 打开时播完再从第一个开始；在排期的时段之间也播放它们。媒体库没有或无法提供的条目会被跳过。最多 10000 个。",
"The longest a retry waits. 30s when left out.": "一次重试最长等待多久。不设置时为 30s。",
"The media_library the channel's items are of.": "频道的条目所属的 media_library。",
"The most bytes read ahead and not yet sent, whatever read_ahead says, at least 1 MiB; a sample larger than it ends its item. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "已预读而尚未发送的最多字节数，不论 read_ahead 如何，至少 1 MiB；大于它的采样会结束其条目。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The order items are played in: sequence, as listed, or shuffle, every item once in a random order each time round. sequence when left out.": "条目的播放顺序：sequence 按列出的顺序，shuffle 每轮以随机顺序把每个条目播放一次。不设置时为 sequence。",
"The rendition played of each item, by its name, as 720p; one an item lacks plays its best instead. The rendition with the most pixels, the highest bit rate among equals, when left out.": "每个条目播放哪个版本，按其名称，例如 720p；缺少该版本的条目播放其最好的版本。不设置时为像素最多的版本，像素相同时取码率最高者。",
"The stream of the hub relayed, as live/cam or a channel's name. Required in streaming's push; a channel's push targets relay the channel.": "被转推的 hub 中的流，例如 live/cam 或某个频道的名称。在 streaming 的 push 中必填；频道的推流目标转推的就是该频道。",
"The stream the channel publishes into the hub, as tv/films: every egress of the streaming role plays it by that path, under its auth, as rtmp://host/tv/films or /hls/tv/films/index.m3u8. Parts of letters, digits, '.', '_', '~' and '-', split at '/'. A channel renamed is another channel: the old one ends.": "频道发布进 hub 的流，例如 tv/films：流媒体角色的每种出口都按这个路径、在其 auth 之下播放它，例如 rtmp://host/tv/films 或 /hls/tv/films/index.m3u8。由字母、数字、'.'、'_'、'~' 和 '-' 组成的若干段，以 '/' 分隔。改名后的频道是另一个频道：旧的会结束。",
"The target's name in the Admin API and the metrics, unique among the push targets. The stream's name and the target's place among the stream's when left out, as tv/films#1.": "目标在 Admin API 与指标中的名称，在所有推流目标中唯一。不设置时为流的名称加上该目标在此流的目标中的序号，例如 tv/films#1。",
"When the slot starts, in the channel's time_zone: HH:MM or HH:MM:SS every day; days of the week before it, as mon,wed,fri 20:00 or sat-sun 09:30; or a date, as 2026-12-31 23:00, once.": "时段何时开始，使用频道的 time_zone：HH:MM 或 HH:MM:SS 表示每天；前面加上星期几表示每周这几天，例如 mon,wed,fri 20:00 或 sat-sun 09:30；或写日期表示仅一次，例如 2026-12-31 23:00。",
"Where the stream is sent: rtmp://host[:port]/app/stream, or rtmps://, publishing to an RTMP server as a CDN's ingest takes it; or srt://host:port?streamid=...&passphrase=...&latency=ms, calling an SRT listener with MPEG-TS. The URL is a secret, its stream key with it: the Admin API and the logs show its scheme, host and app alone.": "流发送到哪里：rtmp://host[:port]/app/stream 或 rtmps://，像 CDN 的接入点那样发布到 RTMP 服务器；或 srt://host:port?streamid=...&passphrase=...&latency=ms，以 MPEG-TS 呼叫 SRT 监听端。URL 是机密，连同其中的推流密钥：Admin API 与日志只显示其协议、主机和 app。"
};
